  <para style="h">Yoob</para>
  <para style="toc1">Yoob</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yoob</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yob</para>
  <para style="mt1">Yoob</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JOB 1" />
  <para style="s1">Abemiso Ikọ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 1:1" />Awodeen keed a-akekereke Yoob amaaba ke abio Us. Awo ami amaanana ndo anyʌñ anen; anye amaabaak Abasi anyʌñ asọọn idiọọk. <verse eid="JOB 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 1:2" />Anye akenie nditọ ideen itiaba ye nditọ ibaan ita, <verse eid="JOB 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 1:3" />anyʌñ anie edọñ tọsịn itiaba (7,000), kamel tọsịn ita (3,000), ñyaaraenañ ikie ition (500) ye dọñki ikie ition (500), ye uwak nditọufọk. Anye akedo ataa ekamba awo ke atu mbon Usakkautịn.<verse eid="JOB 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 1:4" />Nditọ ideen amọ ekesidia usọrọ usen emana ammọ ke atʌñ ammọ, enyʌñ esikoot nditọeka ammọ ibaan ita ebo edikeene edia enyʌñ enwọñ ye ammọ. <verse eid="JOB 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 1:5" />Ke ini usọrọ ami amaakweeñe, Yoob ayaanam ndutʌm adidiọñ ammọ nọ esana. Ke ataa ubakusen, anye amaasifọp uwa anọ ammọ keedekeed, sia anye akere abo, “Akeme adido nditọ mmi e-enam idiọọkñkpọ enyʌñ esuuñọ Abasi ke isọñ esịd ammọ.” Ami akesido ndutʌm Yoob ke ini ke ini.<verse eid="JOB 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 1:6" />Usen keed mme enyere<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ke Hibru awuọñọ nditọ ideen Abasi</char></note> emaeben idem ammọ edi ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Setan<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ke Hibru Setan ado awo utọk</char></note> ñko amaanyʌñ asaña ye ammọ adi. <verse eid="JOB 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 1:7" /><char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Setan ate, “Uke ke afo ato adi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 1:7">Setan amaabọọrọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ate, “Nto ke adiyooñ ke afịd ederimbod, ñkaa iso ñnyʌñ ntịmme edem.”<verse eid="JOB 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 1:8" />Ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabọọrọ Setan ate, “Nte afo ametʌm ase awo mmi Yoob? Ibaaha awo mfen a-abaaha nte anye ke afịd iso isọñ; anye anana ndo anyʌñ anen, awo a-abaaha Abasi anyʌñ asọọn se idiọọk.”<verse eid="JOB 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 1:9" />Setan amaabọọrọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ate, “Ado nte Yoob abaak Abasi ke unana ntak? <verse eid="JOB 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 1:10" />Nte afo usịnne akọ ukanna anye ye ufọk amọ ukʌk ye afịd se anye anie? Afo amediọñ ubọkutom amọ, tutu afịd ufene mme inie amọ etaara eyọhọ afịd isọñ. <verse eid="JOB 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 1:11" />Ado idahami nyan ubọk nyʌñ biat afịd se anye anie, ndin ke akpanikọ anye ayausuuñọ fiin ke iso mfo.”<verse eid="JOB 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 1:12" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Setan ate, “Afọn, ndin, afịd ñkpọ se anye anie esịne ke adudu mfo, ado amaado anye ke idem amọ kuuyak nnuunubọk mfo atuuk anye.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 1:12">Ndin Setan amaadakka akpọñ iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.<verse eid="JOB 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 1:13" />Usen keed idaha nditọ ideen ye nditọ ibaan Yoob ekesʌkkọ edia usọrọ enyʌñ enwọñ ukọd ke atʌñ ayịneka ammọ awodeen andikikpon ñkan, <verse eid="JOB 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 1:14" />isʌñutom keed amaadibo Yoob ate, “Ñyaaraenañ ekesʌk efʌñ isọñ, mme dọñki ekenyʌñ esʌk eta mbid ekpere ammọ, <verse eid="JOB 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 1:15" />mbon Seba emaenwana ye ammọ enyʌñ emuum ammọ. Ammọ emaekama akañkañ ewoot afịd nditọufọk mfo, ndin ami ndo ukweeñe awo se ikibọkkọ ifeghe iditañ unọọ fiin!”<verse eid="JOB 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 1:16" />Naña anye asʌkkọ akaiso atañ ikọ ado, isʌñutom mfen amaadi adibo anye ate, “Ikañ Abasi amaato anyọñ adifọp mme edọñ ye mme nditọufọk mfo, ndin ami ikpọọñ mbọkkọ adiditañ unọọ fiin!”<verse eid="JOB 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 1:17" />Idaha anye akesʌkkọ aka iso atañ ikọ, isʌñutom mfen amaadi adibo anye ate, “Mbon Kaldi emaetʌm idem ammọ edọñ ke mbakka ita ekanna mme kamel mfo ekʌk enyʌñ ekoono ammọ enyọñọ. Ammọ emaekama akañkañ ewoot nditọufọk mfo, ndin ami ndo ukweeñe awo a-akebọkkọke aditañ unọọ fiin!”<verse eid="JOB 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 1:18" />Naña anye akesʌkkọ akaiso atañ ikọ ado, isʌñutom mfen amaadi adibo ate, “Idaha nditọ mfo ideen ye ibaan ekesʌkkọ edia usọrọ enyʌñ enwọñ mmịn ke atʌñ ayịneka ammọ awodeen andikpon ñkan afịd ammọ, <verse eid="JOB 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 1:19" />ekamba adiwad afịm ayobio amaato akpautatan adi inikeed-inikeed adituai ndibene ufọk ado naña inaañ. Ufọk ado amaaduọ atọ afịd ammọ awot, ndin ami ndo ukweeñe awo a-akebọkkọke nọ aditañ unọọ fiin!”<verse eid="JOB 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 1:20" />Ke adikop ami, Yoob amaadakka ada anyʌñ awai afọñ amọ, anyʌñ akwaat ided iwuod amọ. Akema anye amaaduọ ke isọñ ke ukpono <verse eid="JOB 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 1:21" />anyʌñ abo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 1:21">“Ami ñkesaña ifed ñwuọ ke idịb eka mmi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 1:21">ifed ñko ke ami ndiisaña ñnyọñ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 1:21">
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akenọọ, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> anyʌñ abọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 1:21">yak itooro anie anyịñ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.”<verse eid="JOB 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 1:22" />Ke afịd mme ñkpọ ami, Yoob ikinamma idiọọkñkpọ ke adibiom Abasi ikpe.<verse eid="JOB 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter eid="JOB 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JOB 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 2:1" />Ke usen mfen mme enyere emaedi ediben idem ammọ ñwọt <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, ndin Setan amaanyʌñ akeene ammọ adi adiben idem amọ ñkeene ndiwọt anye. <verse eid="JOB 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 2:2" />Ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Setan ate, “Uke ke afo ato di?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 2:2">Setan amaabọọrọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ate, “Nto ke adiyooñ ke afịd ekondo, adika iso ñnyʌñ ntịmme edem.”<verse eid="JOB 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 2:3" />Ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Setan ate, “Afo ametʌm ase ñkpọ abaña awo mmi Yoob? Ibaaha awo ndomokeed ke ederimbod a-abitte anye; anye anana ndo anyʌñ anen, awo a-anieghe mbaak Abasi anyʌñ asọọn idiọọkñkpọ. Anye a-akpono idem amọ anyʌñ anam akpanikọ, akpesʌkado afo akendọọñọ miin adisobo anye ke unana ntak.”<verse eid="JOB 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 2:4" />Setan amaabọọrọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ate, “Ikpa ke iwuod ikpa! Awo ayaanọ afịd se anye anie ke ntak uwem amọ. <verse eid="JOB 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 2:5" />Ado idahami nyan ubọk mfo tuuk abʌkidem amọ ye akpọ amọ, ayaakịt ke akpanikọ ke anye idiitreke usuuñọ fiin ke iso mfo.”<verse eid="JOB 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 2:6" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Setan ate, “Afọn, ndin, anye usịne fiin ke ubọk; ado inaaha afo atuuk uwem amọ.”<verse eid="JOB 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 2:7" />Ndin Setan amaadakka ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akaa akenam inia ata Yoob afịd idem tọọñọ ke ukod tutu akewuọ atịñ iwuod. <verse eid="JOB 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 2:8" />Ndin Yoob amaaben mbomo usiọñ keed anyʌñ akwat idem amọ idaha anye asuuhọ atie ke ntọñ.<verse eid="JOB 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 2:9" />Anwaan amọ amaabo anye ate, “Nte afo asʌk adaada ke ñkponoidem mfo? Suuñọ Abasi nyʌñ kpa!”<verse eid="JOB 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 2:10" />Anye amaabọọrọ, “Afo atañ ikọ nte ndisịme awonwaan. Nte ñnyịn isʌk iyem adibọ nti ñkpọ nto Abasi, iyemme ibọ mfịna?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 2:10">Ke afịd ñkpọ ami, Yoob ikinamma idiọọkñkpọ ndomokeed ke ikọ se anye aketañ.<verse eid="JOB 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 2:11" />Ke ini mme ufan Yoob ita, Elifas awo Teman, Bildad awo Suu ye Sofa awo Naama, ekekoppo afịd mme mfịna se ikiwuọñọ anye, ammọ emaeto ufọk ammọ ekesoobo keed enyʌñ ebiere adikiseeme ye anye ñnyʌñ ndọñ anye esịd. <verse eid="JOB 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 2:12" />Idaha ammọ ekedaaha ekịt anye ke anyan usʌñ, ammọ ikidiọọñọke anye aba; ammọ emaetọọñọ etua ayịd ebọọñ ñkpọ, ñko ammọ emaenyʌñ ewai afọñ ammọ enyʌñ esiime ntọñ ke iwuod ammọ. <verse eid="JOB 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 2:13" />Akema ammọ emaesuuk etie ye anye ke isọñ ke usen itiaba ye akonayio itiaba. Awo ndomokeed ikitañña ikọ ndomokeed ye anye, sia ammọ emaekịt naña ndutʌhọ ye ufen amọ akekpon.<verse eid="JOB 2:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JOB 3" />
  <para style="s1">Yoob Atañ Ikọ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 3:1" />Ke ami amaakeboiyo, Yoob amaakʌppọ inua amọ anyʌñ asueñ usen emana amọ. <verse eid="JOB 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 3:2" />Yoob amaabo:<verse eid="JOB 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 3:3" />“Yak usen a-ami ñkemanake akịt nsobo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:3">ye akonayio a-akebooho, ‘E-eyommo ayịn!’<verse eid="JOB 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 3:4" />Usen ado, yak anye akappa ado ekịm;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:4">Yak Abasi ke anyọñ akuuse ñkpọ abaña anye;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:4">yak unwana ndomokeed akuunyʌñ asakka anọọ anye.<verse eid="JOB 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 3:5" />Yak ndobo ye akpọsọñ ekịm amaana aben anye;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:5">yak ntọñanyọñ adoro afʌk anye;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:5">yak ekịm afʌk anye.<verse eid="JOB 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 3:6" />Akonayio ado, yak ataa ekịm amʌm anye;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:6">yak ke ebat anye esịn ke atu mme usen ke isua</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:6">me adibat anye nsịn ke afiọñ ndomokeed.<verse eid="JOB 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 3:7" />Yak akonayio ado ado ada;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:7">yak awo akuukop ñkpo idaara ato anye.<verse eid="JOB 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 3:8" />Yak mbon se isuuñọ mme usen esuuñọ usen ado,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:8">mbon e-ebeeñeke idem adidemme idiọọk unam mmọọñ.<verse eid="JOB 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 3:9" />Yak mme ntantaafiọñ ubakusen amọ ekappa ekịm;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:9">yak anye atie abet unwana usen ke ikpu-ikpu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:9">akuunyʌñ akịt akpa unwana usiere,<verse eid="JOB 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 3:10" />sia anye imiikibette usʌñ idịb imbaha miin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:10">adidịp mfịna ke anyen mmi.<verse eid="JOB 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 3:11" />“Ntak ami mmeñkekpaaha ke emana-a,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:11">mmeñkenyʌññọ ñkpa naña ami ñkewuọhọ ke idịb-e?<verse eid="JOB 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 3:12" />Ntak ake mme edọñ ekebaaha edimbọọ miin-e</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:12">ye mme eba se ñwọp-ọ?<verse eid="JOB 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 3:13" />Idahami, ami ñkpenaana nduọk adudu ke emem;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:13">Ñkpedaiya idab ñnyʌñ nduọk adudu<verse eid="JOB 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 3:14" />ye mme ndidem ye mme andikara ederimbod,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:14">e-ekebọppọ mme itie enọ idem ammọ e-ebaaha idahami ke ñwuudo,<verse eid="JOB 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 3:15" />ye mme mbọọñ e-ekenieñeke kold,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:15">e-ekeyọhọke ufọk ammọ ye silfa.<verse eid="JOB 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 3:16" />Me nsoo ikido ntak ekedindịppe miin ke isọñ nte adukpo nsekayịn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:16">nte nsekayịn a-mmiikikịtte utịn usen?<verse eid="JOB 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 3:17" />Do ke mbon ibak etre afanekọñ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:17">kpa do ñko ke mbon ekpaaha mba inieghe ukeme ndin eba ke nduọkadudu.<verse eid="JOB 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 3:18" />Mbon ñkpakọb ekop inem ke adiduọk adudu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:18">Ammọ ikoppo aba nduaiya ñkpo akpeme ifʌn.<verse eid="JOB 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 3:19" />Ntək awo ye ikpọ awo eba do,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:19">mme ifʌn enyʌñ enie ñkpọkñyak ke ubọk mme andinie ammọ.<verse eid="JOB 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 3:20" />“Nsoo inam eben unwana enọ mbon e-ebaaha ke ukuud,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:20">enyʌñ eben uwem enọ mbon se ukpọñ ammọ adodoro,<verse eid="JOB 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 3:21" />ye mbon se ñkpa awʌt ado ñkpa idiighe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:21">e-eyemme ñkpa ekan ndedịbe ñkpọuto,<verse eid="JOB 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 3:22" />e-eyọhọke ye inemesịd</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:22">enyʌñ edaara ke ammọ emaewuọ udi?<verse eid="JOB 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 3:23" />Ntak e-enọọhọ awo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:23">u-usʌñ amọ adooho ndedịbe uwem-e,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:23">ake Abasi akʌkkọ anye akanna?<verse eid="JOB 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 3:24" />Sia mmịm mmi akappa ado ndidia usen mmi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:24">ñkuun mmi anyʌñ anwañña awuọ nte mmọọñ.<verse eid="JOB 3:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 3:25" />Se ami ñkebaak adi adinsịme miin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:25">se ami ñkesifeghe anyʌñ aditịppe annọ miin.<verse eid="JOB 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 3:26" />Ami nnieghe emem, ñnyʌññọ nnie ndobuyio;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:26">Nnieghe nduọkadudu, ado afanekọñ kpọd ke nnie.”<verse eid="JOB 3:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JOB 4" />
  <para style="s1">Elifas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 4:1" />Ndin Elifas awo Teman amaabọọrọ:<verse eid="JOB 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 4:2" />Adieke awo ayemme adineme nneme ye afo, ayaanana ime?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:2">Ado anie awo akeme aditre aditañ ikọ?<verse eid="JOB 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 4:3" />Kere baña naña afo akenọọ uwak awo item,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:3">anyʌñ anam mme mmeem-mmeem ubọk esọọñ.<verse eid="JOB 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 4:4" />Ikọ mfo amaasọọñọ mbon e-eketuakka ukod;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:4">afo amesọọñọ mme edọñ e-edutọọrọke.<verse eid="JOB 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 4:5" />Ado idahami, mfịna adusịm fiin, ndin afo amekop umiọñ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:5">anye utuuk fiin idem, ndin esịd uduọ fiin.<verse eid="JOB 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 4:6" />Nte uteeñe a-afo anieghe ikpidooho nsọọñọidem mfo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:6">nte nti usʌñ uwem mfo ikpinyʌññọ ido idodanyen mfo?<verse eid="JOB 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 4:7" />Kere baña idahami: Akenaanam anie ado idueghe, ado atak?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:7">Ke mmọọ ke ekesobo mme ndinen awo?<verse eid="JOB 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 4:8" />Naña ami nda ñkịt, mbon e-etọọhọ ndiọi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:8">ye mbon e-etọọhọ mfịna edọk kpasʌk ado.<verse eid="JOB 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 4:9" />Inweek Abasi anam ammọ etak;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:9">ke ayobio iyadesịd amọ ammọ ibaaha aba.<verse eid="JOB 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 4:10" />Mme ekpe e-ekeme edikuun enyʌñ enyamma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:10">kpayeado eded ñkpọsọñ ekpe ebeghe.<verse eid="JOB 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 4:11" />Ekpe akpa anọ unana ndidia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:11">ndin esuan nditọ uman ekpe.<verse eid="JOB 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 4:12" />Emaeditañ ikọ ennọ miin ke ndịbe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:12">utọñ mmi anyʌñ akop anye nte adu.<verse eid="JOB 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 4:13" />Ke ufọọd idiọọk ndab ke akonayio,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:13">ke ini akpọsọñ idab amaaben mme awo,<verse eid="JOB 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 4:14" />ndịk ye ñnyeñidem ammʌm miin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:14">anyʌñ anam afịd mme akpọ mmi enyeñ.<verse eid="JOB 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 4:15" />Sịbidịd keed amaasaña aboiyo ke iso mmi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:15">ndin ided ke idem mmi emaenyʌñ edaaña eda.<verse eid="JOB 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 4:16" />Anye amaatuak ada,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:16">ado ami ñkikanna ntañ se anye akedo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 4:16">Mbid ñkpọ amanda miin ke iso,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:16">ndin ami mmaakop uyio naña atañ usʌk-usʌk:<verse eid="JOB 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 4:17" />Nte awo akeme adinen ñkan Abasi?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:17">Nte idem akpọsọñ awodeen akeme adisana ñkan Andibod anye?<verse eid="JOB 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 4:18" />Adieke Abasi imiinieghe mbuọdidem ke idem nditọufọk amọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:18">adieke anye akịtte ndudue anọ mme enyere amọ,<verse eid="JOB 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 4:19" />kap se ndin mbon e-edʌñọke ke mme ufọk mbad,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:19">esịnne mme itiad idakisọñ ammọ ke ntọñ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:19">ake esọppọ enuak ammọ ekan naña ekpenuak ñkakad!<verse eid="JOB 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 4:20" />Ke ufọọd ubakusen ye ndubi, ammọ ewuudo ebono mbai-mbai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:20">awo ikịtte ammọ, ammọ etak ke nsi-nsi.<verse eid="JOB 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 4:21" />Nte awo idʌttọ mme idʌk a-abọppọ mme atayad ammọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:21">nọ ato do ammọ ekpa ke unana ndadmmana aniọñ?<verse eid="JOB 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter eid="JOB 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JOB 5" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 5:1" />Koot adieke afo ayemme adikoot, ado anie awo iduubọọrọ fiin?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:1">Anie ke atu mme ndisana awo ke afo uduukanna anyen use?<verse eid="JOB 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 5:2" />Iyadesịd awowot ndisịme awo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:2">ñko ufịb mme idiọọkesịd anyʌñ awot mmeem-mmeem awo.<verse eid="JOB 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 5:3" />Ami ke idem mmi mmekịt naña ndisịme anie adʌñ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:3">ado ikpeenekekpeene emaesuuñọ ufọk amọ.<verse eid="JOB 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 5:4" />Nditọ amọ enyọọñ usʌñ ekpọñ adinyaaña,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:4">enuak ammọ ke esob ke ini andibededem imiibaaha.<verse eid="JOB 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 5:5" />Awo abiọọñ akweeñe idọk amọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:5">asio anye ato ke ufọọd ñkukịm,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 5:5">awo nsaditọñ anyʌñ ayem imọ amọ.<verse eid="JOB 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 5:6" />Sia nsọñọñkpọ itooho ntan iwuọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:6">mfịna ñko itịppeke ito isọñ.<verse eid="JOB 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 5:7" />Ado awo amana anọ ukuud</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:7">kpa naña nduwai ikañ afuurọ adọọk anyọñ.<verse eid="JOB 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 5:8" />“Ado, akpedo ñkudo fiin, ñkpekap ñkpe Abasi ubọk;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:8">ñkpaayaak afịd mbaba mmi nnịm anye ke iso.<verse eid="JOB 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 5:9" />Anye anam mme utịppeñkpọ ñkpaidem e-eyaññake awo ifiọk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:9">mme utịppeñkpọ a-awo imiikanna ibat.<verse eid="JOB 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 5:10" />Anye anam edịm adep anọ isọñ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:10">anyʌñ adọñ mmọọñ akaa abioinwañ.<verse eid="JOB 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 5:11" />Anye adịppe awo usuuk itie ke anyọñ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:11">anyʌñ abenne mbon e-efʌhọke asịn ke ifuuro.<verse eid="JOB 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 5:12" />Anye abiat uduak mbon ñkara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:12">mbaak ubọk ammọ adinie uforo.<verse eid="JOB 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 5:13" />Anye amʌm mbon aniọñ ke ñkara ammọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:13">ndin uduak mbon abiaña aboiyo afep.<verse eid="JOB 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 5:14" />Ekịm afʌk ammọ ke uweemeayio;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:14">ke ufọọd uweemeayio ammọ efiọññọ ubọk nte ke akonayio.<verse eid="JOB 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 5:15" />Anye anyaaña mbon unana asio ke akañkañ a-asịneke ammọ ke inua;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:15">anye anyaaña ammọ asio ke ubọk ñkpọsọñ awo.<verse eid="JOB 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 5:16" />Anam uweene anie idodanyen,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:16">ukwañ ikpe anyʌñ akʌp inua.<verse eid="JOB 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 5:17" />“Afọfọn anọ awo ake Abasi adʌttọ utọñ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:17">kuusịn ndin item Abasi Andikoñ Ñkan.<verse eid="JOB 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 5:18" />Sia anye anọ unan, anye anyʌñ asọbọ unan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:18">anye anọmọ, ado ubọk amọ ñko anyʌñ akọk.<verse eid="JOB 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 5:19" />Ke mfịna itiokeed anye ayausio fiin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:19">ñko ke itiaba idiọọkñkpọ iduusịmme.<verse eid="JOB 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 5:20" />Ke ini akañ anye ayaufak fiin asio ke ñkpa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:20">ke ini ekọñ ñko ayaufak asio ke iso akañkañ.<verse eid="JOB 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 5:21" />Ke awo amiaha edeme, anye ayaukpeme fiin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:21">uboho unyʌñ udịkke ke ini afanekọñ adiighe.<verse eid="JOB 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 5:22" />Afo ayaasak nsobo ye akañ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:22">uduunyʌññọ unie ndịk ubaña ndiọi unam.<verse eid="JOB 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 5:23" />Sia afo ayaanie edioomo ye mme itiad inwañ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:23">ndin ndiọi unam eyaeba emem-emem ye afo.<verse eid="JOB 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 5:24" />Afo ayaadiọọñọ ke atayad mfo anie nsọọñọnda;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:24">afo ayaabat mme inie mfo anyʌñ akịt ke ñkpọ ndomokeed isoppo.<verse eid="JOB 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 5:25" />Afo ayaadiọọñọ ke nditọ mfo eyaewak,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:25">ubon mfo enyʌñ ewak nte mbid isọñ.<verse eid="JOB 5:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 5:26" />Afo ayaakaa udi ke ataa usọñ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:26">nte abek abakpa e-ekoonoke ke akem ini.<verse eid="JOB 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 5:27" />“Ñnyịn imiduuñọ ñkpọ ami, inyʌñ ikịt ke ado akpanikọ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:27">Ntoro kop ikọ ami nyʌñ ben nam ñkpọ nọ idem mfo.”<verse eid="JOB 5:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JOB 6" />
  <para style="s1">Yoob</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 6:1" />Ndin Yoob amaabọọrọ ate:<verse eid="JOB 6:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 6:2" />“Ekpekap eben ndutʌhọ mmi edot ke udomoñkpọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:2">enyʌñ eben afịd ukuud mmi edot ke udomoñkpọ!”<verse eid="JOB 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 6:3" />Ke akpanikọ anye ayaadoppo akan ntan inyañ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:3">mmese ke mmaasọp inua ke ikọ mmi.<verse eid="JOB 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 6:4" />Mme idañ Andikoñ Ñkan eñwʌhọ miin ke idem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:4">sịbidịd mmi anwọñ ibọkñkpa ammọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:4">mme ñkpọ ndịk Abasi edi ekọñ ye ami.<verse eid="JOB 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 6:5" />Nte dọñki ikọd akeme aditie abiọọñ ke ini anye amaakịt mbid,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:5">me abaakenañ akeme aditua abiọọñ ke ini anye amaanie ikịm?<verse eid="JOB 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 6:6" />Nte e-ekeme adidia ibe ndidia i-inʌñ imiibaaha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:6">me nte inem a-aba ke mmọọñ malo?<verse eid="JOB 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 6:7" />Ami mmesịn adituuk anye;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:7">utọ ndidia ado anam ami ndọñọ.<verse eid="JOB 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 6:8" />“O, nọ ami ndiibọ ebeeñe mmi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:8">nọ Abasi akpekap anam idodanyen mmi asu,<verse eid="JOB 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 6:9" />nọ Abasi anyịmme adinnuak miin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:9">aditat ubọk amọ ñnyʌñ ñkpịkke uwem mmi mfep!<verse eid="JOB 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 6:10" />Ndin ami ñkpesʌk ñkaka iso nnie idọñesịd ami,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:10">idadesịd mmi ke ananautịd ubiak,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:10">ke ami ñkikañña mme ikọ Andisana Ñkan.<verse eid="JOB 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 6:11" />“Nsoo inweek ke ami nnie, a-anamma yak ami nsʌk nnie idodanyen?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:11">Nsoo ñkukịd, akpenam yak ami nnie ime?<verse eid="JOB 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 6:12" />Ado nte ami mmenie inweek se itiad anie?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:12">Me abʌkidem mmi ado brọns?<verse eid="JOB 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 6:13" />Nte ami mmenie adudu ndomokeed adinwam idem mmi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:13">idahami a-adooho emaebịne uforo esio ke idem mmi?”<verse eid="JOB 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 6:14" />“Awo ndomokeed i-imiiwọttọ ufan amọ mfọnido</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:14">asịn mbaak Abasi Andikoñ Ñkan.<verse eid="JOB 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 6:15" />Ado nditọeka mmi ideen idooho se enie ibededem nte mme asoosio ini idịm,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:15">nte mme idịm e-efegheke etọ eduọiyọ<verse eid="JOB 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 6:16" />ke ini ais atarake anam ammọ ebre</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:16">anyʌñ ayọọk nte sino atarake,<verse eid="JOB 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 6:17" />ado atre adifeghe ke ini ndaayio,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:17">ñko ke ini ufiob ammọ esat ke mme usʌñ mmọọñ ammọ.<verse eid="JOB 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 6:18" />Udịm mbon ukaisañ ewakka ekpọñ mme usʌñ ammọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:18">ammọ eboiyo ekedʌk anaan enyʌñ esobo.<verse eid="JOB 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 6:19" />Udịm mbon ukaisañ Tema eyem mmọọñ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:19">mme akaisañ udua Seba eyem ye idodanyen.<verse eid="JOB 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 6:20" />Ukuud amaasịm ammọ, sia ammọ emaenie mbuọdidem;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:20">ammọ ewuọ itie ado, idodanyen ammọ akpa mfʌhọ.<verse eid="JOB 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 6:21" />Idahami, ndufo ñko emewọt ke ndufo inieghe unwam se enọọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:21">ndufo emekịt ñkpọ ndịk enyʌñ ekop ndịk.<verse eid="JOB 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 6:22" />Akenaanam ami mmebo, ‘Nọ ñkpọ ke iwuod mmi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:22">dat inie mfo kpe isob iwuod mmi,<verse eid="JOB 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 6:23" />mfak miin sio ke ubọk asua mmi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:23">ñnyaaña miin sio ke ubọk mbon isọñesịd’?<verse eid="JOB 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 6:24" />“Ñkpeep miin, ndin ami ñyaadop uyio;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:24">ñwọt miin itie nte ami ndue.<verse eid="JOB 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 6:25" />Ikọ akpanikọ asibiak die awo!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:25">Ado nsoo ke ikọ mfaaña mfo awọt?<verse eid="JOB 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 6:26" />Nte afo ayem adineeñe se ami ntañ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:26">anyʌñ adat mme ikọ mmi ke ini ñkịmanyen nte afịm?<verse eid="JOB 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 6:27" />Ndufo eyaeyem adisịn afia nnọọ nditọakpa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:27">ñnyʌñ ñnyam ufan ndufo nte ñkpọ udua.”<verse eid="JOB 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 6:28" />“Ado idahami, iwọt mfọnido ke edinse miin ke iso.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:28">Nte ami mmekeme adisʌhọ nsu ke iso ndufo?<verse eid="JOB 6:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 6:29" />Kpọñ idem, kuunam se imiinenne;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:29">maana kere se, sia eti anyịñ mmi asịne ke udomoñkpọ.”<verse eid="JOB 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 6:30" />Nte ibak ndomokeed aba ke ñkpọkinua mmi?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:30">Nte inua mmi ikemeke adidiọọñọ ñkpọ se idiọọk?<verse eid="JOB 6:30" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter eid="JOB 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JOB 7" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 7:1" />“Nte mme awo inieghe akpọsọñ utom adinam ke ederimbod?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:1">Nte mme usen ammọ ibaaha nte mbon e-enamma utom ke ukpe akʌk?<verse eid="JOB 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 7:2" />Nte afʌn a-mfuud ndubiayio awʌttọ anye adikịt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:2">me awo ukpekpe utom a-atieghe abet yak ekpe anye akʌkutom amọ,<verse eid="JOB 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 7:3" />ke ntoro ke e-edeeme mme ikpu-ikpu afiọñ ennọ miin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:3">e-enyʌñ enịm ukuud ke akonayio ennọ miin.<verse eid="JOB 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 7:4" />Ke ini ami mmaakesuuk nnaa ami ñkere, ‘Me adiikpeene die mbemiso ami ndakka nda?’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:4">Akonayio akpeene, ami ñnyʌñ nnaa mmiañña tutu usiere.<verse eid="JOB 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 7:5" />Abʌkidem mmi ayọhọ ye utʌñ ye ñkpa inia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:5">ikpọkidem mmi asakka anyʌñ awuọñọ mmọọñ.<verse eid="JOB 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 7:6" />“Mme usen uwem mmi esọp ekan afia idañ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:6">enyʌñ ediwuọ utịd, inieghe idodanyen.<verse eid="JOB 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 7:7" />O Abasi, toiyo ke uwem mmi ado inweek keed;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:7">anyen mmi idiikịtte inemesịd aba.<verse eid="JOB 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 7:8" />Anyen añkịtte miin idahami, idiñkịtte miin aba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:8">afo ayañyem miin, ado ami ndiibaaha aba do.<verse eid="JOB 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 7:9" />Nte ntọñanyọñ asuanake anyʌñ asop,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:9">ntoro ke awo a-atịkkeke adʌk esịd udi imiitịmmeke idi aba.<verse eid="JOB 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 7:10" />Anye idiitịmmeke idi ufọk amọ aba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:10">atʌñ ammọ idiidiọọñọke anye aba.<verse eid="JOB 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 7:11" />“Ke ntoro ami ndiidoppo uyio;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:11">Ami ñyaatañ ikọ ke iyadesịd sịbidịd mmi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:11">Ami ñyaaseeme ke ndutʌhọ ukpọñ mmi.<verse eid="JOB 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 7:12" />Nte ami ndo inyañ ibom, me akukubarakpa ake esịd mmọọñ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:12">nọ afo ansịn miin ke idak ukpeme?<verse eid="JOB 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 7:13" />Ini se ami ñkere mbo ke akwañ mmi ayannọ miin idọñesịd</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:13">ndin ñnyʌkkọ mbere ñkpọitie mmi ayaanam eseeme mmi asuuhọ,<verse eid="JOB 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 7:14" />akpesʌkado afo adatta ndab ansịn miin ndịk</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:14">anyʌñ anam idem añnyeñ miin ye mme ñkukịd,<verse eid="JOB 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 7:15" />nọ ato do ami ñyem uyịre ekpan ye ñkpa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:15">utu ke utọ ikpọkidem mmi ami.<verse eid="JOB 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 7:16" />Ami mmesọọn uwem mmi; ami ndiiduuho ke nsi-nsi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:16">Ñkpọñ miin; mme usen mmi iwuọñọke ñkpọ ndomokeed.<verse eid="JOB 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 7:17" />“Awo ado nsoo a-anamma yak afo anekke akere ñkpọ abaña anye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:17">anyʌñ anọ ammọ afịd ini mfo,<verse eid="JOB 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 7:18" />anyʌñ aduuñọ ammọ afịd ubakusen</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:18">anyʌñ adomo ammọ ase afịd ini?<verse eid="JOB 7:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 7:19" />Nte afo uduusioho anyen uñkpọñ miin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:19">me adinsaana miin ñyaak ke etək ibio ini?<verse eid="JOB 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 7:20" />Adieke adooho ami mmenam idiọọkñkpọ, nsoo ke ami unam fiin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:20">afo a-adooho amekịt afịd ñkpọ se ñnyịn inam?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 7:20">Nsoo inam yak afo awuuk anyen ke idem mmi?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:20">Nte ami mmekappa ndo ukọ unọ fiin?<verse eid="JOB 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 7:21" />Nsoo inam afo ufeene mme ndudue mmi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:21">unyʌñ udakka unnọ ke mme idiọọkñkpọ mmi?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 7:21">Ami ñyaasọp nnaa ke ntọñ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:21">afo ayañyem miin, ado ami ndiibaaha aba.”<verse eid="JOB 7:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JOB 8" />
  <para style="s1">Bildad</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 8:1" />Ndin Bildad a-atooho Suu amaabọọrọ ate:<verse eid="JOB 8:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 8:2" />“Adiikpeene die afo adika iso ntañ mme utọ ikọ ado?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:2">Mme ikọ mfo edo uyom afịm.<verse eid="JOB 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 8:3" />Nte Abasi asikpe ukwañ ikpe?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:3">Nte Andikoñ Ñkan akeme adinam se imaikinen akwaña?<verse eid="JOB 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 8:4" />Idaha nditọ mfo ekenamma anye idiọọkñkpọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:4">anye amaayaak ammọ anọ ubiomikpe idiọọkñkpọ ammọ.<verse eid="JOB 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 8:5" />Ado adieke afo ayemme Abasi ke afịd esịd</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:5">anyʌñ akpe Andikoñ Ñkan ubọk,<verse eid="JOB 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 8:6" />adieke afo adooho adisana ye adinen awo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:6">kpa idahami anye idiitreke adibenne idem ke ntak mfo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:6">anyʌñ atịmme uben fiin akenọ uforo uwem mfo.<verse eid="JOB 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 8:7" />Ntọọñọ uwem mfo adiiba nte nsuukidem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:7">ini iso mfo adiiyọhọ ye uforo nti ñkpọ.<verse eid="JOB 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 8:8" />“Ibịp mbio emana ako</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:8">inyʌñ iduuñọ se mme eteete ammọ ekekpeep,<verse eid="JOB 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 8:9" />sia ñnyịn ikimana ñkpọñ aboiyoke mi, idiọọñọke ñkpọ ndomokeed,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:9">ndin mme usen uwem ñnyịn ke ederimbod atie nte ndukpọñ.<verse eid="JOB 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 8:10" />Nte ammọ iduudʌttọ fiin utọñ inyʌñ itañ unọ fiin?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:10">Nte ammọ idiisioñoke ikọ itañ ikeene naña ñkpọ anwaña ammọ?<verse eid="JOB 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 8:11" />Nte mfañ papirus a-akeme adikọt ñnyọọñ ke mbad imiibaaha?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:11">Nte ñnyanyaha a-akeme adikọt ke mmọọñ imiibaaha?<verse eid="JOB 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 8:12" />Ke ini esʌkkọ ekọkọt, awo inyʌññọ ikpekpịkke,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:12">ammọ esọp eyeeme ekan mbid.<verse eid="JOB 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 8:13" />Kpa ntoro ñko ke uwem mbon e-efreke Abasi aba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:13">ndin idodanyen awo i-imiidiọọñọke abasi atak.<verse eid="JOB 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 8:14" />Se ammọ ebuọt idem inieghe nsọọñọnda;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:14">se ammọ edat nte ibededem ado udʌk utuudekpe.<verse eid="JOB 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 8:15" />Ammọ ebet edem ke udʌk utuudekpe, ado anye awuudo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:15">ammọ esọọñọ emʌm anye ekama, ado anye isọọñọke ida.<verse eid="JOB 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 8:16" />Ammọ eba nte eto e-enekkeke eduọi mmọọñ enọ ke ini ndaayio,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:16">a-asuanna emịne amọ anyʌñ atara ayọhọ inwañ;<verse eid="JOB 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 8:17" />anye adọñ ñkam amọ akanna mme abaitiad</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:17">anyʌñ ayem itie ke atu mme itiad.<verse eid="JOB 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 8:18" />Ado ke anye amaawakka ke itie amọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:18">itie ado ate ke iyemme anye anyʌñ abo, ‘Kpaanam ukịtte fiin.’<verse eid="JOB 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 8:19" />Ke akpanikọ uwem amọ ayeeme aboiyo afep,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:19">ndin ato ke isọñ mme eto mfen etịppe ekọọt.<verse eid="JOB 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 8:20" />“Ke akpanikọ Abasi isịnne awo a-afọnnọ ama</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:20">me adisọọñọ ubọk mme anam ibak.<verse eid="JOB 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 8:21" />Anye ñko ayaayọhọ inua mfo ye imam</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:21">ye ñkpọkinua mfo ye ñkpo idaara.<verse eid="JOB 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 8:22" />Mbon usua mfo eyaesịne afọñ abuud,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:22">ndin itieidʌñ mme anam idiọọk idiibaaha aba.”<verse eid="JOB 8:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JOB 9" />
  <para style="s1">Yoob</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 9:1" />Akem Yoob amaabọọrọ:<verse eid="JOB 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 9:2" />“Ke akpanikọ, ami mmediọọñọ ke ado akpanikọ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:2">Ado die ke mme ñkaña awo ekan aditañ ikọ mbaña unana ndudue ammọ ke iso Abasi?<verse eid="JOB 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 9:3" />Akpesʌkado nte ammọ eyemme edifaaña mfaaña mme anye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:3">ammọ ikanna edibọọrọ anye akañ keed ke atu tọsịn.<verse eid="JOB 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 9:4" />Aniọñ amọ atʌñọ eti-eti, adudu amọ anyʌñ akpon eti-eti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:4">Anie akesọñ iwuod ye anye ndin atre adidat unan?<verse eid="JOB 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 9:5" />Anye aben mme ikpọabod afep ke ini ammọ imiidiọọñọke</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:5">anyʌñ ayʌt ammọ akappa ke iyadesịd amọ.<verse eid="JOB 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 9:6" />Anye anyeeñe ederimbod asio ke itie amọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:6">anyʌñ anam mme abai ufọk ammọ enyeeñe.<verse eid="JOB 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 9:7" />Anye atañ ikọ anọ utịn ndin anye ikanna iyamma;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:7">anye anyʌñ afʌk unwana ntantaafiọñ.<verse eid="JOB 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 9:8" />Anye ikpọọñ atat mme hefịn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:8">anyʌñ asaña ke mbufịd akpainyañ.<verse eid="JOB 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 9:9" />Anye ado Andinam Bee ye Ọriọn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:9">mme Pleiades ye mme ntantaafiọñ ke usuuk.<verse eid="JOB 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 9:10" />Anye anam mme utịppeñkpọ ake awo imiikanna adidiọọñọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:10">mme utịppeñkpọ ake awo imiikanna adibat.<verse eid="JOB 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 9:11" />Anye amaasaña imboiyo miin, ami ñkanna ñkịt anye;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:11">anye amaasaña iboiyo, ami ñkanna ndiọọñọ anye.<verse eid="JOB 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 9:12" />Anye akpuwappa ñkpọ abọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:12">anie awo ikan adikpan anye?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:12">Anie ikeme adibo anye, ‘Nsoo ke afo anam?’<verse eid="JOB 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 9:13" />Abasi itegheke iyadesịd amọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:13">ndin nsaña Rahab emaenʌhọ ke idak amọ.<verse eid="JOB 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 9:14" />“Die ndin ke ami ndiinam ikọ ye anye?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:14">Ndiinam die nnie mme ikọ se ndat mfaaña ye anye?<verse eid="JOB 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 9:15" />Akpesʌkado ami mmiikidueghe, ami ñkikanna mbọọrọ anye;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:15">Ukweeñe akedo ami adikpeiye abiideikpe mmi mbo yak anie mbọm.<verse eid="JOB 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 9:16" />Akpekọm ñkekookoot anye ndin anye abọọrọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:16">Ami nnịmme ke anye ayannọ miin ñkpañutọñ.<verse eid="JOB 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 9:17" />Anye ayaadat afịm ayobio annuak miin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:17">anyʌñ anam unan mmi awak ke unana ntak.<verse eid="JOB 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 9:18" />Anye idiiyakka ami nduọk ibifịk</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:18">ado ayamfʌk miin ye ukuud.<verse eid="JOB 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 9:19" />Adieke adooho ñkpọ inweek, anye anie adudu akem!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:19">Adieke adooho ñkpọ unenikpe, anie ikpida anye ke iso?<verse eid="JOB 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 9:20" />Akpekọm ami ñkinieghe ndudue, inua mmi akpa ambiom miin ikpe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:20">adieke ñkpenanake ndudue, anye akpaabo ke mmedue.<verse eid="JOB 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 9:21" />“Akpesʌkado ami nnanake ndudue,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:21">Ami nnieghe utom do mbaña idem mmi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:21">Ami mmesua uwem mmi.<verse eid="JOB 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 9:22" />Afịd ñkpọ ado ukem-ukem; ado anam yak ami mbo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:22">‘Anye asobo mme anana ndudue ye mbon ibak.’<verse eid="JOB 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 9:23" />Ke ini idiọọk udọñọ amaaben adiyok ñkpa adi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:23">anye asak nnananyen awo ake imiidueghe isob.<verse eid="JOB 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 9:24" />Adieke isọñ aduọhọ adʌk ubọk mme idiọọk awo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:24">anye afʌk afịd mme abiideikpe anyen.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:24">Adieke imiidooho anye, ado anie awo ndin?<verse eid="JOB 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 9:25" />“Mme usen uwem mmi esọp ekan awo a-afegheke itọk;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:25">ammọ efeeñe ewuọ ikịtte inemesịd ndomokeed.<verse eid="JOB 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 9:26" />Ammọ efrọ eboiyo usọp-usọp nte ubom e-enamma ke papirus,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:26">nte mme ntrukpuum eduọhọ efʌk mme unam ndidia ammọ.<verse eid="JOB 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 9:27" />Adieke mbooho, ‘Ami ñyaafre aseeme mmi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:27">ñyaakpuho iso mmi, ñnyʌñ ntuaak inua imam,’<verse eid="JOB 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 9:28" />Ami nsʌk mbaak afịd mme ufen se ami mbọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:28">sia mmediọọñọ ke afo uduudatta ke ami ndueghe.<verse eid="JOB 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 9:29" />Sia ekekịt ndudue ennọ miin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:29">ntak ami ñkpenwanake ke unana ntak-a?<verse eid="JOB 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 9:30" />Akpekọm ami ñkpeyet idem mmi ke atọñ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:30">ñnyʌñ ñyet ubọk mmi ke mme ndom,<verse eid="JOB 9:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 9:31" />afo ayantop miin asịn ke utebe ube</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:31">nọ ato do kpa mme afọñ mmi ensua miin.<verse eid="JOB 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 9:32" />“Anye idooho awo nte ami nọ ami ñkpebọọrọ anye ikọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:32">me a-akpenamma ami ye anye ida ke ikpe ke esob.<verse eid="JOB 9:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 9:33" />Akpekapado awo aba adisịn emem ke ufọọd ñnyịn awo iba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:33">awo se ikpiben ñnyịn ididian keed,<verse eid="JOB 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 9:34" />awo akpenyʌññọ adooro esañ ufen Abasi afep ke idem mmi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:34">mbaak idịkke amọ adindịkke aba.<verse eid="JOB 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 9:35" />Ndin ami ñkpaasio uyio, mbaaha anye aba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:35">ado naña aba idahami ye ami, ami ñkanna.<verse eid="JOB 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter eid="JOB 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JOB 10" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 10:1" />“Ami mmesua uwem mmi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:1">ke ntoro ñyaanwañña esịd mmi nnọ aseeme mmi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:1">ñnyʌñ ntañ ikọ a-atooho idod-idod ukpọñ mmi.<verse eid="JOB 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 10:2" />Ami mmebo Abasi: kumbiom miin ikpe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:2">ado tañ nnọ miin ikọ se afo adat andot miin uyio.<verse eid="JOB 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 10:3" />Nte unem fiin esịd afo adimfiik miin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:3">adisịn ubọkutom mfo ke mbio,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:3">ke ini afo asakka imam abaña uduak mbon ibak?<verse eid="JOB 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 10:4" />Nte afo anie anyen abʌkidem?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:4">Nte afo akịt ñkpọ naña ñkaña awo akịt?<verse eid="JOB 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 10:5" />Nte mme usen mfo atie nte ake ñkaña awo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:5">me nte mme isua mfo atie nte ake akpọsọñ awo,<verse eid="JOB 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 10:6" />nọ ato do afo ayeem mme ndudue mmi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:6">anyʌñ aduuñọ ayem idiọọkñkpọ mmi;<verse eid="JOB 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 10:7" />Akpesʌkado afo amediọọñọ ke ami ndueghe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:7">ñko ke awo ndomokeed ikemeke adimfak miin nsio ke ubọk mfo?<verse eid="JOB 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 10:8" />“Ubọk mfo akembot miin anyʌñ andiọñ miin.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:8">Nte afo ayaakappa ndin ansobo miin?<verse eid="JOB 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 10:9" />Toiyo bo ke afo akembot miin nte usiọñ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:9">Nte afo ayaamaana anam ami ñkappa ntọñ?<verse eid="JOB 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 10:10" />Nte afo ukunduọkkọ miin usio nte mmọọñeba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:10">anyʌñ añyʌt miin nte nsọọñ uyo mmọọñeba,<verse eid="JOB 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 10:11" />dat ikpọkidem ye abʌkidem nsịn miin ke idem</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:11">nyʌñ ndọk miin dian ye akpọ ye asịb?<verse eid="JOB 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 10:12" />Afo amannọ miin uwem anyʌñ añwọt miin mfọn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:12">anyʌñ adat ntịm ñkama mfo akpeme sịbidịd mmi.<verse eid="JOB 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 10:13" />“Ado ami ado se afo akedịp ke isọñ esịd mfo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:13">ami mmenyʌñ ndiọọñọ ke ami akuusịne fiin ke esịd:<verse eid="JOB 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 10:14" />Adieke ami nnamma idiọọkñkpọ, afo adiisʌk insese miin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:14">uduunyʌññọ uyak ami ntre adibọ ufen ke ndudue mmi.<verse eid="JOB 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 10:15" />Adieke ami ndueghe, anekke adiọọk annọ miin!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:15">Akpekọm ami ndueghe, ami ñkanna ndịppe iwuod mmi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 10:15">sia ami ñyọhọ ye abuud</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:15">ñnyʌñ mbʌhọ ke ukuud mmi.<verse eid="JOB 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 10:16" />Adieke ndịppeke iwuod mmi, afo ayañyep miin nte ekpe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:16">anyʌñ amaana aben aniendịk adudu mfo ambịne miin.<verse eid="JOB 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 10:17" />Afo amedat mme ufa ntiense ambaña miin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:17">anyʌñ abenne iyadesịd mfo añkeene miin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:17">mme udịmekọñ mfo embịne miin ke adudu ke adudu.<verse eid="JOB 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 10:18" />“Nsoo ikinam ndin yak afo ansio miin ke idịb?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:18">Ubaha nte adooho ke ami mmaakpa mbemiso anyen awo ndomokeed adiñkịt miin.<verse eid="JOB 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 10:19" />Akpekapado ami ñkemanake mana yak eñkịt miin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:19">me adikpikimben nnen-nnen nto idịb eka mmi ñkaa udi!<verse eid="JOB 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 10:20" />Nte idooho mme ibad-ibad usen uwem mmi akweeñe?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:20">Kanna iso mfo ñkpọñ miin mbaak ñkan nnie etʌk ini idadesịd<verse eid="JOB 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 10:21" />mbemiso ami ñkaa itie andiiduakka aditịmme ndi aba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:21">ke isọñ ukuud ye akpọsọñ ekịm,<verse eid="JOB 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 10:22" />ke isọñ a-ayọhọke ye akpọsọñ ekịm,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:22">ataa ekịm ye ndutịme,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:22">ake kpa unwana abaaha nte ekịm.”<verse eid="JOB 10:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JOB 11" />
  <para style="s1">Sofa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 11:1" />Ndin Sofa awo Naama amaabọọrọ:<verse eid="JOB 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 11:2" />“Nte afịd mme ikọ ami ayaaboiyo inieghe ibọọrọ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:2">Nte atañutañ ami ayaakan ikañ idem amọ ke imọ idueghe?<verse eid="JOB 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 11:3" />Nte ikpu-ikpu ikọ mfo ayaanam mbon mfen edop uyio?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:3">Nte idiibaaha awo se isua unọọ fiin ke idaha afo anọọhọ awo ñnyọọ?<verse eid="JOB 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 11:4" />Afo abo Abasi, ‘Se ami nnịm ke akpanikọ inieghe ndo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:4">ami ñnyʌñ ndo adisana ke iso mfo.’<verse eid="JOB 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 11:5" />Sai, naña ami ñkap ndot anyen mbo ke Abasi ayaatañ ikọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:5">ke anye ayaanyʌñ atat ñkpọkinua amọ ubaña fiin<verse eid="JOB 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 11:6" />anyʌñ ayaara unọ fiin mme ndedịbe ñkpọ aniọñ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:6">sia ataa aniọñ akpanikọ anie mbeñ iba.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:6">Diọọñọ ntom: ke Abasi amaafre ubaak idiọọkñkpọ mfo.<verse eid="JOB 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 11:7" />“Nte afo amekan adiọọñọ mme ndedịbe ñkpọ Abasi?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:7">Nte afo amekan aduuñọ akịt mme adaña ukeme Andikoñ Ñkan?<verse eid="JOB 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 11:8" />Ammọ ekoñ ekan mme hefịn ke anyọñ; nsoo ke afo akan anam?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:8">Ammọ etəño ekan udem esịd isọñ; nsoo ke afo akan adiọọñọ?<verse eid="JOB 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 11:9" />Udomoñkpọ ammọ anyọọñ akan ederimbod</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:9">anyʌñ atara ukpa akan akpainyañ.<verse eid="JOB 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 11:10" />“Anye akpediboiyo anyʌñ ufʌt fiin asịn ke ufọk ñkpakọb</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:10">anyʌñ akoot esob abono, anie ikpikan adikpan anye?<verse eid="JOB 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 11:11" />Ke akpanikọ anye adiọọñọ mbon abiaña;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:11">ndin anye amaakịt idiọọkñkpọ, nte anye ikpinịmme idiọọñọ?<verse eid="JOB 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 11:12" />Ado awo unana ifiọk idiikanna inie aniọñ aba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:12">ikan ayaara dọñki ikọd adikappa mmana nte awo.”<verse eid="JOB 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 11:13" />“Ado afo ukpuyaak esịd mfo unọ anye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:13">anyʌñ anyan ubọk mfo akeene anye,<verse eid="JOB 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 11:14" />adieke afo atoppo idiọọkñkpọ ake usịneke fiin ke ubọk aduọọk</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:14">unyʌññọ uyak idiọọkñkpọ ndomokeed adʌñ ke atayad mfo,<verse eid="JOB 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 11:15" />ñko, ke umaunana ndudue, afo ayaabenne iso mfo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:15">afo ayaasọọñọ ada mfọn-mfọn ukoppo ndịk.<verse eid="JOB 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 11:16" />Ke akpanikọ afo ayaafre mme mfịna mfo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:16">anyʌñ atoiyo anye ukem nte mfịna mmọọñ amaakekebe.<verse eid="JOB 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 11:17" />Uwem ayaayamma akan uweemeayio,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:17">ndin ekịm ayaakappa atie nte ubakusen.<verse eid="JOB 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 11:18" />Afo ayaanie nsọọñọnda, sia idodanyen a-aba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:18">afo ayaase ñkanñkʌk mfo anyʌñ abọ nduọkadudu ke ifuuro.<verse eid="JOB 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 11:19" />Afo ayaasuuk ana, ndin ibaaha awo ndomokeed se idiinam yak afo akop ndịk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:19">ndin uwak awo eyaeyem mfọn mfo.<verse eid="JOB 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 11:20" />Ado anyen mme idiọọk awo idiikịtte ñkpọ aba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:20">ñko ammọ idiikanna ifeghe ibọkkọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:20">idodanyen ammọ ayaakappa ado inweek ñkpa.”<verse eid="JOB 11:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JOB 12" />
  <para style="s1">Yoob</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 12:1" />Ndin Yoob amaabọọrọ:<verse eid="JOB 12:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 12:2" />“Ke akpanikọ ndufo ikpọọñ edo mbon e-ebaaha ufọn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:2">ndin aniọñ adiikpa ye ndufo!<verse eid="JOB 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 12:3" />Ado ami mmenie esịd ukem nte ndufo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:3">Ami ndooho usʌhọde awo inọọ ndufo.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:3">Anie imiidiọọñọke afịd mme ñkpọ ami?<verse eid="JOB 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 12:4" />“Ami mmekappa ndo ñkpọ nsakimam nnọ mme ufan mmi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:4">akpesʌkado ami mmaakoot Abasi anye amaayie,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:4">ataa ñkaña ñkpọ nsakimam, akpesʌkado ami ndooho adinen awo ñnyʌñ nnana ndudue!<verse eid="JOB 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 12:5" />Mbon e-ebaaha ke nduọkadudu esịn ndiọọkiso ke ndek</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:5">nte uwa ake mbon se ñkpad ammọ afiọnnọ.<verse eid="JOB 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 12:6" />Mme atayad ake mbon ufiik awo inieghe mfịna,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:6">ndin mbon e-eyatta Abasi esịd enie ukpeme,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:6">mbon se Abasi anie ke ubọk amọ.”<verse eid="JOB 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 12:7" />“Ado bịp mme unam, ndin ammọ eyaukpeep fiin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:7">me mme inuen e-ebaaha ke ikpaanyọñ, ndin ammọ eyaudọkkọ fiin;<verse eid="JOB 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 12:8" />me aditañ ikọ nnọọ ederimbod, ndin ado ayaukpeep fiin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:8">me yak iyak ke inyañ etañ unọ fiin.<verse eid="JOB 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 12:9" />Akee ke atu afịd mme ñkpọ ami imiidiọọñọke</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:9">ke ubọk <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> anam ñkpọ ami?<verse eid="JOB 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 12:10" />Ke ubọk amọ ke uwem afịd ñkpọ se ebot asịne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:10">ye ibifịk afịd ubon awo.<verse eid="JOB 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 12:11" />Nte utọñ idomoke ikọ ise</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:11">kpasʌk naña edeme adia ndidia ase?<verse eid="JOB 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 12:12" />Nte awo ikịtte aniọñ ke atu mbon emaekesọñ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:12">Nte anyan uwem idatta ikike idi?”<verse eid="JOB 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 12:13" />“Aniọñ ye adudu anie Abasi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:13">item ye ikike edo ake amọ.<verse eid="JOB 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 12:14" />Se anye awuut aduọk awo ikanna imaana ibọp;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:14">mbon se anye asịn ke ñkpakọb awo ikanna isio.<verse eid="JOB 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 12:15" />Adieke anye amʌmmọ mmọọñ akama, nsaadisọñ aba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:15">adieke anye asaanake mmọọñ ayaak, mmọọñ asobo afịd isọñ.<verse eid="JOB 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 12:16" />Anye ikpọọñ anie adudu ye inweek ye mbufiọk;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:16">anye ñko anie mbon se ebiaña ye mbon abiaña.<verse eid="JOB 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 12:17" />Anye anam mme adaukara enana eti iwuod</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:17">anyʌñ anam mme abiideikpe ekappa edo mme ndisịme.<verse eid="JOB 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 12:18" />Anye atat mme ebuka ukwak ndidem</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:18">anyʌñ atobo afọñisịn akanna isịn ammọ.<verse eid="JOB 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 12:19" />Anye anam mme aku enana eti iwuod</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:19">anyʌñ adooño ikpọawo ukara emaekemuum isọñ aduọọñọ.<verse eid="JOB 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 12:20" />Anye akʌp inua nti mme anọitem</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:20">anyʌñ abọ mme ñkpisọñ ifiọk ñkukịd.<verse eid="JOB 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 12:21" />Anye anam mme nti awo edia abuud</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:21">anyʌñ abọ ñkpọsọñ awo ide ammọ.<verse eid="JOB 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 12:22" />Anye ayaara mme ntotəño ñkpọ ekịm</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:22">anyʌñ aben ekamba ekịm asịn ke unwana.<verse eid="JOB 12:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 12:23" />Anye anam mme idịd ekpon, anyʌñ asobo ammọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:23">anye anam mme idịd etara, anyʌñ asuan ammọ.<verse eid="JOB 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 12:24" />Anye anyịm mme adaukara ederimbod ukeme edikere ñkpọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:24">anye anam ammọ edutịn ke anaan ake usʌñ imiibaaha.<verse eid="JOB 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 12:25" />Ammọ eyooñ ke ekịm ake unwana imiibaaha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:25">anye anam ammọ edutịn nte mme akpammịn.”<verse eid="JOB 12:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter eid="JOB 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JOB 13" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 13:1" />“Anyen mmi akịt afịd mme ñkpọ ami,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:1">utọñ mmi anyʌñ akop anyʌñ anwaña anye.”<verse eid="JOB 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 13:2" />Se afo adiọọñọ, ami ñko mmediọọñọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:2">Ami ndooho akoi unọ fiin.<verse eid="JOB 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 13:3" />Ado ami mmeyem aditañ ikọ nnọọ Andikoñ Ñkan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:3">ñnyʌñ mfaaña idem mmi ke iso Abasi.<verse eid="JOB 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 13:4" />Ado ndufo emaeben nsu eñkpenne miin ke idem;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:4">ndufo edo mme akọk udọñọ i-imiibaaha ufọn, afịd ndufo!<verse eid="JOB 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 13:5" />Akpekapado ndufo eyaema adidop uyio biai!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:5">Ado adiido aniọñ inọ ndufo.<verse eid="JOB 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 13:6" />Ikop ndin se ido mfaaña mmi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:6">ikpañ utọñ ikop aseeme ñkpọkinua mmi.<verse eid="JOB 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 13:7" />Nte afo ayaatañ ndoom-ndoom ikọ ke iwuod Abasi?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:7">Nte afo ayaatañ ñkara-ñkara ikọ anọ anye?<verse eid="JOB 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 13:8" />Nte afo ayaawọt ubakka ye anye?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:8">Nte afo ayaafaaña mfaaña ikpe anọ Abasi?<verse eid="JOB 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 13:9" />Nte ayaakappa ifọn adieke anye uduuñọke fiin ase?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:9">Nte afo akpa abiaña anye naña afo akpebiaña ñkaña awo?<verse eid="JOB 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 13:10" />Anye idiitreke adukoot fiin ibo yak adinam ibad</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:10">adieke afo ke ndedịbe awọttọ ubakka.<verse eid="JOB 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 13:11" />Nte mmọnyọ amọ iduusịnne fiin ndịk?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:11">Nte uteeñe amọ iduuduọhọ fiin ke idem?<verse eid="JOB 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 13:12" />Ñkaan ikọ ndufo edo mme ikpu-ikpu ñke;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:12">ñkpemeidem ndufo ado ñkpemeidem aduañ.<verse eid="JOB 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 13:13" />“Dop uyio nyʌñ yak ami ntañ ikọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:13">ndin yak se ikpimama atịppe annọ miin.<verse eid="JOB 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 13:14" />Nsoo inam nọ ami nsịn idem mmi ke mfịna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:14">ñnyʌñ nsịn uwem mmi ke ubọk mmi?<verse eid="JOB 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 13:15" />Akpesʌkado anye añwotto miin, ami ñyaasʌk ndot anyen ke anye;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:15">Ami ndiitreke adikañ idem mmi ke iso amọ.<verse eid="JOB 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 13:16" />Ke akpanikọ, ami ayaakappa ado adinyaaña mmi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:16">sia mbon se imiidiọọñọke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> idiikanna ida ke iso amọ!<verse eid="JOB 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 13:17" />Kpañ utọñ eti-eti kop se ami nnie aditañ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:17">yak ikọ mmi amia ñkanika ke utọñ ndufo.<verse eid="JOB 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 13:18" />Idahami, a-adooho ami mmebeeñe idem ikpe mmi mma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:18">ami mmediọọñọ ke ikpe ayantoppo miin.<verse eid="JOB 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 13:19" />Nte aba awo ndomokeed a-akemeke adimbiom miin ikpe?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:19">Adieke adooho ntoro, ami ñyaadop uyio ñnyʌñ ñkpa.<verse eid="JOB 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 13:20" />“Kam nnọ miin ñkpọ iba ami kpọd, Abasi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:20">ndin ami ndiidịbeke ke iso mfo:<verse eid="JOB 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 13:21" />Dooro ubọk mfo sio ke idem mmi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:21">nyʌñ tre adindịkke miin ye ndịk mfo.<verse eid="JOB 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 13:22" />Ndin ñkoot miin ke ami ñyaayie,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:22">imiidooho afo ayaak ami ntañ ikọ, ndin afo ambọọrọ miin.<verse eid="JOB 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 13:23" />Mme ukwaññkpọ ye idiọọkñkpọ mmi edo ifañ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:23">Ñwọt miin ndudue ye mme idiọọkñkpọ mmi.<verse eid="JOB 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 13:24" />Nsoo inam nọ afo adịp iso mfo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:24">anyʌñ andat miin nte asua mfo?<verse eid="JOB 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 13:25" />Nte afo ayaatʌkkọ mfañ a-afịm asuanna?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:25">Nte afo ayaabịne nsaad mbio?<verse eid="JOB 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 13:26" />Sia afo awette mme idod ñkpọ ambaña miin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:26">anyʌñ anam ami ndọk ndiọiñkpọ ini uyịn mmi.<verse eid="JOB 13:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 13:27" />Afo asịn ñkprọñ akanna ukod mmi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:27">anyʌñ anekke akpeme afịd mme afañusʌñ mmi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:27">ke adinịm idiọọñọ ñkanna mbọn ikpadisañ mmi.<verse eid="JOB 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 13:28" />“Ndin awo abiara nte ñkpọ a-abʌttọke,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:28">nte afọñidem ake ñkakad ataaha.<verse eid="JOB 13:28" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter eid="JOB 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JOB 14" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 14:1" />“Mme awo, a-awonwaan amanna,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:1">enie ibad-ibad usen enyʌñ eyọhọ ye mfịna.<verse eid="JOB 14:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 14:2" />Ammọ etịppe nte mme ñkpokpoñ enyʌñ eyeeme;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:2">nte ndukpọñ, ammọ ikpeeñeke.<verse eid="JOB 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 14:3" />Nte afo amewuuk anyen mfo ke ammọ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:3">Afo ayaaben ammọ adi iso mfo ke ikpe?<verse eid="JOB 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 14:4" />Anie awo akeme adiben se isana nto se imiisanake ndi?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:4">Ibaaha awo!<verse eid="JOB 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 14:5" />Enịm adaña ebaña mme usen awo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:5">afo amenịm ewʌhọ abaña mme ibad afiọñ amọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:5">anyʌñ anịm adaña se anye imiikanna iboiyo.<verse eid="JOB 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 14:6" />Ke ntoro sio anyen mfo kpọñ anye nyʌñ saana anye yaak,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:6">tutu ini amọ akem nte awo e-ekpeeghekpe utom.<verse eid="JOB 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 14:7" />“Kpayeado, etək idodanyen a-aba anọ eto:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:7">Ekpekpịkke anye enịm ke isọñ, ayaamaana aseghe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:7">ñko ufa emịne amọ idiitreke adiseghe.<verse eid="JOB 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 14:8" />Mme adʌñ amọ ekeme edisọñ ke isọñ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:8">itịghe amọ anyʌñ akpa ke ntan,<verse eid="JOB 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 14:9" />ado ke adikop ufịk mmọọñ anye ayaaset</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:9">anyʌñ asịññe emịne nte eto.<verse eid="JOB 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 14:10" />Ado awo amaakpa enyanna enịm;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:10">anye anweek akpatre ibifịk, ndin anye ibaaha aba.<verse eid="JOB 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 14:11" />Kpa naña mmọọñ idịm asat</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:11">me isọñinyañ adiduọ anyʌñ asat,<verse eid="JOB 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 14:12" />ntoro ke anye asʌk ana inyʌññọ idakka ida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:12">tutu mme hefịn ibaaha aba, mme awo idiidemmeke</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:12">awo idiinyʌññọ itọi ammọ ke idab.<verse eid="JOB 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 14:13" />“Akpekapado afo ayandịp miin ke udi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:13">anyʌñ amfʌk miin tutu iyadesịd mfo aboiyo!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 14:13">Akpekapado afo akpaanịm ini annọ miin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:13">ndin anyʌñ antoiyo miin!<verse eid="JOB 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 14:14" />Adieke awo akpaaha, ammọ eyaemaana edu uwem?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:14">Afịd mme usen akpọsọñ utom mmi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:14">Ami ñyaabet nọ adidemme mmi adi.<verse eid="JOB 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 14:15" />Afo ayañkoot ndin ami ñyauyie fiin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:15">itọñ ayaudọñ abaña ñkpọ ake ubọk mfo abotto.<verse eid="JOB 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 14:16" />Ke akpanikọ, ndin afo ayaabat ñkpad isañ mmi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:16">ado uduukanna ukeene usʌñ idiọọkñkpọ mmi.<verse eid="JOB 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 14:17" />Eyaedịp idiọọkñkpọ mmi ke ekpad;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:17">afo ayaafʌk idiọọkñkpọ mmi.<verse eid="JOB 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 14:18" />“Ado naña abod abomo anyʌñ awuuro</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:18">naña enyʌñ ebenne itiad esio ke itie amọ,<verse eid="JOB 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 14:19" />naña mmọọñ ayet mme itiad</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:19">mme akpa enyʌñ eyet isọñ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:19">ntoro ke afo abiat idodanyen awo.<verse eid="JOB 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 14:20" />Afo amekan ammọ udịd ini keed, ammọ enyʌñ enyọñọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:20">afo amekpuuñọ ammọ edu anyʌñ asio ammọ unyọñ.<verse eid="JOB 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 14:21" />Adieke enọọhọ nditọ ammọ ukpono, ammọ idiọọñọke;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:21">ekpesuuhọ nditọ ammọ itie, ammọ ikịtte.<verse eid="JOB 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 14:22" />Ammọ ekop ubiak ke abʌkidem ammọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:22">enyʌñ eseeme enọ idem ammọ ikpọọñ.”<verse eid="JOB 14:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JOB 15" />
  <para style="s1">Elifas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 15:1" />Akem Elifas a-adooho awo Teman amaabọọrọ:<verse eid="JOB 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 15:2" />“Nte awo aniọñ akpaadat ikpu-ikpu akikere abọọrọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:2">me ayọhọ idịb amọ ye ufiob afịm a-atooho usakkautịn?<verse eid="JOB 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 15:3" />Nte ammọ eyaefaaña ye mme ikpu-ikpu ikọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:3">ye mme ikọ ake imiinieghe ufọn?<verse eid="JOB 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 15:4" />Ado afo amesịn eti ñkpọ ke ndek</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:4">anyʌñ abiọọñọ uteeñe adikpono Abasi.<verse eid="JOB 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 15:5" />Idiọọkñkpọ mfo amək inua mfo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:5">afo anyʌñ amek edeme mbon ñkara.<verse eid="JOB 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 15:6" />Kpa inua mfo ubiom fiin ikpe, idooho ake mmi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:6">ñkpọkinua mfo anyʌñ atie ntiense ubaña fiin.<verse eid="JOB 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 15:7" />“Nte afo ado akpa awodeen ake ekemanna?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:7">Nte ekebem iso ubot fiin mbemiso mme abod?<verse eid="JOB 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 15:8" />Nte afo amesikpañ utọñ ke esob Abasi?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:8">Nte afo ikpọọñ anie afịd aniọñ?<verse eid="JOB 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 15:9" />Nsoo ke afo adiọọñọ ake ñnyịn imiidiọọñọke?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:9">Nsoo ntotəño ñkpọ ke afo adiọọñọ ake ñnyịn imiidiọọñọke?<verse eid="JOB 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 15:10" />Mme iwuod iwad ye mme ñkaan awo eda ye ñnyịn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:10">kpa mbon esọññọ ekan ete mfo.<verse eid="JOB 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 15:11" />Nte mme idọñesịd Abasi ikemme ye afo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:11">mme ikọ e-etañña usʌk-usʌk unọọ fiin?<verse eid="JOB 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 15:12" />Nsoo ido ntak esịd mfo ubenne fiin anyọọñ usʌñ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:12">nsoo inyʌñ ido ntak a-anyen mfo akeppe,<verse eid="JOB 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 15:13" />a-anamma yak afo ayat esịd ye Abasi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:13">anyʌñ asịññe mme utọ ikọ ado ke inua mfo?<verse eid="JOB 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 15:14" />“Nsoo ke mme awo edo, nọ ammọ ekpedo ndisana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:14">me mbon se awonwaan aman, nọ ammọ ekpedo ndinen?<verse eid="JOB 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 15:15" />Adieke Abasi imiinieghe mbuọdidem ke mme ndisana awo amọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:15">adieke idem mme hefịn imiisanake ke anyen amọ,<verse eid="JOB 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 15:16" />akere die abaña mme ñkaña awo, e-edooho mbiara enyʌñ enañña ndudiọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:16">enyʌñ enwọñ idiọọkñkpọ nte mmọọñ!<verse eid="JOB 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 15:17" />“Kpañ utọñ nnọ miin ndin ami ñyaanam nọ unwaña fiin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:17">yak ami udọkkọ fiin ñkpọ se ami ñkịt,<verse eid="JOB 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 15:18" />se mbon aniọñ esian,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:18">idịppe ñkpọ ndomokeed se ammọ ekebọọ eto mme eteete ammọ<verse eid="JOB 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 15:19" />(ammọ ikpọọñ ke ekenọọ isọñ ami</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:19">ke ini mme isenawo imiikisañake ke atu ammọ):<verse eid="JOB 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 15:20" />Ke afịd usen uwem amọ, idiọọk awo abọ ufen ye ukuud,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:20">awo unana mbọm ke afịd mme isua uwem se ebọọk enịm enọ anye.<verse eid="JOB 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 15:21" />Uyom ndịk ayọhọ anye utọñ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:21">ke ini abaaha nte afịd ñkpọ a-afọn ama, mbon ñwo edʌk ebịne anye.<verse eid="JOB 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 15:22" />Anye aduọọk idodanyen adibọkkọ ke ikpeghe ekịm;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:22">enịm anye idiọọñọ adikpa ke akañkañ.<verse eid="JOB 15:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 15:23" />Anye akaan ayeem ndidia nte utere;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:23">anye adiọọñọ ke usen ekịm adikpere.<verse eid="JOB 15:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 15:24" />Ndutʌhọ ye nnananyen eyọhọ esịd amọ ye ndịk;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:24">mme mfịna ekanna anye ekʌk nte adidem a-abeeñeke idem uka ekọñ,<verse eid="JOB 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 15:25" />sia anye abenne ubọk amọ anwana ekọñ ye Abasi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:25">anyʌñ awọt uko amọ ye ataa Andikoñ Ñkan,<verse eid="JOB 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 15:26" />adat akpọsọñ iyadesịd amọ akeene anye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:26">mme ekamba akpọsọñ ukwakekọñ.<verse eid="JOB 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 15:27" />“Akpesʌkado akpọñ afʌkkọ iso amọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:27">ndin isịn amọ amʌkkọ ye abʌk,<verse eid="JOB 15:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 15:28" />anye ayaadʌñ ke mme ñwuudo abio</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:28">ye mme ufọk se mme awo imiidʌññọ ke esịd,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:28">mme ufọk e-emaekewuudo enyʌñ ebiaña.<verse eid="JOB 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 15:29" />Anye idiinieghe inie aba ndin imọ amọ idiikpeeneke,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:29">mme inie amọ idiisuanake ifʌk afịd isọñ.<verse eid="JOB 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 15:30" />Anye idiibọkkọke ekịm;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:30">edemeikañ ayaaniime mme emịne amọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:30">ndin inweek a-atooho inua Abasi ayaaben anye afep.<verse eid="JOB 15:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 15:31" />Yak anye akuubiaña idem amọ ke adinie mbuọdidem ke mme ñkpọ i-imiibaaha ufọn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:31">sia anye idiinieghe ufọn ito mme ñkpọ ntoro.<verse eid="JOB 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 15:32" />Mbemiso ini amọ adikem anye ayaasat,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:32">ndin mme ñkọk amọ idiisegheke.<verse eid="JOB 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 15:33" />Anye adiiba nte fain e-emaekekịppe mme ñkịm kreb amọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:33">nte eto ọlif ake ñkpokpoñ amọ abegheke.<verse eid="JOB 15:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 15:34" />Mbono mbon i-imiidiọọñọke abasi ayaanana ubọọñ anyʌñ akappa ado ada,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:34">ikañ ayaanyʌñ ata mme atayad mbon e-emaaha ubọkedem.<verse eid="JOB 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 15:35" />Ammọ eyommo ndutịme enyʌñ eman idiọọkñkpọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:35">idịb ammọ ayọhọ ye abiaña.”<verse eid="JOB 15:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JOB 16" />
  <para style="s1">Yoob</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 16:1" />Ndin Yoob amaabọọrọ ate:<verse eid="JOB 16:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 16:2" />Ami mmekop mme uwak ñkpọ ntom;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:2">afịd ndufo idoññoke nti mbon idọñesịd!<verse eid="JOB 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 16:3" />Nte anyan nduwañña ikọ ndufo idiinieghe utịd?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:3">Nsoo ñkpọ iyat ndufo a-anamma yak ndufo akaiso afaaña mfaaña?<verse eid="JOB 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 16:4" />Ami ñko mmekeme aditañ ikọ nte ndufo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:4">adieke ndufo ekpebaaha ke itie mmi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 16:4">Ami ñkpaakan aditañ nti ikọ ibaña ndufo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:4">ñnyʌñ ñnyeghe iwuod inọ ndufo.<verse eid="JOB 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 16:5" />Ado inua mmi ayainọ ndufo isọñesịd;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:5">idọñesịd a-atooho ñkpọkinua mmi ayaisuuk ndufo esịd.<verse eid="JOB 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 16:6" />Ado adieke ami ntañña ikọ, ubiak mmi isuuhọke;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:6">ndin ñkpedop uyio, anye isʌkkọ itre.<verse eid="JOB 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 16:7" />Ke akpanikọ, Abasi, afo amenam ami ñkpa mba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:7">afo amesobo afịd mbon ufọk mmi.<verse eid="JOB 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 16:8" />Afo amenam idem mmi asat, ndin anye akappa ado ntiense;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:8">ndiọọkidem mmi adakka ke anyọñ atañ ikọ ntiense ambaña miin.<verse eid="JOB 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 16:9" />Iyadesịd Abasi adakka ada añwai miin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:9">anyʌñ akwaaha eded amọ ambaña miin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:9">asua mmi awuuk anyen ifiobesịd amọ anse miin.<verse eid="JOB 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 16:10" />Mme awo etat inua ammọ ennọ miin ñnyọọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:10">ammọ entuak miin ebek ke emiom</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:10">enyʌñ esọñ ediana keed enam ikọ mme ami.<verse eid="JOB 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 16:11" />Abasi añyaak miin anọ mbon i-imiidiọọñọke Abasi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:11">anyʌñ antop miin asịn ke ubọk mbon ibak.<verse eid="JOB 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 16:12" />Afịd ñkpọ amaafọn ye ami, ado anye ansuan miin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:12">anye amammʌm miin ke itọñ anyʌñ antọ asuan.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 16:12">Anye annam miin iso idañ amọ;<verse eid="JOB 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 16:13" />mme nta atobidañ amọ eñkanna miin ekʌk.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 16:13">Anye akịm ekpuud mmi inyʌññọ iñkop udʌk</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:13">anyʌñ aduọk atidod mmi ke isọñ.<verse eid="JOB 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 16:14" />Anye ambom miin amaana ambom;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:14">anye afeghe ambịne miin nte awo ekọñ.<verse eid="JOB 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 16:15" />Mmekịm afọñikpo nsịne ke idem</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:15">ñnyʌñ mbuuk adudu akoiso mmi ke ntọñ.<verse eid="JOB 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 16:16" />Iso mmi adat akeene ntuaayịd,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:16">ndukpọñ ekịm atọ akanna anyen mmi;<verse eid="JOB 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 16:17" />ado ubọk mmi inamma afai</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:17">ñko akam mmi ado adisana.<verse eid="JOB 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 16:18" />Isọñ, kuufʌk iyiib mmi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:18">kuuyak ayịd mmi abọ nduọkadudu!<verse eid="JOB 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 16:19" />Idem idahami, ntiense mmi aba ke hefịn;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:19">ibededem mmi anyʌñ aba ke anyọñ.<verse eid="JOB 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 16:20" />Andinam ñkpeubọk innọọ miin ado ufan mmi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:20">naña anyen mmi atua mmọọñayịd anọ Abasi;<verse eid="JOB 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 16:21" />Ke iwuod awo, anye akpeiye Abasi ubọk</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:21">nte awo akpeiye ubọk anọ ufan amọ.<verse eid="JOB 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 16:22" />Ibad-ibad isua adiiboiyo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:22">mbemiso ami ndʌk usʌñ ake mmendiitịmmeke edem.<verse eid="JOB 16:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JOB 17" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 17:1" />Sịbidịd mmi a-abʌññọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:1">ekpịkke mme usen uwem mmi nọ amʌhọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:1">udi asʌk ana ambet miin.<verse eid="JOB 17:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 17:2" />Ke akpanikọ mbon nsaha eñkanna miin ekʌk;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:2">anyen mmi ana awʌhọ ke ukọbọ ammọ.<verse eid="JOB 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 17:3" />“O Abasi, nnọ miin, enwọñọ a-afo ayemme.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:3">Anie awo mfen adiitie ubiọñ innọ miin?<verse eid="JOB 17:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 17:4" />Afo uyakka ammọ enie ifiọk ke esịd ammọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:4">ke ntoro afo uduuyakka ammọ enie edikan.<verse eid="JOB 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 17:5" />Adieke awo ndomokeed akañña mme ufan ammọ ke ntak udod,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:5">anyen nditọ ammọ eyaekịm.<verse eid="JOB 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 17:6" />“Abasi anam ami ndo ufiid nnọ afịd awo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:6">awo a-adooho afịd awo etọ anye etab ke iso.<verse eid="JOB 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 17:7" />Anyen mmi akịm ke mfʌhọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:7">afịd ekpadidem mmi adido kpa ndukpọñ.<verse eid="JOB 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 17:8" />Ndinen awo eba ke ñkpaidem ebaña ñkpọ ami;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:8">mbon i-imiidueghe ekop iyadesịd ebaña mbon se imiidiọọñọke Abasi.<verse eid="JOB 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 17:9" />Kpayeado mme ndinen awo eyaemʌm usʌñ ammọ ekama,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:9">ndin mbon se ubọk ammọ asaana eyaenekke esọọñ idem.<verse eid="JOB 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 17:10" />“Ado afịd ndufo, isaña idi, imaana idomo ise!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:10">Ami ndiikịtte anie ifiọk awo ndomokeed ke atu ndufo.<verse eid="JOB 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 17:11" />Mme usen mmi eboiyo, mme uduak mmi etịmede.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:11">Ado mme udọñ esịd mmi<verse eid="JOB 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 17:12" />anam akonayio akappa uweemeayio;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:12">ke iso ekịm unwana akpere.<verse eid="JOB 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 17:13" />Adieke ukweeñe ufọkidʌñ a-ami nnieghe idodanyen adikịt adooho udi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:13">adieke ami ntatta mbịd itie nnaa mmi ke ikpeghe ekịm,<verse eid="JOB 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 17:14" />adieke ami mbooho ndudiọ eduuwem nte, ‘Afo ado ete mmi,’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:14">ñnyʌñ mbo utʌñ, ‘Afo ado eka mmi’ me ‘ayịneka mmi awonwaan,’<verse eid="JOB 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 17:15" />mmọọ ndin ke idodanyen mmi aba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:15">anie awo akan akịt idodanyen annọ miin?<verse eid="JOB 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 17:16" />Nte anye ayaasọiyọ ikaa ke mme inuaatob ñkpa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:16">Mme ñnyịn iyaisọiyọ afịd ñnyịn ikaa ke ntañ?”<verse eid="JOB 17:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JOB 18" />
  <para style="s1">Bildad</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 18:1" />Akem Bildad a-atooho Suu amaabọọrọ ate:<verse eid="JOB 18:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 18:2" />“Idaha akee ke afo uduutre mme uwak ikọ ami?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:2">Wọt ndiọọñọidem, ndin ñnyịn imikeme editañ ikọ.<verse eid="JOB 18:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 18:3" />Ntak edatta ñnyịn nte mme enañ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:3">enyʌñ edat ñnyịn nte mme ndisịme ke iso mfo-o?<verse eid="JOB 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 18:4" />Afo a-awaaha idem mfo mbai-mbai ato iyadesịd,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:4">nte eyaefre anyen ebaña ederimbod ke ntak mfo?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:4">Me ana nte ebenne itiad esio ke itie ammọ?<verse eid="JOB 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 18:5" />“Enịme utuenikañ awo ibak;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:5">edemeikañ amọ atre adisak.<verse eid="JOB 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 18:6" />Unwana ke atayad amọ akappa ekịm;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:6">utuenikañ a-anaaha akpere anye anịme.<verse eid="JOB 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 18:7" />Adudu ikpadisañ amọ ameem;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:7">mme uduak amọ etop anye eduọọk ke isọñ.<verse eid="JOB 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 18:8" />Mme ukod amọ eben anye ekesịn ke iyịre;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:8">anye ayooñ akedʌk afia amọ.<verse eid="JOB 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 18:9" />Afia amʌm anye ke itịghitịghi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:9">ekpọ afia amʌm anye asọñ.<verse eid="JOB 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 18:10" />Edịb udʌkekpan adimʌm anye ke isọñ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:10">afia anaa ke usʌñisañ amọ.<verse eid="JOB 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 18:11" />Mme ñkpọ ndịk ekanna anye ekʌk</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:11">enyʌñ edukeene anye ke afịd ikpadisañ.<verse eid="JOB 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 18:12" />Ñkpọntịppe atie abiọọñ ayem anye;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:12">nsobo abeeñe idem abet anye ke anye amaaduọ.<verse eid="JOB 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 18:13" />Anye ata mme ubaak ikpaidem amọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:13">akpa ayịn ñkpa ata mme ñkprañ amọ.<verse eid="JOB 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 18:14" />Ewai anye esio ke ukpeme atayad amọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:14">enyʌñ eben anye ekaa ke iso adidem ndoom.<verse eid="JOB 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 18:15" />Ikañ adọdʌñ ke atayad amọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:15">ikañ sọlfọ asuana ke afịd atʌñ amọ.<verse eid="JOB 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 18:16" />Mme adʌñ amọ eto ke idak esaat</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:16">mme ñkọk amọ enyʌñ eyeeme ke anyọñ.<verse eid="JOB 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 18:17" />Mme ñkpọ edatta etoiyo anye etak ke ederimbod;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:17">anye inieghe anyịñ ndomokeed ke iso isọñ.<verse eid="JOB 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 18:18" />Ebịne anye esio ke unwana esịn ke ikpeghe ekịm</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:18">enyʌñ ebịne anye esio ke ederimbod.<verse eid="JOB 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 18:19" />Anye inieghe ayịn me ayeyịn ndomokeed ke afịd ubon amọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:19">Awo ndomokeed isʌhọke ke itie nte anye akedʌñ.<verse eid="JOB 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 18:20" />Mbon e-ebaaha ke ñkañ usobutịn ekop ñkpaidem ebaña uwa amọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:20">ndịk anyʌñ amʌm mbon e-ebaaha ke ñkañ usakkautịn.<verse eid="JOB 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 18:21" />Ke akpanikọ utọ itie ado, ado itie idʌñ ake idiọọk awo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:21">utọ itie ado, ado itie awo adiidiọọñọke Abasi.”<verse eid="JOB 18:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JOB 19" />
  <para style="s1">Yoob</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 19:1" />Ndin Yoob amaabọọrọ:<verse eid="JOB 19:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 19:2" />“Afo uduuntʌkkọ miin ukpeene die</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:2">unyʌñ unnuak miin ye mme ikọ?<verse eid="JOB 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 19:3" />Akañ duob adom ndufo emesua ennọ miin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:3">emetañ ikọ ye ami inieghe iso abuud.<verse eid="JOB 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 19:4" />Adieke adooho akpanikọ ke ami mmewuọ ñkpọñ usʌñ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:4">ndudue mmi ambeghe miin ikpọọñ.<verse eid="JOB 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 19:5" />Adieke adooho ndufo ebo ke imifọn iñkan miin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:5">enyʌñ edat asuenne mmi ennọ ñnyọọ,<verse eid="JOB 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 19:6" />ndin idiọọñọ ibo ke Abasi andue miin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:6">anyʌñ adat iyịre amọ awañ añkanna miin.<verse eid="JOB 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 19:7" />“Akpesʌkado ami mbọññọ, ‘Afai!’ Ami mbọọhọ ibọọrọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:7">akpesʌkado ami ntuaha ñyem unwam, unen ibaaha.<verse eid="JOB 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 19:8" />Anye amaasiit usʌñ mmi mbaak ami ndiboiyo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:8">anye amaanyʌñ afʌk usʌñ mmi ke ekịm.<verse eid="JOB 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 19:9" />Anye amaanyʌñ ansịññe miin afọn ukpono ke idem</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:9">anyʌñ ayaara anyanya ubọọñ ke iwuod mmi.<verse eid="JOB 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 19:10" />Anye añwai miin ke afịd idaha tutu ami mbaaha aba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:10">anye awịppe idodanyen mmi aduọọk nte eto.<verse eid="JOB 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 19:11" />Iyadesịd amọ ansak miin ke idem;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:11">anye ambat miin asịn ke atu mme asua amọ.<verse eid="JOB 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 19:12" />Mme udịm ekọñ amọ embịne ke adudu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:12">ammọ ebọp akọ eñkanna miin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:12">enyʌñ enam nnaaekọñ ekanna atayad mmi.<verse eid="JOB 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 19:13" />“Anye adiañña ubon mmi añkpọñ miin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:13">anyʌñ adiañña afịd mme adiọọñọ mmi añkpọñ miin.<verse eid="JOB 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 19:14" />Mbon ufọk mmi enyʌñ edakka eñkpọñ miin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:14">mme akpan ufan mmi efre anyen embaña miin.<verse eid="JOB 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 19:15" />Mme isenawo mmi ye mme nditọufọk mmi ibaan ekappa embat miin nte awo asenidịd;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:15">ammọ edikappa ense miin nte asenawo.<verse eid="JOB 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 19:16" />Ami ñkoot ayịnufọk mmi, ado anye imbọọrọke,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:16">akpesʌkado ami ndatta inua mmi ñkpeiye anye.<verse eid="JOB 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 19:17" />Inweek mmi atetek anwaan mmi esịd;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:17">Ami ñyedo ñkpọ ndọk nnọ mbon ufọk mmi.<verse eid="JOB 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 19:18" />Idem ata ntək ideen ensuenne miin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:18">Ami mmaawuọ ndeppe, ammọ endọọñ ndọk.<verse eid="JOB 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 19:19" />Afịd mme akpan ufan mmi ensua miin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:19">mbon ami mmaaha ekanna enwana ye ami.<verse eid="JOB 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 19:20" />Ami ndisʌhọ ikpọkidem ye akpọ kpọd;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:20">Ami ñnyʌñ mbọkkọ ke ataa nsịñ.<verse eid="JOB 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 19:21" />“Intua miin mbọm, mme ufan mmi, intua mbọm,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:21">sia ubọk Abasi ammia miin ikpa.<verse eid="JOB 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 19:22" />Ntak ake ndufo embịneke miin naña Abasi ambịne?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:22">Nte ndufo iyʌkkọke ye abʌkidem mmi?<verse eid="JOB 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 19:23" />“Sai, akpekapado ke ekeweewet mme ikọ mmi enịm,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:23">akpekapado ke emaewet ammọ esịn ke ñwed,<verse eid="JOB 19:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 19:24" />ke emaedat etoñwed ukwak ekap mme ikọ mmi esịn ke ñked,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:24">me adikap ikọ mmi nsịn ke itiad ke nsi-nsi!<verse eid="JOB 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 19:25" />Ami mmediọọñọ nte ke andimfak miin asʌk adodu uwem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:25">ndin ke akpatre anye ayaada ke ederimbod.<verse eid="JOB 19:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 19:26" />Ndin ke ikpọkidem mmi amaabiara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:26">ado ke abʌkidem mmi ami ñyaakịt Abasi;<verse eid="JOB 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 19:27" />Ami ke idem mmi ñyaakịt anye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:27">ke ata anyen mmi ikpọọñ, ami, idooho awo mfen.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:27">Se naña esịd mmi akop udọñ ke esịd idem mmi!<verse eid="JOB 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 19:28" />“Adieke afo abooho, ‘ñnyịn idiinam die ikọbọ anye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:28">sia akpanadʌñ mfịna ami abere ke anye,’<verse eid="JOB 19:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 19:29" />Akpena ndufo ekop ndịk ebaña akañkañ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:29">sia iyadesịd ayaaben ufen asañake ke akañkañ adi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:29">ndin ndufo eyaediọọñọ ke ubiomikpe aba.”<verse eid="JOB 19:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JOB 20" />
  <para style="s1">Sofa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 20:1" />Ndin Sofa a-adooho awo Naama amaabọọrọ:<verse eid="JOB 20:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 20:2" />“Mme akikere mmi atịmekede añnyịk miin nọ mbọọrọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:2">sia ñkpọ ami a-anekke amfịna miin.<verse eid="JOB 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 20:3" />Ami mmekop nduaiya ake iminnọọhọ miin ukpono,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:3">ndin ndiọọñọidem mmi añnyịk miin adibọọrọ.<verse eid="JOB 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 20:4" />“Ke akpanikọ afo amediọọñọ naña aba tọọñọ ke esed,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:4">tọọñọ ekebot awo esịn ke ederimbod,<verse eid="JOB 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 20:5" />imam awo ibak ikpeeneke,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:5">idaara mbon se imiidiọọñọke abasi aba ke etək-etək ini.<verse eid="JOB 20:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 20:6" />Akpekọm ntañidem mbon imiidiọọñọke Abasi adọọk akesịm mme hefịn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:6">ndin iwuod amọ anyʌñ atuuk ntọñanyọñ,<verse eid="JOB 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 20:7" />anye ayaatak ke nsi-nsi, nte uduañ amọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:7">mbon e-ekịtte anye eyaebo ete, ‘Anye aba ke mmọọ?’<verse eid="JOB 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 20:8" />Nte ndab anye afuurọ awuọ, awo ikịtte anye aba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:8">enyʌñ ebịne anye eduọọk nte ñkukịd akonayio.<verse eid="JOB 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 20:9" />Anyen a-akekịtte anye idiikịtte anye aba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:9">itie amọ idiiyemme anye aba.<verse eid="JOB 20:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 20:10" />Nditọ amọ ana nte enam emem ye mme uweene;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:10">ubọk amọ ñko ana ayaak ubaak inie amọ.<verse eid="JOB 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 20:11" />Adudu akparawa amọ a-ayọhọke akpọ amọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:11">ayaanaa ye anye ke ntọñ.<verse eid="JOB 20:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 20:12" />“Akpesʌkado idiọọkñkpọ anemme anye ke inua</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:12">anye anyʌñ adịp anye ke idak edeme amọ,<verse eid="JOB 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 20:13" />akpesʌkado anye imiikanna iyaak nọ anye anyọñ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:13">anyʌñ ayaak anye asʌhọ ke inua amọ,<verse eid="JOB 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 20:14" />ado ndidia amọ ayaamañ ke esịd idịb amọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:14">ayaakappa ado ifod udʌkikọd ke esịd idem amọ.<verse eid="JOB 20:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 20:15" />Anye ayaakọkkọ mme inie se anye akemen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:15">Abasi ayaanam idịb amọ akọk afịd ammọ.<verse eid="JOB 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 20:16" />Anye ayaawọp ifod mme udʌkikọd;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:16">eded ibọm adiiwot anye.<verse eid="JOB 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 20:17" />Anye idiikoppo inem mmọọñ idịm,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:17">mme inyañ e-efiọọrọke ye adanakwọọk ye mmọọñeba.<verse eid="JOB 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 20:18" />Se anye akekpa utom abaña, ana anye asaana ayaak, idiaha ndomokeed;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:18">anye idiidiaha udod akʌk udua amọ.<verse eid="JOB 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 20:19" />Sia anye afiik mme uweene anyʌñ anam ammọ edo nditọakpa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:19">anye abọ mme ufọk anye imiikibọppọ ke ñkanubọk.<verse eid="JOB 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 20:20" />“Ke akpanikọ anye idiinieghe emem ito afịd udọñ amọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:20">anye ikanna inyaaña idem amọ kpa ye afịd inie amọ.<verse eid="JOB 20:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 20:21" />Ñkpọ ndomokeed isʌhọke aba inọ anye se afʌk adia;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:21">imọ amọ idiikpeeneke.<verse eid="JOB 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 20:22" />Ke ufọọd uwak inie amọ, nnananyen ayaabem anye iso;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:22">afịd ubọk adudu ndiọhọñkpọ ayaadoro anye ke idem.<verse eid="JOB 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 20:23" />Anye amaadia yak idịb amọ ayọk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:23">Abasi ayaanwañña ikañ iyadesịd amọ afʌk anye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:23">anyʌñ atọọñ anye eta ke idem.<verse eid="JOB 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 20:24" />Akpekọm anye afegheke akpọñ ñkpọekọñ ukwak,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:24">asọbọ iso idañ e-enamma ke akpoho atịppe anye idem.<verse eid="JOB 20:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 20:25" />Anye awʌkkọ idañ ado asio ke edem amọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:25">nsem-nsem inua idañ ado awʌkkọ awuọ ke atidod esịd amọ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 20:25">Ndịk ayaafʌk anye afịd idem;<verse eid="JOB 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 20:26" />ekamba ekịm adịbe abet mme inie amọ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 20:26">Ikañ ake awo imiifịmme ayaata anye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:26">anyʌñ asobo afịd ñkpọ se isʌhọ ke atayad amọ.<verse eid="JOB 20:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 20:27" />Mme hefịn eyaeyaara mme ndudue amọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:27">isọñ ederimbod ayaadakka ada anwana ye anye.<verse eid="JOB 20:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 20:28" />Mmọọñ ndiọọñ edịm ayaaben ufọk amọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:28">awawa mmọọñ a-afegheke ke usen iyadesịd Abasi.<verse eid="JOB 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 20:29" />Mme ñkpọ ntoro ado udeeme se Abasi aduak anọ mme idiọọk awo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:29">asaña-asaña udeeme se Abasi anịm anọ ammọ.”<verse eid="JOB 20:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JOB 21" />
  <para style="s1">Yoob</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 21:1" />Ndin Yoob amaabọọrọ:<verse eid="JOB 21:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 21:2" />“Nekke kpañ utọñ nọ mme ikọ mmi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:2">yak ami ado ndọñesịd ake afo annọọhọ miin.<verse eid="JOB 21:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 21:3" />Nie ime ye ami idaha ake ami ntañña ikọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:3">ndin ke ami mmaatañ ikọ mma, amekeme adikaiso adidọọñ.<verse eid="JOB 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 21:4" />“Nte aseeme mmi aka abịne awo?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:4">Ntak ami me ñkpenanake ime-e?<verse eid="JOB 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 21:5" />Nse miin nyʌñ yak idem ukpa fiin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:5">mia ubọk mfo ke inua nyʌñ kpọk ukịbe.<verse eid="JOB 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 21:6" />Ami mmaakere mbaña ñkpọ ami, ndịk annam miin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:6">akpọsọñ ñnyeñidem ammʌm afịd idem.<verse eid="JOB 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 21:7" />Ntak a-ndiọi awo eduuho uwem-e,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:7">edu uwem esọñ enyʌñ ekaa iso enenekke enie adudu?<verse eid="JOB 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 21:8" />Ammọ ekịt nditọ ammọ naña ewuọñọ ñkpọ, ekanna ammọ ekʌk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:8">mme nditọ ammọ enyʌñ eba ammọ ke iso.<verse eid="JOB 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 21:9" />Mme ufọk ammọ eba ke ifuuro, ndịk ibaaha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:9">esañ Abasi inyʌññọ idoro ammọ ke idem.<verse eid="JOB 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 21:10" />Ñyaaraenañ ammọ itreke adiboon nditọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:10">mme umanenañ ammọ eman nditọ idịb inyʌññọ iwuọñọ.<verse eid="JOB 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 21:11" />Ammọ edọñ nditọ ammọ ewuọñọ nte atu edọñ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:11">mme ntəkayịn ammọ enek unek ekanna.<verse eid="JOB 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 21:12" />Ammọ ekwọ ikwọ esịn ke uyio ibịdubọk ye ndidoudʌk;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:12">ammọ ekama uyom adʌk enam idaara.<verse eid="JOB 21:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 21:13" />Ammọ enyʌñ edia isua uwem ammọ ke uforo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:13">enyʌñ esọiyọ ekaa udi ke emem.<verse eid="JOB 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 21:14" />Ado ammọ ebo Abasi ete, ‘Saana ñnyịn yaak!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:14">Ñnyịn inieghe udọñ adidiọọñọ mme usʌñ mfo.<verse eid="JOB 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 21:15" />Anie ido Andikoñ Ñkan, se ñnyịn ikpinam ñkpọ inọọ anye?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:15">Nsoo ke ñnyịn idiidia nte udod ke edibọñ akam nnọọ anye?’<verse eid="JOB 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 21:16" />Ado uforo ammọ isịneke ke ubọk ammọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:16">anam ami nsịkke nda anyan usʌñ ñkpọñ mme uduak mbon ibak.<verse eid="JOB 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 21:17" />“Ado akañ ifañ ke utuenikañ idiọọk awo anịme?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:17">Akañ ifañ ke nsobo asịm ammọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:17">mme ñkpọ se Abasi adeeme anọ ammọ ke iyadesịd?<verse eid="JOB 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 21:18" />Akañ ifañ ke ammọ ebit ñnyanyaha ke iso afịm,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:18">enyʌñ eba nte mbio ake afịm ayobio akwọọhọ aduọk?<verse eid="JOB 21:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 21:19" />Esibo, ‘Abasi akpuut ufen mbon ibak abono anọ nditọ ammọ.’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:19">Yak anye anọ mbon ibak utịb, yak ammọ ke idem ammọ ekop naña asiba!<verse eid="JOB 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 21:20" />Yak anyen ammọ ekịt nsobo ammọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:20">yak ammọ enwọñ kọọb iyadesịd Andikoñ Ñkan.<verse eid="JOB 21:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 21:21" />Nsoo ke ammọ ekere ebaña mme ubon ake ammọ edakkake ekpọñ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:21">ke ini mme afiọñ usen uwem ekenịmme enọ ammọ amaadikem?<verse eid="JOB 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 21:22" />“Nte aba awo ndomokeed a-akemeke adikpeep Abasi ifiọk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:22">sia anye akpeeghe ikpe anọ idem mbon ake ekoñño eti-eti?<verse eid="JOB 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 21:23" />Awo keed akpa ke ayọhọ nsọñidem</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:23">aba ke ayọhọ ukpeme anyʌñ atie ke ifuuro,<verse eid="JOB 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 21:24" />anekke adia ayʌkkọ ke ikpaidem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:24">mme akpọ amọ enyʌñ eyọhọ ye akpọñ.<verse eid="JOB 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 21:25" />Awo mfen akpa ato ke idod ukpọñ amọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:25">a-adooho kpaanam anye ikoppo inem eti ñkpọ ndomokeed.<verse eid="JOB 21:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 21:26" />Naña ammọ iba enaa ñkañ ke ñkañ ke ntọñ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:26">ndin ndọñ afʌk naña ammọ iba afịd idem.<verse eid="JOB 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 21:27" />“Ami mmenekke ndiọọñọ afịd-afịd se afo akere,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:27">mme ñkara a-afo ayemme adinnam miin idiọọk.<verse eid="JOB 21:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 21:28" />Afo abo, ‘Mmọ ndin ufọk akpọsọñ awo idahami,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:28">mme atayad ake mbon ibak ekedʌñọke?’<verse eid="JOB 21:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 21:29" />Nte kpaanam afo ubịppe mme akaisañ mbuume?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:29">Nte afo udọññọ anyen ke se ammọ etañ?<verse eid="JOB 21:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 21:30" />Ke enyaaña mbon ibak esio ke usen nsobo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:30">ke enyaaña ammọ esio ke usen akpọsọñ iyadesịd?<verse eid="JOB 21:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 21:31" />Anie isuainọ ndiọi ido ammọ ke iso ammọ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:31">Anie inọ ammọ utịb ke se ammọ enam?<verse eid="JOB 21:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 21:32" />Eben ammọ ekaa udi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:32">enyʌñ enịm ukpeme ke mme itiad udi ammọ.<verse eid="JOB 21:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 21:33" />Ntan isọñ ke abedeñ anenemme ammọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:33">afịd awo ekeene ammọ ke edem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:33">ndin uwak udịm awo eboiyo ammọ ke iso.<verse eid="JOB 21:33" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 21:34" />“Ndin afo akeme die adindọñ miin esịd ye ndisịme mfo?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:34">Ñkpọ ndomokeed isʌhọke ke mme ibọọrọ mfo ke imiibọhọke nsu!”<verse eid="JOB 21:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="JOB 22" />
  <para style="s1">Elifas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 22:1" />Ndin Elifas awo Teman amaabọọrọ ate:<verse eid="JOB 22:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 22:2" />“Nte awo akeme adiba ufọn nnọọ Abasi?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:2">Nte idem awo a-anieghe ifiọk akeme adiba ufọn nnọọ anye?<verse eid="JOB 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 22:3" />Nsoo inemesịd ke Andikoñ Ñkan adiinie adieke afo akpedooho adisana awo?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:3">Nsoo idiido udod amọ adieke afo akpenanake ndudue?<verse eid="JOB 22:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 22:4" />“Nte ado ke ntak uteeñe mfo anam anye uduat fiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:4">anyʌñ ubiom fiin ikpe?<verse eid="JOB 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 22:5" />Nte ibak mfo ikponno?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:5">Idiọọkñkpọ mfo inieghe utịd.<verse eid="JOB 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 22:6" />Afo amaayem ñkpọubiọñ ato nditọete mfo ke unana ntak;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:6">afo amaasịññe mme awo afọñ ke idem, anyʌñ asuuk ammọ ifed.<verse eid="JOB 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 22:7" />Afo ukunọọhọ mbon nsaditọñ mmọọñ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:7">anyʌñ anyịm mbon abiọọñ ndidia,<verse eid="JOB 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 22:8" />akpesʌkado afo akedooho akpọsọñ awo, a-anieghe isọñ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:8">awo a-anieghe ukpono, anyʌñ adʌñ ke isọñ ado.<verse eid="JOB 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 22:9" />Afo amaanyʌñ abịne mme ebekpa enyọñọ ubọk ñkaña</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:9">anyʌñ abuuñ adudu nditọakpa.<verse eid="JOB 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 22:10" />Ntak ado anam mme afia ukanna fiin ekʌk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:10">ntak adiwad ndịk umʌmmọ fiin,<verse eid="JOB 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 22:11" />ntak e-ekịm afʌkkọ isọñ tutu afo ukanna ukịt usʌñ-ọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:11">ñko ntak a-mmọọñ ndiọọñ edịm ufʌkkọ fiin-e.<verse eid="JOB 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 22:12" />“Nte Abasi ibaaha ke mme etịñe hefịn?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:12">Anyʌñ ase naña ntantaafiọñ akokko idem!<verse eid="JOB 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 22:13" />Ado afo abo, ‘Nsoo ke Abasi adiọọñọ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:13">Nte anye atie akpe ikpe ke ekịm?<verse eid="JOB 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 22:14" />Ntọñanyọñ afʌk anye, ndin anye ikịtte ñnyịn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:14">naña anye asaña aboiyo ke ubeed mme hefịn.’<verse eid="JOB 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 22:15" />Nte afo ayaakaa iso asaña ke usʌñ esed</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:15">a-mbon ibak ekesañake?<verse eid="JOB 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 22:16" />Emaeben ammọ efep mbemiso ini ammọ akem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:16">atọ mmọọñ amaayet itiad idakisọñ ammọ afep.<verse eid="JOB 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 22:17" />Ammọ emaebo Abasi, ‘Ikpọñ ñnyịn ndin!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:17">Nsoo ke Andikponñkan akeme adinam ñnyịn?’<verse eid="JOB 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 22:18" />Ado kpasʌk anye akeyọhọ ufọk ammọ ye nti ñkpọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:18">ndin ami nsañake ñkpọ ye uduak mbon ibak.<verse eid="JOB 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 22:19" />Ndinen awo ekịt iduọ ammọ enyʌñ edaara;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:19">mbon i-imiidueghe ñkpọ esaha ammọ, ete,<verse eid="JOB 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 22:20" />‘Ke akpanikọ esobo uwem mme asua ñnyịn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:20">ndin ikañ anyʌñ ata inie ammọ.’<verse eid="JOB 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 22:21" />“Yaak idem nọ Abasi nyʌñ ba ke emem ye anye;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:21">ke utọ usʌñ ntom ke uforo aduukeene fiin.<verse eid="JOB 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 22:22" />Bọ item to inua amọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:22">nyʌñ bono mme ikọ amọ ke esịd mfo.<verse eid="JOB 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 22:23" />Adieke afo atịmmeke akeene Andikoñ Ñkan, anye ayaatịmme unọ fiin unen mfo:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:23">adieke afo asioho ibak afep aka anyan usʌñ akpọñ atayad mfo<verse eid="JOB 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 22:24" />anyʌñ abat nsọñudua ñkpọ mfo nte ado ntọñ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:24">mme kold Ọfia mfo nte edo itiad e-ebaaha ke abedeñ,<verse eid="JOB 22:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 22:25" />ndin Andikoñ Ñkan ayaado kold mfo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:25">anyʌñ ado ataa mfọnñkan silfa unọ fiin.<verse eid="JOB 22:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 22:26" />Ke akpanikọ ndin afo ayaakịt idadesịd ke Andikoñ Ñkan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:26">ayaanyʌñ abenne iso mfo ase Abasi.<verse eid="JOB 22:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 22:27" />Afo ayaabọñ akam anọ anye, ndin anye ayaukop fiin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:27">ndin afo ayaasio mme enwọñọ mfo.<verse eid="JOB 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 22:28" />Se afo abiide ke uduak esịd mfo eyaenam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:28">ndin ikañ unwana ayaayamma ke mme usʌñ mfo.<verse eid="JOB 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 22:29" />Emaesuuhọ mme awo inịm ke isọñ ndin afo abo, ‘Idịppe ammọ ke anyọñ!’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:29">ndin anye ayaanyaaña mbon se iba ke mfʌhọ.<verse eid="JOB 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 22:30" />Anye ayaafak kpa awo a-adueghe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:30">eyaefak anye abọkkọ ato ke ntak ubọk mfo a-adooho adisana.”<verse eid="JOB 22:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="JOB 23" />
  <para style="s1">Yoob</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 23:1" />Ndin Yoob amaabọọrọ ate:<verse eid="JOB 23:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 23:2" />“Kpa mfịn ami aseeme mmi ado idod-idod;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:2">akpesʌkado ami mbaaha ke ñkuun, ubọk amọ adoppo.”<verse eid="JOB 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 23:3" />Akpekapado mmediọọñọ itie nte ñkpekịt anye;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:3">akpekapado ñkpaakan ñka ke itie idʌñ amọ!<verse eid="JOB 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 23:4" />Ami ñkpaatañ se ido mfịna mmi ke iso amọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:4">ñnyʌñ ñyọhọ inua mmi ye mme mfaaña.<verse eid="JOB 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 23:5" />Ami ñkpaadiọọñọ se anye akpembọọrọ miin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:5">ñnyʌñ ndiọọñọ se anye adiitañ innọ miin.<verse eid="JOB 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 23:6" />Me anye adiifaaña mfaaña ye ami akpọsọñ-akpọsọñ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:6">Iyoo, anye idimbiommo miin ikpe.<verse eid="JOB 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 23:7" />Do ke mme ndinen awo ediwọt unen ammọ ke iso amọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:7">itie ado ke ami ndiinie nsi-nsi ñkpọkñyak ke ubọk abiideikpe mmi.<verse eid="JOB 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 23:8" />“Ado adieke ami ñkaaha usakkautịn, anye ibaaha do;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:8">adieke ami ñkaaha usobutịn, ami ñkịtte anye.<verse eid="JOB 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 23:9" />Ke ini anye abaaha ke utom ke adoro, ami ñkịtte anye;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:9">anye amaakanna aka usuuk, ami ñkịtte ndukpọñ amọ.<verse eid="JOB 23:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 23:10" />Ado anye adiọọñọ usʌñ ake ami nsañake;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:10">ke anye amandomo miin ise, ami ñyaasana nte kold.<verse eid="JOB 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 23:11" />Ñkpad mmi akeene anye ikpad ke ikpad;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:11">Ami mmenịm mme ewʌhọ usʌñ amọ ñkannake edem.<verse eid="JOB 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 23:12" />Ami ñwuọhọ ñkpọñ mme item inua amọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:12">Ami mmemʌm mme ikọ inua amọ ñkama ñkan udia usen.<verse eid="JOB 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 23:13" />“Ado anye ada ikpọọñ, ndin anie ikeme adifaaña mfaaña ye anye?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:13">Anye anam se anye ama.<verse eid="JOB 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 23:14" />Anye anam mme ewʌhọ amọ asu ke idem mmi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:14">ñko uwak uduak ntoro anye asʌk anenie.<verse eid="JOB 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 23:15" />Ntak ado anam ami ñkop ekamba ndịk ke iso amọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:15">ami mmaakere mbaña mme ñkpọ ami, ami mbaak anye.<verse eid="JOB 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 23:16" />Abasi anam esịd esịd anduọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:16">Andikoñ Ñkan andịkke miin.<verse eid="JOB 23:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 23:17" />Ado ekịm inamma yak ami ndop uyio,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:17">akpọsọñ ekịm a-afʌkkọ iso mmi.<verse eid="JOB 23:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter eid="JOB 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="JOB 24" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 24:1" />“Nsoo inam nọ Andikoñ Ñkan imiinịmme ini inọ ubiideikpe?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:1">Nsoo inam nọ mbon e-ediọọñọke anye etie ebet utọ usen ntoro ke ikpu-ikpu?<verse eid="JOB 24:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 24:2" />Aba mme awo esịkkeke mme itiad adaña;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:2">ammọ ebọọk udịmedọñ ake ammọ eyịppe.<verse eid="JOB 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 24:3" />Ammọ ebịne dọñki ayịn akpa eduọñọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:3">enyʌñ eben ayaaraenañ ebekpa ke ubiọñ.<verse eid="JOB 24:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 24:4" />Ammọ ebịne mbio unana esio ke usʌñ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:4">enyʌñ ebịne afịd mme uweene ke abio ke adudu yak ekedịbe.<verse eid="JOB 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 24:5" />Nte mme dọñki ikọd ke akpautatan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:5">mme uweene ekaa iso ke utom adisara ñyem ndidia;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:5">mme isọñ mmọọñ enọ nditọ ammọ ndidia.<verse eid="JOB 24:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 24:6" />Ammọ ekpịkke ikịm ke mme inwañ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:6">enyʌñ esaara ñkpọ ke inwañ fain mbon ibak.<verse eid="JOB 24:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 24:7" />Ke ntak unana afọñ, ammọ enaa ifed akonayio;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:7">ammọ inieghe ñkpọ ndomokeed adifʌk idem ammọ ke atueb.<verse eid="JOB 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 24:8" />Edịm ikpọabod abọñ ammọ adʌppọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:8">ammọ enyʌñ efat mme itiad ke ntak unana itie idʌñ.<verse eid="JOB 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 24:9" />Ewappa ayịnakpa esio ke eba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:9">eben nsekayịn awo uweene ke isọn.<verse eid="JOB 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 24:10" />Ke ntak unana afọñ, ammọ esaaña ifed;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:10">akpesʌkado ammọ ebiommo mme abek abakpa, ado esʌk etie abiọọñ.<verse eid="JOB 24:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 24:11" />Ammọ ekọk mfịd ọlif ke mme mben esa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:11">ammọ eba ke afe utem ukọd, ado itọñ asat ammọ.<verse eid="JOB 24:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 24:12" />Mmịm mbon e-ekịtte ukuud ñkpa eyọhọ abio,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:12">ndin ukpọñ mbon edatta unan etua eyem unwam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:12">Ado Abasi ibiommo awo ndomokeed ikpe nnamndue.<verse eid="JOB 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 24:13" />“Aba mbon e-enwanake ye unwana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:13">ake imiidiọọñọke mme usʌñ amọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:13">me edisaña ke mme afañ amọ.<verse eid="JOB 24:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 24:14" />Ke ini utịn uweemeayio amaanyọñ, awodawo adakka ada,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:14">awot mme uweene ye mbon unana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:14">ndin ke akonayio anye asọọp nte inọ.<verse eid="JOB 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 24:15" />Anyen awo a-anamma efịbe akpeme ekịm;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:15">anye akere, ‘Ibaaha anyen awo se idiñkịt miin,’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:15">ndin anye adịp iso amọ.<verse eid="JOB 24:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 24:16" />Ke ekịm, mme inọ ebom mme ufọk edọñọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:16">ado ke uweeme ammọ edịb idem ammọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:16">ammọ iyemme adinie ñkpọ ndomokeed ye unwana.<verse eid="JOB 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 24:17" />Afịd mbon ami, ufọọd akonayio ado ubakusen ammọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:17">ammọ enam ufan ye mme ata ñkpọndịk ekịm.<verse eid="JOB 24:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 24:18" />“Ado ammọ edo efuud ke anyọñ mmọọñ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:18">esuuñọ udeeme itie isọñ ammọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:18">mbaak awo ndomokeed adika inwañ fain.<verse eid="JOB 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 24:19" />Naña ufiob ye nsadisọñ aben ntuhube afep,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:19">kpa ntoro ke udi aben mme anam ndiọiñkpọ afep.<verse eid="JOB 24:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 24:20" />Idịb uman afre ammọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:20">mme utʌñ ekama ammọ edia usọrọ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 24:20">awo itoiyoke aba mme anam idiọọk</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:20">ado ammọ ebʌññọ nte eto.<verse eid="JOB 24:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 24:21" />Ammọ enịm mme ada ye ibaan i-imiinieghe ayịn nte ndidia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:21">ndin ammọ ituaha mme ebekpa mbọm.<verse eid="JOB 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 24:22" />Ado Abasi adʌt ñkpọsọñ awo asio ke akpọsọñ adudu amọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:22">akpesʌkado ammọ emaekewuọñọ eda, ammọ inieghe idodanyen ke mmimọ iyaidu uwem.<verse eid="JOB 24:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 24:23" />Anye akeme adinam nọ ammọ ekere ke iminie ukpeme,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:23">ado anyen amọ asʌk ase mme usʌñ ammọ.<verse eid="JOB 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 24:24" />Ammọ ekooñ ke etək-etək ini, ndin ammọ esop;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:24">esuuhọ ammọ enịm ke isọñ enyʌñ ekoono ammọ kpa nte afịd mbon mfen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:24">e-ekpịkke ammọ esio nte iwuod abakpa.<verse eid="JOB 24:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 24:25" />“Adieke imiidooho ntoro, anie ikeme adibo ke nsʌhọ nsu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:25">anyʌñ anam ikọ mmi ado ukpọk?”<verse eid="JOB 24:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="JOB 25" />
  <para style="s1">Bildad</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 25:1" />Ndin Bildad a-atooho Suu amaabọọrọ:<verse eid="JOB 25:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 25:2" />“Nsi-nsi ubọọñ ye uteeñe enie Abasi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 25:2">anye awuuk adaaha ubonoñkpọ ke adikoñ itie hefịn.<verse eid="JOB 25:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 25:3" />Ekpaekan ebat mme udịm ekọñ amọ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 25:3">Anie ke unwana amọ imiiyammake inọ?<verse eid="JOB 25:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 25:4" />Ñkaña awo adiikeme die inen ke iso Abasi?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 25:4">Awo a-awonwaan amanna adiikan die isana?<verse eid="JOB 25:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 25:5" />Adieke idem afiọñ imiiyammake</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 25:5">ndin mme ntantaafiọñ isanake ke anyen amọ,<verse eid="JOB 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 25:6" />Nwaanwa dise ndin ñkaña awo, a-adooho kpa ndọñ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 25:6">awo, a-adooho kpa utʌñ!”<verse eid="JOB 25:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="JOB 26" />
  <para style="s1">Yoob</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 26:1" />Ndin Yoob amaabọọrọ:<verse eid="JOB 26:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 26:2" />“Ke nsoo usʌñ ke afo anwam mbon i-imiinieghe inweek!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:2">Ke nsoo usʌñ ke afo anyaaña mbon se ubọk amem!<verse eid="JOB 26:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 26:3" />Nsoo item ke afo anọọ awo i-imiinieghe aniọñ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:3">Ndin nsoo ekamba ikike ke afo awọt!<verse eid="JOB 26:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 26:4" />Anie unwam fiin nọ atañ mme ikọ ami?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:4">Ñko sịbidịd anie aketañ ikọ ato inua mfo?<verse eid="JOB 26:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 26:5" />“Mme akpañkpa eba ke ekamba ntuaña,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:5">mbon e-ebaaha ke idak mmọọñ ye afịd mbon se idʌñ ke esịd ammọ.<verse eid="JOB 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 26:6" />Abioekpo ana ifed ke iso Abasi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:6">Nsobo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ke Hibru nsobo ado Abadọn </char></note> ana inwañ ke iso amọ.<verse eid="JOB 26:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 26:7" />Anye aben mme ikpaanyọñ ukañ adoro-adoro asuan ke ukpọk itie;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:7">anye amʌm ederimbod akama iyịtte ke ñkpọ ndomokeed;<verse eid="JOB 26:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 26:8" />Anye awañ mmọọñ akama ke ntọñanyọñ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:8">ado mme ntọñanyọñ ibomoke ke idak udob ammọ.<verse eid="JOB 26:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 26:9" />Anye afʌk iso ayọhọ afiọñ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:9">anyʌñ asio ntọñanyọñ afʌk anye.<verse eid="JOB 26:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 26:10" />Anye abakka mme ikpeghe anyʌñ anịm ke anyọñ mmọọñ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:10">ye adaña ke ufọọd unwana ye ekịm.<verse eid="JOB 26:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 26:11" />Mme adaaha ke mme hefịn enyeeñe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:11">ayọhọ mme ndịk ke nduaiya amọ.<verse eid="JOB 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 26:12" />Ke adudu amọ anye abəkko akpainyañ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:12">ke aniọñ amọ anye asep Rahab mbai-mbai.<verse eid="JOB 26:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 26:13" />Ke adudu inweek amọ mme ikpaanyọñ emaekappa afia;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:13">ubọk amọ akịm udʌkikọd a-anyọọnọ.<verse eid="JOB 26:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 26:14" />Ndin ami ado ata ntək-ntək idiọọñọ ubọkutom amọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:14">nte ata usʌk-usʌk ke ikop ito anye!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:14">Anie awo ndin ke aduma adudu amọ anwaña?”<verse eid="JOB 26:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="JOB 27" />
  <para style="s1">Akpatre Ikọ Yoob Atañña Anọ Mme Ufan Amọ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 27:1" />Ndin Yoob amaakaa iso ke ikọ amọ:<verse eid="JOB 27:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 27:2" />“Ke akpanikọ adaña nte Abasi aduuho uwem, ake añnyịmme unen mmi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:2">Andikoñ Ñkan, a-akenamma uwem mmi ado idod-idod,<verse eid="JOB 27:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 27:3" />adaña nte ami nsʌkkọ nnie uwem ke idem mmi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:3">ibifịk Abasi asʌk aba ke aduiwuo mmi,<verse eid="JOB 27:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 27:4" />ñkpọkinua mmi idiitañña se idiọọk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:4">ndin edeme mmi idiitañña ikọ nsu.<verse eid="JOB 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 27:5" />Ami ndiinyịmmeke ke ndufo emenen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:5">tutu ami ñkpa, ami ndiikañña mfọnmma mmi.<verse eid="JOB 27:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 27:6" />Ami ñyaamʌm unana ndudue mmi ñkama ndiinyʌññọ nsaana anye ñyaak;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:6">akikere esịd mmi idimbiommo miin ikpe adaña ini nte ami nduuho uwem.<verse eid="JOB 27:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 27:7" />“Yak asua mmi atie nte awo ibak,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:7">awo utọk mmi aba nte mbon ukwañido!<verse eid="JOB 27:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 27:8" />Nsoo ido idodanyen mbon i-imiidiọọñọke abasi ke ammọ emaekpa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:8">ke ini Abasi amaaben uwem ammọ afep?<verse eid="JOB 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 27:9" />Nte Abasi akpañ utọñ anọ ayịd ammọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:9">idaha ukuud asịmme ammọ?<verse eid="JOB 27:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 27:10" />Nte ammọ eyaekịt inemesịd ke Andikoñ Ñkan?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:10">Nte ammọ eyaekoot Abasi ke afịd ini?<verse eid="JOB 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 27:11" />“Ami ñyaikpeep ndufo mbaña adudu Abasi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:11">ami ndiidịppe mme usʌñ Abasi Andikoñ Ñkan.<verse eid="JOB 27:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 27:12" />Ndufo emekịt afịd mme ñkpọ ami ke idem ndufo.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:12">Ntak ake ndufo etañña mme ikpu-ikpu ikọ ami-e?<verse eid="JOB 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 27:13" />“Anyem ado udeeme ake Abasi anọọhọ mbon ibak,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:13">asaña-asaña udeeme ake awo unana mbọm abọọhọ ato Andikoñ Ñkan:<verse eid="JOB 27:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 27:14" />Naña nditọ ammọ ekpewawak, akañkañ ado udeeme ammọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:14">ndidia idiikemme ubon amọ.<verse eid="JOB 27:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 27:15" />Idiọọk udọñọ ayaabuuk mbon ubon ammọ se isʌhọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:15">ndin mme ebekpa ammọ idiituaha ayịd inọ ammọ.<verse eid="JOB 27:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 27:16" />Akpesʌkado anye akekọọhọ silfa abon nte ntọñ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:16">mme afọñ enyʌñ ekʌbọ nte ebono aduañ,<verse eid="JOB 27:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 27:17" />se anye atịm abono, ndinen awo ediisịne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:17">ndin mbon awo i-imiidueghe ediideeme silfa amọ.<verse eid="JOB 27:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 27:18" />Ufọk ake anye abọppọ aba nte ebono ñkakad,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:18">nte atayad ake akpemeabio abọppọ.<verse eid="JOB 27:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 27:19" />Anye asuuk anaa nte awo inie, ado idiinamma ntoro aba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:19">ke ini anye atatta anyen, afịd ñkpọ emaenyọñọ.<verse eid="JOB 27:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 27:20" />Afanekọñ afʌk anye nte ekamba mmọọñ ndiọọñ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:20">mbufịd akpa amʌm anye ke akonayio.<verse eid="JOB 27:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 27:21" />Afịm usakkautịn aben anye afep, ndin anye ibaaha aba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:21">akwọọk anye asio ke itie amọ.<verse eid="JOB 27:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 27:22" />Aduọ atọ anye ituaha mbọm</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:22">kpa naña anye afeghe adudu amọ.<verse eid="JOB 27:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 27:23" />Anye amia ubọk amọ nte ñkpọ nsaha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:23">anyʌñ asiama anye asio afep ke itie amọ.”<verse eid="JOB 27:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="JOB 28" />
  <para style="s1">Ufañ Ini: Itie E-ekịtte Aniọñ</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 28:1" />Itie e-edọkkọ silfa aba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:1">ye itie e-enyʌññọ efọp kold.<verse eid="JOB 28:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 28:2" />Esio ukwak ke idak isọñ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:2">enyʌñ edat kọpa eto itiad.<verse eid="JOB 28:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 28:3" />Awo anam nọ utịd ekịm aba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:3">ammọ eyem itie se inyọọñ usʌñ ke esịd isọñ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:3">nọ esio inie isọñ eto ataa ñkịm-ñkịm itie.<verse eid="JOB 28:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 28:4" />Ammọ etịppe ube ke itie mme awo imiidʌññọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:4">ke mme itie ñkpad awo imiituuhọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:4">eben ekpọñ mme awo ke ata anyan usʌñ.<verse eid="JOB 28:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 28:5" />Esịd isọñ, ake ndidia atooho awuọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:5">anye akappa akpəho ato ufiob ikañ;<verse eid="JOB 28:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 28:6" />nsọñudua itiad isọñ ato mme itiad awuọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:6">ndin ntọñ isọñ adọñọ mme eboho kold.<verse eid="JOB 28:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 28:7" />Inuen ndomokeed idiọọñọke ndedịbe usʌñ ami,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:7">anyen uman ntrukpuum akenam ikịtte ndo.<verse eid="JOB 28:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 28:8" />Mme ikpọ ndiọi unam ntañidem itọọhọ ikpad ke ndo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:8">ekpe ndomokeed inyʌññọ iyọọn do.<verse eid="JOB 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 28:9" />Mme awo esai mme nsọọñ itiad ami ke ubọk ammọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:9">enyʌñ enịm mme adʌñ ikpọabod ifed.<verse eid="JOB 28:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 28:10" />Ammọ edọk eboiyo ke abaitiad;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:10">anyen ammọ akịt afịd mme nti inie amọ.<verse eid="JOB 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 28:11" />Ammọ eyeem mme usʌñ mmọọñ inyañ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:11">ndin esio mme ndedịbe ñkpọ edi unwana.<verse eid="JOB 28:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 28:12" />Ado ke mmọọ ke ekeme edikịt aniọñ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:12">Ke mmọọ ke ndiọọñọidem adʌñ?<verse eid="JOB 28:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 28:13" />Awo ndomokeed ikemeke adidiọọñọ ekọmudua amọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:13">awo ikemeke adikịt anye ke isọñ mme aduuwem.<verse eid="JOB 28:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 28:14" />Esịd isọñ ate, “Ibaaha ye ami”;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:14">inyañ ate, “Ibaaha ye ami.”<verse eid="JOB 28:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 28:15" />Awo ikemeke adidep anye ye ataa eti kold,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:15">me ekeme edidomo ekọmudua amọ ke silfa.<verse eid="JOB 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 28:16" />Awo ikemeke adidep anye ye kold a-atooho Ọfia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:16">ye nsọñudua itiad ọniks me nsọñudua adan isọñ lapis lasuli.<verse eid="JOB 28:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 28:17" />Awo ikemeke adiben kold me nsem-nsem itiad mfen ndomo ye anye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:17">me ekeme adiben anye nte nsọñudua kold.<verse eid="JOB 28:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 28:18" />Kọral ye yaspa idotto se edat edomo ye anye;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:18">ekọmudua aniọñ akpon akan mme rubi.<verse eid="JOB 28:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 28:19" />Awo ikemeke adiben topas a-atooho Kuus ndomo ye anye;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:19">awo ikemeke adidep anye ye ataa adisana kold.<verse eid="JOB 28:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 28:20" />Ke mmọọ ndin ke aniọñ ato adi?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:20">Ke mmọọ ke ndiọọñọidem adʌñ?<verse eid="JOB 28:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 28:21" />Ededịp anye ke anyen afịd se idu uwem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:21">enyʌñ edịp anye mbaak mme inuen anyọñ edikịt.<verse eid="JOB 28:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 28:22" />Nsobo ye Ñkpa ete,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:22">“Ñnyịn ikookop mbʌk amọ ke utọñ ñnyịn.”<verse eid="JOB 28:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 28:23" />Abasi adiọọñọ usʌñ akewuọ ndo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:23">ndin ado anye ikpọọñ adiọọñọ itie idʌñ amọ,<verse eid="JOB 28:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 28:24" />sia anye ase utịd ederimbod</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:24">anyʌñ akịt afịd ñkpọ se iba ke idak mme hefịn.<verse eid="JOB 28:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 28:25" />Ke ini anye akenamma afịm akpesọñ adudu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:25">anyʌñ adomo mme mmọọñ,<verse eid="JOB 28:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 28:26" />ke ini anye akenịmme ewʌhọ anọ edịm</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:26">anyʌñ anịm usʌñ anọ aduma,<verse eid="JOB 28:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 28:27" />ndin anye amaase aniọñ anyʌñ aduuñọ anye;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:27">anye amaanekke anye anịm anyʌñ adomo anye ase.<verse eid="JOB 28:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 28:28" />Ndin anye amaabo ubon awo ate,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:28">“Mbaak <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, anye ado aniọñ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:28">ndin adisịññe idem ñkpọñ idiọọkñkpọ ado ndiọọñọidem.”<verse eid="JOB 28:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="JOB 29" />
  <para style="s1">Akpatre Mfaaña Yoob</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 29:1" />Ndin Yoob amaakaa iso ke ikọ amọ:<verse eid="JOB 29:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 29:2" />“Se naña ami ñyem mme afiọñ amaakeboiyo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:2">ke mme usen ake Abasi akeñkpemeke miin,<verse eid="JOB 29:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 29:3" />ke idaha utuenikañ amọ akeyammake ke iwuod mmi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:3">ndin ami ñkedat unwana amọ nsaña ke ekịm!<verse eid="JOB 29:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 29:4" />O, naña ami ñkeba ke ini uyịn mmi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:4">ke in ataa ufan ye Abasi akediọññọ ufọk mmi,<verse eid="JOB 29:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 29:5" />ke idaha Andikoñ Ñkan akesʌkkọ aba ye ami</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:5">ndin nditọ mmi enyʌñ ekeñkanna miin ekʌk,<verse eid="JOB 29:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 29:6" />ke idaha usʌñ mmi akeyọhọke ye adan mmọọñeba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:6">ndin itiad anyʌñ anwañña idịm adan ọlif annọ miin.<verse eid="JOB 29:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 29:7" />“Ke ini ami mmaakekaa inuaatob abio</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:7">ñnyʌñ ndat itie mmi ke afe abio,<verse eid="JOB 29:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 29:8" />iwaad emaeñkịt miin enyʌñ ekọkkọ eda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:8">ndin mme ikpọ ideen emaenyʌñ edakka eda;<verse eid="JOB 29:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 29:9" />mme ikpọ mbọọñ emaetre editañ ikọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:9">emaenyʌñ efʌk ubọk ammọ ke inua ammọ;<verse eid="JOB 29:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 29:10" />mme mbọọñ eketañ ikọ ke uyio adu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:10">ndin mme edeme ammọ amaadiana ke nsịñ ammọ.<verse eid="JOB 29:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 29:11" />Afịd awo se ikiñkop miin emaetañ eti ikọ embaña miin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:11">ndin mbon se ikiñkịt miin emaentooro miin,<verse eid="JOB 29:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 29:12" />sia ami mmaanyaaña uweene a-aketuaha ayem unwam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:12">ye nditọakpa i-imiikinieghe awo ndomokeed se inwam ammọ.<verse eid="JOB 29:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 29:13" />Awo a-akebaaha ke nnaa ñkpa amandiọñ miin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:13">Ami mmaanam esịd ebekpa akwọ ikwọ.<verse eid="JOB 29:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 29:14" />Ami mmaasịne adinenido nte afọñidem;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:14">unenikpe akedo mbọbọ mmi ye tọban mmi.<verse eid="JOB 29:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 29:15" />Ami ñkedo anyen nnọ mbon nnan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:15">ñnyʌñ ndo ñkpad nnọ mme mbʌñọ.<verse eid="JOB 29:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 29:16" />Ami ñkedo ete nnọ mbon unana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:16">Ami mmaaben mfịna asenawo ñkama.<verse eid="JOB 29:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 29:17" />Ami mmaabuuñ eded mbon ibak</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:17">ñnyʌñ ñwappa mbon se ammọ ekemuum ke eded nsio.<verse eid="JOB 29:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 29:18" />“Ami mmaakere mbo, ‘Ami ndiikpa ke ufọk mmi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:18">mme usen mmi ewak nte ntan isọñ.<verse eid="JOB 29:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 29:19" />Mme adʌñ mmi eyaetuuk mmọọñ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:19">ndin ndedeb ayaaduọkkọ ke mme ñkọk mmi afịd akonayio.<verse eid="JOB 29:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 29:20" />Ubọọñ mmi idiikpuuho;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:20">idañ adiisʌk ido ufa ke ubọk mmi ke nsi-nsi.’<verse eid="JOB 29:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 29:21" />“Mme awo emaekpañ utọñ ennọ miin ye idodanyen,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:21">enyʌñ edop ebet item mmi.<verse eid="JOB 29:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 29:22" />Ke ami mmaaketañ ikọ mma, ammọ ikitañña ikọ aba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:22">mme ikọ mmi amaaduọkkọ ammọ ke utọñ usʌk-usʌk.<verse eid="JOB 29:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 29:23" />Ammọ emaetie embet miin nte nsasaha edịm</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:23">enyʌñ enwọñ ikọ mmi nte mmọọñ edịm.<verse eid="JOB 29:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 29:24" />Ke ami mmaakedueek inua imam ye ammọ, ammọ ikikanna inịm ke akpanikọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:24">unwana iso mmi akedo uyaiya ñkpọ anọ ammọ.<verse eid="JOB 29:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 29:25" />Ami mmaamek usʌñ nnọ ammọ ndin ntie nte abọọñ ammọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:25">Ami mmaadʌñ nte adidem ke atu udịm ekọñ amọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:25">Ami ñkeba nte awo adọññọ mbon mfʌhọ esịd.<verse eid="JOB 29:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter eid="JOB 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="JOB 30" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 30:1" />“Ado idahami ammọ ensak miin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:1">mme ideen esịppe eñkan miin,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 30:1">a-adooho ñkpekese mme ete ammọ nte idotto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:1">edisịne ke atu udịm ewa edọñ mmi.”<verse eid="JOB 30:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 30:2" />Nsoo ido ufọn adudu ubọk ammọ ke idem mmi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:2">sia inweek ammọ amaawuọ ammọ ke idem?<verse eid="JOB 30:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 30:3" />Idem adiọọk ammọ ato ke unana ye abiọọñ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:3">ammọ edutịn ekanna nsaad isọñ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:3">ke mme mbiara isọñ nsobo ke akonayio.<verse eid="JOB 30:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 30:4" />Ke esịd ikọd ammọ ekpook mme inʌñ-inʌñ mfañ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:4">ndin ndidia ammọ akedo mme adʌñ nsadañ.<verse eid="JOB 30:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 30:5" />Emaebịne ammọ esio ke atu ubon awo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:5">ebọọñ ñkpo ekeene ammọ nte mme inọ.<verse eid="JOB 30:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 30:6" />Emaenyịk ammọ ekedʌñ ke itie idịm akesatta,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:6">ke atu mme itiad ye ke mme ndudu ke esịd isọñ.<verse eid="JOB 30:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 30:7" />Ammọ ebọọñ ñkpo ke ikọd</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:7">enyʌñ edọñọ ke ikọd mme akpab.<verse eid="JOB 30:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 30:8" />Nditọ ndisịme ye nditọ i-imiinieghe anyịñ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:8">emaebịne ammọ esịññe ke isọñ.<verse eid="JOB 30:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 30:9" />“Ndin idahami ñkparawa ado ensịn miin ke ikwọ esak;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:9">Ami mmenyʌñ ñkappa ndo ufiid nnọ ammọ.<verse eid="JOB 30:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 30:10" />Ammọ ensua miin enyʌñ eda nsan-nsan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:10">ammọ inyʌññọ ibiat ini adimfiat miin etab ke iso.<verse eid="JOB 30:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 30:11" />Idahami a-adooho Abasi amaakịppe utịgha mmi anyʌñ añkuut miin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:11">ammọ ikoppo ndịk ke iso mmi.<verse eid="JOB 30:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 30:12" />Ke ubọk nnasia mmi, aduuk etop ekọñ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:12">ammọ enyʌñ ekọọk afia enọ ukod mmi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:12">enyʌñ ebọp ebọb ekọñ embaha miin.<verse eid="JOB 30:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 30:13" />Ammọ eboom usʌñ mmi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:13">enyʌñ ekan edinsobo miin.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:13">Ammọ ete, ‘Ibaaha awo ndomokeed adiikan adinyaaña anye.’<verse eid="JOB 30:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 30:14" />Ammọ ebʌññọ edi nte ekamba ndibene aduọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:14">ke ufọọd ñwuudo ami, ammọ ewere edʌk edi.<verse eid="JOB 30:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 30:15" />Akpọsọñ ndịk amfʌk miin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:15">ebịn ukpono mmi eduọọk nte afịm,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:15">ifuuro mmi asop nte ntọñanyọñ.<verse eid="JOB 30:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 30:16" />“Ndin idahami uwem mi aba nte akebe mmọọñ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:16">mme usen ufen ammʌm miin.<verse eid="JOB 30:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 30:17" />Akonayio akịm mme akpọ mmi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:17">akpọsọñ ubiak innọọhọ utañifia.<verse eid="JOB 30:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 30:18" />Ke ekamba adudu amọ Abasi akappa aba nte afọñ ami nsịneke;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:18">anye amfʌk miin nte itọñ afọñidem mmi.<verse eid="JOB 30:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 30:19" />Anye antop miin asịn ke mbad,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:19">ndin ami nsuuho ñkedo abu ye ntọñ.<verse eid="JOB 30:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 30:20" />“Abasi, ami mmetua ukoot fiin, ado afo umbọọrọke;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:20">Ami mmedakka nda, ado afo asʌk anseese miin.<verse eid="JOB 30:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 30:21" />Afo amekappa amfiomo miin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:21">afo amedat adudu ubọk mfo anwana ekọñ ye ami.<verse eid="JOB 30:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 30:22" />Afo añwappa miin abọ anyʌñ añwat miin asịn ke iso afịm;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:22">afo amentop miin akanna ke ayobio.<verse eid="JOB 30:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 30:23" />Ami mmediọọñọ ke afo ayandʌt miin aka isọñ tutu akewuọ ñkpa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:23">aka itie enịmme enọ afịd mme aduuwem.<verse eid="JOB 30:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 30:24" />“Ke akpanikọ awo ndomokeed inyanna ubọk ituuk awo unana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:24">ke idaha anye atuaha ayem unwam ke nnananyen amọ.<verse eid="JOB 30:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 30:25" />Nte ami ñketuaha ayịd nnọ mbon e-ebaaha ke mfịna?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:25">Nte ukpọñ mmi ifʌhọke ibaña mbon uweene?<verse eid="JOB 30:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 30:26" />Ado ke ini ami ndotto anyen ke eti ñkpọ, idiọọk adi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:26">ke ini ami ndotto anyen ke unwana, ndin ekịm adi.<verse eid="JOB 30:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 30:27" />Esịd idịb mmi itreke adibukko;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:27">mme usen ukuud ensịm miin.<verse eid="JOB 30:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 30:28" />Ami mmesaña ndo abubịd ñkpọ, ado idooho ayio anam ñnwen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:28">Ami ndakka nda ke ekamba esob ñnyʌñ ntua ñyem unwam.<verse eid="JOB 30:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 30:29" />Ami mmekappa ndo ayịneka ye ewaikọd,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:29">awo nsaña mme ñkịdikịd.<verse eid="JOB 30:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 30:30" />Ikpọkidem mmi akappa abre anyʌñ afọọñọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:30">idem mmi ayeghe ye ufiobidem.<verse eid="JOB 30:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 30:31" />Laiya mmi akappa abre ikwọ mfʌhọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:31">adʌk mmi anyʌñ ado ñkpọ utua ayịd.<verse eid="JOB 30:31" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter eid="JOB 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="JOB 31" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 31:1" />“Ami mmaanam edioomo ye anyen mmi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:1">mbo ke ndiiseeghe abọikpa ke anyen use.<verse eid="JOB 31:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 31:2" />Nsoo ndin ido udeeme ñnyịn a-atooho Abasi ke anyọñ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:2">nsoo ido udod ñnyịn a-atooho Andikoñ Ñkan ke anyọñ?<verse eid="JOB 31:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 31:3" />Nte idooho nsobo ana anọ mme idiọọk awo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:3">nsobo ana anọ mme anam idiọọk?<verse eid="JOB 31:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 31:4" />Nte anye ikịtte mme usʌñ mmi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:4">anyʌñ abat afịd ñkpadisañ mmi?<verse eid="JOB 31:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 31:5" />“Adieke ami nsañake ke abiaña</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:5">me ikpad mmi asọp abịne ñkara,<verse eid="JOB 31:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 31:6" />yak Abasi amben miin asịn ke adinen udomoñkpọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:6">ndin anye ayaadiọọñọ ke ami ndueghe;<verse eid="JOB 31:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 31:7" />adieke ikpadisañ mmi awakkake akpọñ usʌñ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:7">adieke esịd mmi akeeneke anyen mmi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:7">me ubọk mmi asappake,<verse eid="JOB 31:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 31:8" />ndin yak mbon mfen edia se ami ntọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:8">ndin yak ewịppe mme mfịd inwañ mmi.<verse eid="JOB 31:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 31:9" />“Adieke esịd mmi akeeneke awonwaan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:9">me akpedo ami mmediana ke inuausʌñ mbọhọidʌñ mmi,<verse eid="JOB 31:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 31:10" />yak anwaan mmi akọk ñkpasi awo mfen,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:10">yak ideen mfen enyʌñ enam ima ye anye.<verse eid="JOB 31:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 31:11" />Sia ñkpọ ntoro akpedo ibak,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:11">idiọọkñkpọ a-anaaha ekpe ebiere.<verse eid="JOB 31:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 31:12" />Ado ikañ asakka ata ñkpọ tutu aben nsobo adi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:12">anye akpaawịppe mme idọk inwañ mmi.<verse eid="JOB 31:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 31:13" />“Adieke ami nsịnne adinam unen nnọọ nditọufọk mmi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:13">mme ado awodeen me awonwaan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:13">ke idaha ammọ ekenieghe utọk ye ami,<verse eid="JOB 31:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 31:14" />ami ndiinam die ke Abasi amambịp miin?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:14">Nsoo ke ami ndiibọọrọ ke emaeñkoot ebo yak ndinam ibad?<verse eid="JOB 31:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 31:15" />Nte idooho anye a-akembotto miin ke idịb akenyʌñ abot ammọ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:15">Nte idooho kpa anye akibot ñnyịn awo iba ke idịb eka ñnyịn?<verse eid="JOB 31:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 31:16" />“Adieke ami ñkesịnne adinọ mme uweene se amọ ekeyem</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:16">me adinam yak anyen anan mme ebekpa,<verse eid="JOB 31:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 31:17" />adieke ami ñkenịmme ndomuyo mmi nnọ idem mmi ikpọọñ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:17">ñwuanake anye ye nditọakpa,<verse eid="JOB 31:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 31:18" />ado tọọñọ ke uyịn mmi ami ñkesibọọk ammọ nte ete abọọk nditọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:18">ñnyʌñ ñkpeme mme ebekpa tọọñọ ke emana mmi,<verse eid="JOB 31:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 31:19" />adieke akenaanam ami mmekịt awo ayemme aditak ke ntak unana afọñ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:19">me awo unana ammiinieghe afọñ,<verse eid="JOB 31:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 31:20" />ndin esịd ammọ ikindiọññọ miin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:20">ke adikinam ammọ ekop ufiob nto idededọñ mmi,<verse eid="JOB 31:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 31:21" />adieke akenaanam ami mmedịppe ubọk mmi mfiik nditọakpa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:21">ndiọọñọ mbo ke ami mmenie adudu ke esob,<verse eid="JOB 31:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 31:22" />ndin yak ubọk mmi atotto tọọñọ ke afara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:22">yak ubọk mmi abʌññọ tọọñọ ke itie anye ayịreke.<verse eid="JOB 31:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 31:23" />Sia ami mmaabaak nsobo a-atooho Abasi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:23">ndin ke ntak ndịk mmọnyọ amọ, ami ñkpekanna nnam mme ñkpọ ntoro.<verse eid="JOB 31:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 31:24" />“Adieke ami nnieghe idodanyen ke kold</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:24">me mbo ataa eti kold, ‘Afo ado ñkpọ ukpeme mmi,’<verse eid="JOB 31:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 31:25" />adieke adooho ami mmedaara ke ntak uwak inie mmi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:25">mme inie se ubọk mmi anwana,<verse eid="JOB 31:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 31:26" />adieke ami nseeghe utịn naña anye ayamma</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:26">me afiọñ naña anye ayamma ke mmọnyọ,<verse eid="JOB 31:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 31:27" />nọ ato do etab esịd mmi ke ndịbe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:27">ndin ubọk mmi amaanọ ammọ ntʌminua ukpono,<verse eid="JOB 31:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 31:28" />ndin mme ñkpọ ami ediido ndiọiñkpọ se ekpe ebiere,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:28">sia ami ñkpekedo asʌhọ nsu nnọ Abasi ke anyọñ.<verse eid="JOB 31:28" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 31:29" />“Adieke ami nnemme esịd mbaña iduọ asua mmi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:29">me adinem esịd mbaña mfịna a-anye anieghe.<verse eid="JOB 31:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 31:30" />Ami ñyakka inua mmi anam idiọọk</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:30">ke adikoot isuuñọ nnọ uwem ammọ,<verse eid="JOB 31:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 31:31" />adieke akenaanam mbon ufọk mmi ibooho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:31">‘Anie awo ke unam Yoob akenam imiiyʌkkọke?’<verse eid="JOB 31:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 31:32" />ado ibaaha asenawo ndomokeed a-akenaaha ke esiin akonayio,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:32">sia usʌñ ufọk mmi akesina inwañ anọ mme akaisañ,<verse eid="JOB 31:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 31:33" />akpedo ami mmedịp idiọọkñkpọ mmi naña mbon awo enam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:33">ke adidịp ndudue mmi ke esịd mmi<verse eid="JOB 31:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 31:34" />ke ntak a-adooho ami mmebaak atu awo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:34">ndin ñnyʌñ nnekke mbaak mme ndudue ake mme ubon</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:34">ndin ami ndop uyio ñnyʌññọ ñwuọ esiin.<verse eid="JOB 31:34" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 31:35" />(“O, akpekapado ami mmenie awo se iñkop miin!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:35">Idahami ami mmenyịmme adifaaña idem mmi, yak Andikoñ Ñkan ambọọrọ miin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:35">yak awo se ibo ke ami mmedue awewet ndudue mmi asịn ke ñwed.<verse eid="JOB 31:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOB 31:36" />Ke akpanikọ ami ñyaaben anye ñkọñọ ke afara mmi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:36">Ami ñkpeyaayara anye nte anyanya.<verse eid="JOB 31:36" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOB 31:37" />Ami ñyaanam ibad nnọ anye ke abaña afịd se ami ñkenam;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:37">Ami ñkpaaben ñwọt anye nte ñwọt andikara.)<verse eid="JOB 31:37" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JOB 31:38" />“Adieke isọñ mmi atuaha ayịd ambaña miin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:38">ndin afịd mme idọk amọ enyʌñ etua ayịd,<verse eid="JOB 31:38" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JOB 31:39" />adieke ami ñkediaha inie mfịdinwañ amọ ndiikpeeghe ekọmudua</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:39">me adibuuñ sịbidịd mme anamutom amọ,<verse eid="JOB 31:39" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JOB 31:40" />ndin yak mbaraekpe etịppe utu ke abakpa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:40">yak utebe mbid anyʌñ atịppe utu ke mfịd baali.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 31:40">Mme ikọ Yoob e-ekweeñe.<verse eid="JOB 31:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="JOB 32" />
  <para style="s1">Elihu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 32:1" />Ndin ideen ita ami emaetre edibọọrọ Yoob ikọ, sia anye akedo adinen awo ke anyen amọ. <verse eid="JOB 32:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 32:2" />Ado Elihu ayịn Barakel awo Buus, awo ubon mme Ram, amaayat esịd eti-eti ye Yoob ke anye adikịt idem amọ nte imidot ke ini akpedooho Abasi. <verse eid="JOB 32:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 32:3" />Elihu ñko amaayat esịd ye mme ufan ita ado, sia ammọ ikikịtte usʌñ ndomokeed adifaaña mme Yoob, ado esʌk ebiom anye ikpe. <verse eid="JOB 32:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 32:4" />Idaaha ami Elihu amaabet diin mbemiso anye atañ ikọ ye Yoob sia ammọ emaesọñ ekan anye. <verse eid="JOB 32:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 32:5" />Ado Elihu akekịt ke mme ideen ita ado ikinieghe ñkpọ aba se etañ, iyadesịd amọ amaademme.<verse eid="JOB 32:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 32:6" />Ndin Elihu ayịn Barakel aketooho Buus amaabo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 32:6">“Ami mmesịp ke isua emana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:6">ndin afo amesọñ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 32:6">ado akenam nọ ami ñkop ndịk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:6">ñnyʌññọ ñkan ntañ inọ ndufo se ami ndiọọñọ.<verse eid="JOB 32:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 32:7" />Ami ñkekere mbo ke, ‘Ekamba isua emana akpena atañ ikọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:7">isua akponno akpena akpeep awo aniọñ.’<verse eid="JOB 32:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 32:8" />Ado, ado sịbidịd a-abaaha awo ke idem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:8">ibifịk Andikoñ Ñkan, anọ ammọ ndiọọñọidem.<verse eid="JOB 32:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 32:9" />Idooho mbon esọññọ ikpọọñ enie enọ aniọñ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:9">idooho mbon esọññọ ikpọọñ ediọọñọ se ido akpanikọ.<verse eid="JOB 32:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 32:10" />“Ndin ami mbo: Kpañ utọñ nnọ miin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:10">Ami ñko ñyaudọkkọ fiin se ami ndiọọñọ.<verse eid="JOB 32:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 32:11" />Ami mmaatie mbet idaha afo aketañña ikọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:11">ami mmaanyʌñ ñkpañ utọñ ñkop mme akikere mfo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 32:11">idaha afo akeyemme mme ikọ se atañ,<verse eid="JOB 32:11" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 32:12" />Ami mmaanekke inọ ndufo ayọhọ ñkpañutọñ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 32:12">Ado ibaaha awo ndufo ndomokeed se ikiwọt ke Yoob amaadue;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:12">ibaaha awo ndufo ndomokeed a-akebọọrọke mme ikọ mfaaña amọ.<verse eid="JOB 32:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 32:13" />Ikiibo ite, ‘Ñnyịn imikịt aniọñ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:13">yak ado Abasi, akuudo awo, afaaña mme anye.’<verse eid="JOB 32:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 32:14" />Ado Yoob ikitañña ikọ amọ imbaña miin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:14">ndin ami ndiinyʌññọ ndat ikọ mfaaña ndufo mbọọrọ anye.<verse eid="JOB 32:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 32:15" />“Idem amaakpa ammọ ndin ammọ ikiinieghe aba se etañ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:15">ikọ amaakak ammọ aditañ.<verse eid="JOB 32:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 32:16" />Me ana nte ami mbet, idahami a-adooho ammọ e-edop uyio,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:16">idahami a-ammọ edaaha do inieghe ibọọrọ?<verse eid="JOB 32:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 32:17" />Ami ñko ñyaanie ibọọrọ mmi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:17">Ami ñko ñyaatañ se ami ndiọọñọ.<verse eid="JOB 32:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 32:18" />Sia ami ñyọhọ mme ikọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:18">ndin sịbidịd ambaaha miin ke idem añnyịk miin;<verse eid="JOB 32:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 32:19" />ke esịd idem ami mba nte ukọd esịnne ke ekpeme esiit,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:19">nte mme ufa ikịm ukọd eyemme adibomo.<verse eid="JOB 32:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 32:20" />Ana ami ntañ ikọ ñnyʌñ mbọ nduọkadudu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:20">Ana ami ñkʌppọ inua mmi ñnyʌñ mbọọrọ.<verse eid="JOB 32:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 32:21" />Ami ndiibaaha awo anyen,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:21">me aditañ ikọ nnem awo ndomokeed esịd;<verse eid="JOB 32:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 32:22" />sia akpedo mmaanekke nnie ifiọk ke utañ ikọ nnem awo esịd,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:22">Andikimbod miin akpaakesọp adimben miin asio.<verse eid="JOB 32:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter eid="JOB 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="JOB 33" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 33:1" />“Ado idahami, Yoob, kpañ utọñ kop mme ikọ mmi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:1">nekke kpañ utọñ kop afịd se ami ntañ.<verse eid="JOB 33:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 33:2" />Ami mmebeeñe idem adikʌppọ inua mmi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:2">mme ikọ mmi edoro ke iso edeme mmi.<verse eid="JOB 33:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 33:3" />Mme ikọ mmi eto adinen esịd;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:3">ke idak akpanikọ, ñkpọkinua mmi atañ afịd se ndiọọñọ.<verse eid="JOB 33:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 33:4" />Sịbidịd Abasi ambot miin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:4">ibifịk Andikoñ Ñkan anyʌñ annọ miin uwem.<verse eid="JOB 33:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 33:5" />Mbọọrọ miin ndin, adieke adooho afo amekan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:5">dakka da nyʌñ faaña ikọ mfo ke iso mmi.<verse eid="JOB 33:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 33:6" />Ami ndo ukem ye afo ke iso Abasi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:6">Ami ñko ñnyʌñ ndo ubaak aduañ.<verse eid="JOB 33:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 33:7" />Ndin idooho se afo akop ndịk anto miin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:7">me ubọk mmi adidoppo ke idem mfo.<verse eid="JOB 33:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 33:8" />“Ado afo ametañ yak ami ñkop;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:8">Ami mmaakop mme ikọ ado;<verse eid="JOB 33:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 33:9" />‘Ami ndo adisana, ami nnamma ndudue;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:9">Ami mmesana ñnyʌñ nnana idiọọkñkpọ.<verse eid="JOB 33:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 33:10" />Ado Abasi akịt ndudue ke idem mmi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:10">anye andat miin nte asua amọ.<verse eid="JOB 33:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 33:11" />Anye andọñ miin ekọp ke ukod;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:11">anye anekke atịñ anyen ase mme usʌñ mmi.’<verse eid="JOB 33:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 33:12" />“Ado ami ubo fiin, ke ñkpọ anyem afo unenne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:12">sia Abasi akpon akan awo akeedodo.<verse eid="JOB 33:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 33:13" />Nsoo inam afo aseeme anọ anye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:13">abo ke anye ibọọrọke awo ndomokeed ikọ?<verse eid="JOB 33:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 33:14" />Sia Abasi atañ ikọ, idahami ke usʌñ keed, idahami ke usʌñ mfen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:14">akpesʌkado mme awo imiidiọọñọke.<verse eid="JOB 33:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 33:15" />Ke ndab, ye ke ñkukịd akonayio,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:15">ke ini akpọsọñ idab amʌmmọ mme awo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:15">naña ammọ enaaha edaiya ke akwañ ammọ,<verse eid="JOB 33:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 33:16" />anye akeme aditañ ikọ ndọñ ammọ ke utọñ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:16">anyʌñ asịn ammọ ndịk ke adinọ ammọ ndʌdutọñ,<verse eid="JOB 33:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 33:17" />adiwọññọ ammọ nsio ke idiọọkñkpọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:17">ñnyʌñ mben ammọ ñkpọñ ntañidem,<verse eid="JOB 33:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 33:18" />adinyaaña ammọ nsio ke ube,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:18">ñnyʌñ nnịm uwem ammọ mbaak editak.<verse eid="JOB 33:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 33:19" />“Me awo akeme adibọ ntʌnọ ke itie nnaa ubiak</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:19">ye ananautịd ubiak ke mme akpọ ammọ,<verse eid="JOB 33:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 33:20" />anam ndidia adido ñkpọ a-atekketek ammọ esịd</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:20">ndin ukpọñ ammọ asua ataa inem ndidia.<verse eid="JOB 33:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 33:21" />Abʌkidem ammọ atak adikappa ado ukpọk-ukpọk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:21">ndin mme akpọ ammọ, ekesidịbekedịbe, ewuọñọ etịgha.<verse eid="JOB 33:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 33:22" />Ammọ esaña ekpere ube,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:22">ndin mme uwem ammọ ekpere isʌñutom ñkpa.<verse eid="JOB 33:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 33:23" />Ado adieke enyere abaaha ke ñkañ ammọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:23">isʌñutom, keed ke atu tọsịn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:23">e-edọññọ yak akedọkkọ ammọ naña ekpesaña edu nnen-nnen uwem,<verse eid="JOB 33:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 33:24" />anye anem esịd ye awo ado anyʌñ abo Abasi ate,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:24">‘Fak ammọ mbaak edidooro edʌk ube;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:24">Ami mmekịt ekọmudua nnọ ammọ,<verse eid="JOB 33:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 33:25" />yak ikpọkidem ammọ eseghe nte ake nsekayịn;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:25">yak enam ammọ etịmme ekeba nte ini uyịn ammọ,’<verse eid="JOB 33:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 33:26" />ndin awo ado akeme adibọñ akam anọ Abasi anyʌñ akịt mfọn ye anye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:26">ammọ eyaekịt Abasi iso enyʌñ esio ñkpo idaara;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:26">anye ayaatịmme anam ammọ ekeba ke ayọhọ nsọñidem.<verse eid="JOB 33:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 33:27" />Ndin ammọ eyaekaa ebịne mbon mfen ekebo ete,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:27">‘Ami mmenam idiọọkñkpọ, ñnyʌñ ñkwaañ se inen,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:27">ado ami ñkebọọhọ utịb se ñkpedot adibọ.<verse eid="JOB 33:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 33:28" />Abasi amfak miin asio iyakka ndʌk ube,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:28">ndin ami ñyaadu uwem ñnyʌñ ñkop inem unwana uwem.’<verse eid="JOB 33:28" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 33:29" />“Abasi anam afịd mme ñkpọ ami anọ awo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:29">akañ iba, ubaak akañ ita<verse eid="JOB 33:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 33:30" />adiwọññọ ammọ ñkpọñ ube,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:30">nọ ato do unwana uwem ayama anọ ammọ.<verse eid="JOB 33:30" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 33:31" />“Kpañ utọñ, Yoob, nyʌñ kop se ntañ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:31">dop uyio, ndin ami ñyaatañ ikọ.<verse eid="JOB 33:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 33:32" />Adieke afo anieghe ñkpọ ndomokeed aditañ, mbọọrọ miin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:32">tañ ikọ, sia ami ñyem adutoppo fiin ikpe.<verse eid="JOB 33:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 33:33" />Ado akpedo idooho ntoro, ndin kpañ utọñ nnọ miin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:33">dop uyio, ndin ami ñyaukpeep fiin aniọñ.”<verse eid="JOB 33:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="JOB 34" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 34:1" />Ndin Elihu amaabo:<verse eid="JOB 34:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 34:2" />“Ikop ikọ mmi, ndufo mbon aniọñ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:2">ikpañ utọñ innọ miin, ndufo mme adiọọñọñkpọ awo.<verse eid="JOB 34:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 34:3" />Sia utọñ asidomo ikọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:3">kpa naña edeme asidia ndidia akop.<verse eid="JOB 34:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 34:4" />Yak ñnyịn iduuñọ ise se inen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:4">yak ñnyịn idiana keed ikpeep se ifọn.<verse eid="JOB 34:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 34:5" />“Yoob abo, ‘Ami ndueghe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:5">ado Abasi añnyịm miin unenikpe.<verse eid="JOB 34:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 34:6" />Akpesʌkado ami mmenen,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:6">embat miin nte awo nsu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:6">akpesʌkado ami mmendueghe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:6">idañ amọ annọ miin unan a-mmiidiikpaaha.’<verse eid="JOB 34:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 34:7" />Nte aba awo ndomokeed se iba nte Yoob,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:7">a-anwọññọ asuenne nte mmọọñ?<verse eid="JOB 34:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 34:8" />Anye asaña nsaña ye mme anam idiọọk;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:8">anye adʌk ndʌk ye mbon ibak.<verse eid="JOB 34:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 34:9" />Sia anye abo, ‘Udod ibaaha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:9">ke adinam se inem Abasi esịd.’<verse eid="JOB 34:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 34:10" />“Ndin ikpañ utọñ innọ miin, ndufo mme adiọọñọñkpọ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:10">Nsaa Abasi adikpinam idiọọkñkpọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:10">yak Andikoñ Ñkan akpenam ndudue.<verse eid="JOB 34:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 34:11" />Anye anọ afịd awo utịb ke se ammọ enam;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:11">anye anọ ammọ se eduuwem ammọ adot.<verse eid="JOB 34:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 34:12" />Idooho ñkpọ se awo akpekekere ke Abasi akeme adinam ndudue,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:12">ke Andikoñ Ñkan akeme adikwaañ ikpe.<verse eid="JOB 34:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 34:13" />Anie ikimek anye inọ ederimbod?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:13">Anie ikinịm anye nte andikara ke afịd ekondo?<verse eid="JOB 34:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 34:14" />Adieke akedooho uduak amọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:14">ndin anye asio sịbidịd ye ibifịk amọ,<verse eid="JOB 34:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 34:15" />afịd ubon awo ekpetak ini keed</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:15">ndin ubon awo ekpaetịmme enyọñ ke ntọñ.<verse eid="JOB 34:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 34:16" />“Akpedo afo amenie ndiọọñọidem, kop ami;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:16">kpañ utọñ kop se ami ntañ.<verse eid="JOB 34:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 34:17" />Nte awo asuaha unen akeme adida ukara?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:17">Nte afo ayaasua anọ adinen awo ye Anye a-adooho andikoñ ñkan?<verse eid="JOB 34:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 34:18" />Idooho Anye abo mme ndidem, ‘Ndufo ibaaha ufọn,’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:18">anyʌñ abo mme ñkpisọñ, ‘Ndufo edo ibak,’<verse eid="JOB 34:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 34:19" />i-imiiwọttọ adusad ke atu mme nditọ mbọọñ ideen</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:19">inyʌññọ ifọn ye mbon imọ ikan uweene,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:19">sia afịd ammọ edo ubọkutom amọ?<verse eid="JOB 34:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 34:20" />Ammọ ekpa ini keed, ke ufọọd akonayio;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:20">ndịk anam mme awo ndin ammọ enyʌñ eboiyo efep;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:20">mme ñkpọsọñ awo eboiyo efep ke ini imiitooho ubọk awo.<verse eid="JOB 34:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 34:21" />“Anyen amọ ase usʌñ mme ñkaña awo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:21">anye akịt afịd ñkpadisañ ammọ.<verse eid="JOB 34:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 34:22" />Ekamba ndukpọñ ibaaha, ekamba ekịm inyʌññọ iba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:22">ake mme anamidiọọk ekemekke adidịbe.<verse eid="JOB 34:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 34:23" />Abasi iyemme adika iso nduuñọ mme awo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:23">nte ke ana ammọ edi ikpe ke iso amọ.<verse eid="JOB 34:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 34:24" />Ke unana adiduuñọ anye asuan mme ñkpọsọñ awo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:24">anyʌñ abono mbon mfen ke itie ammọ.<verse eid="JOB 34:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 34:25" />Sia anye akịt mme adinam ammọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:25">anye adooño ammọ ke akonayio ndin ammọ esuana.<verse eid="JOB 34:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 34:26" />Anye amia ammọ ufen ke ibak ammọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:26">ke itie se afịd awo ekeme edikịt ammọ,<verse eid="JOB 34:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 34:27" />sia ammọ emaetre edikeene anye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:27">inyʌññọ inie ukpono inọ usʌñ amọ.<verse eid="JOB 34:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 34:28" />Ammọ enam nọ ntuaayịd mbon uweene asịm anye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:28">ato do anye akop ntuaña mbon unana.<verse eid="JOB 34:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 34:29" />Ado anye akpedop uyio, anie ikpisua inọ anye?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:29">Adieke anye adịppe iso amọ, anie akeme adikịt anye?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:29">Ado anye akara afịd awo ye afịd mme idịd ukem-ukem,<verse eid="JOB 34:29" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 34:30" />nọ atre mbon ake imiidiọọñọke Abasi adikara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:30">adika iso ñkọọk afia nnọọ mbon awo.<verse eid="JOB 34:30" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 34:31" />“Adieke awo abooho Abasi ate,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:31">‘Ami mmedue ado ndiinamma ndudue aba.<verse eid="JOB 34:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 34:32" />Ñkpeep miin se ami mmeñkanna ñkịt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:32">adieke adooho ami mmedue, ndiinamma ntoro aba.’<verse eid="JOB 34:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 34:33" />Ado nte Abasi akpena unọ fiin utịb akeene naña afo ayem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:33">ke ini afo asịnne adikappa esịd?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:33">Ana afo abiide, idooho ami;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:33">ke ntoro ndọkkọ miin se afo adiọọñọ.<verse eid="JOB 34:33" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 34:34" />“Ideen mme adiọọñọñkpọ ebo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:34">ideen mbon aniọñ e-eñkoppo miin embo miin,<verse eid="JOB 34:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 34:35" />‘Yoob atañ ikọ ke unana ifiọk;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:35">mme ikọ amọ inieghe aniọñ.’<verse eid="JOB 34:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOB 34:36" />O, akpekapado enenekke edomo Yoob ese</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:36">ke anye adibọọrọ nte awo ibak!<verse eid="JOB 34:36" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOB 34:37" />Anye aben nsọñiwuod adian ye idiọọkñkpọ amọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:37">ke emiom anye amia ubọk amọ ke iso ñnyịn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:37">anyʌñ anam mme ikọ amọ atọt ye Abasi.”<verse eid="JOB 34:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 34" />
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="JOB 35" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 35:1" />Ndin Elihu amaabo:<verse eid="JOB 35:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 35:2" />“Afo akere abo ke ami anen?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:2">Afo abo, ‘Ami mmenen, Abasi inenne.’<verse eid="JOB 35:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 35:3" />Ado afo abịp anye, ‘Nsoo ido udod mmi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:3">nsoo ñko ido udod mmi ke ami mmennamma idiọọkñkpọ?’<verse eid="JOB 35:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 35:4" />“Ami ñkpaama adubọọrọ fiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:4">ye mme ufan mfo ñko.<verse eid="JOB 35:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 35:5" />Dịppe anyen se mme hefịn nyʌñ kịt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:5">wuuk anyen se ntọñanyọñ ke ata anyọñ.<verse eid="JOB 35:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 35:6" />Adieke afo anamma idiọọkñkpọ, ado abeghe die anye?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:6">Adieke ndiọiñkpọ mfo ewakka, nsoo ke ado anam anọ anye?<verse eid="JOB 35:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 35:7" />Adieke afo adooho adinen, nsoo ke afo anọọ anye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:7">me nsoo ke anye ubọọ fiin ke ubọk?<verse eid="JOB 35:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 35:8" />Ibak mfo afịna uduud awo nte ndufo kpọd,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:8">ndin adinenido mfo anyʌñ atuuk mbon awo mfen.<verse eid="JOB 35:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 35:9" />“Mme awo etua ke idak akpọsọñ ufịk;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:9">ammọ eyem ufak eto ubọk mbon adudu.<verse eid="JOB 35:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 35:10" />Ado ibaaha awo ndomokeed se ibo, ‘Mmọ Abasi Andimbod miin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:10">ake anọọhọ ikwọ ke akonayio,<verse eid="JOB 35:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 35:11" />ake ikpeebe ñnyịn ñkpọ akan naña anye akpeep mme ndiọi unam ederimbod</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:11">anyʌñ anam ñnyịn idiọọñọ ñkpọ ikan mme inuen ke ikpaanyọñ?’<verse eid="JOB 35:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 35:12" />Anye isibọọrọke mme awo emaetua</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:12">ato ke ntak ñkokkoidem mbon ibak.<verse eid="JOB 35:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 35:13" />Ke akpanikọ, Abasi isikoppo ukpọk aseeme ammọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:13">Andikoñ Ñkan isinieghe ini inọ ñkpọ ntom.<verse eid="JOB 35:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 35:14" />Akañ ifañ ke anye adiikop</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:14">ke ini afo abooho ke imọ ikịtte anye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 35:14">ke ikpe mfo aba anye ke iso</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:14">ndin ana afo atie abet anye,<verse eid="JOB 35:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 35:15" />adian do, ke iyadesịd amọ isañake ye ufen</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:15">ndin ke anye ñko iseeghe ndoom.<verse eid="JOB 35:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 35:16" />Akem Yoob akʌppọ inua amọ ye ikpu-ikpu ikọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:16">ke unana ifiọk anye anam ikọ amọ atọt.”<verse eid="JOB 35:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 35" />
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="JOB 36" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 36:1" />Elihu amaakaa iso abo:<verse eid="JOB 36:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 36:2" />“Nie ime ye ami ke etək-etək ini ke ami ñyauwọt fiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:2">ke mme ñkpọ aba se ekeme editañ ke iwuod Abasi.<verse eid="JOB 36:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 36:3" />Ndat ifiọk mmi nto anyan usʌñ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:3">Andimbod miin ado andinie unen.<verse eid="JOB 36:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 36:4" />Nịm ke akpanikọ ke ikọ mmi idooho nsu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:4">awo a-anieghe mfọnmma ifiọk aba ye ndufo.<verse eid="JOB 36:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 36:5" />“Abasi anie adudu, ado anye isatta awo ndomokeed;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:5">anye anie adudu, anyʌñ anie nsọọñọnda ke uduak amọ.<verse eid="JOB 36:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 36:6" />Anye inịmme mme idiọọk awo uwem</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:6">ado anye anọ mbon e-efʌnnọke unen ammọ.<verse eid="JOB 36:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 36:7" />Anye isioho anyen amọ ifep ke idem ndinen awo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:7">anye adịppe ammọ adot ke ubọọñ ye ndidem</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:7">anyʌñ atooro ammọ ke nsi-nsi.<verse eid="JOB 36:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 36:8" />Ado adieke ebọppọ mme awo ke ñkprọñ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:8">enyʌñ ebọp ammọ ke mme udʌk nnananyen,<verse eid="JOB 36:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 36:9" />anye atañ anọ ammọ se ammọ enam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:9">ke ammọ enam idiọọkñkpọ ntañidem-ntañidem.<verse eid="JOB 36:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 36:10" />Anye anam ammọ ekpañ utọñ enọ ikọitem</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:10">anyʌñ adʌt ammọ utọñ ekappa esịd ekpọñ idiọọkñkpọ ammọ.<verse eid="JOB 36:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 36:11" />Adieke ammọ ekoppo item enyʌñ enam ñkpọ enọ anye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:11">ammọ eyaedu mme nsʌhọ usen uwem ammọ ke uforo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:11">ye mme isua uwem ammọ ke uyʌkkọ.<verse eid="JOB 36:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 36:12" />Ado adieke ammọ imiikpañña utọñ ikop,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:12">ammọ eyaetak ke akañkañ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:12">enyʌñ ekpañña ke unana ifiọk.<verse eid="JOB 36:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 36:13" />“Mbon i-imiidiọọñọke abasi ke esịd ammọ esua item;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:13">idem idaha anye abọppọ ammọ, ammọ ituaha iyem unwam.<verse eid="JOB 36:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 36:14" />Uwem ammọ aboiyo afep ke ini uyịn ammọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:14">ke atu mme ideen akpara e-ebaaha ke ñwommo.<verse eid="JOB 36:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 36:15" />Ado mbon ebọọhọ ufen, anye anyaaña asio ke ufen ammọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:15">anye atañ ikọ anọ ammọ ke mfịna ammọ.<verse eid="JOB 36:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 36:16" />“Anye utap fiin asio ke mbañ ukuud</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:16">akaa itie a-anwañake a-adooho adaña ndomokeed ibaaha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:16">akaa itie emem enịmme akpokoro edotto mme ataa nti ndidia.<verse eid="JOB 36:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 36:17" />Ado idahami afo amebọ ubiideikpe a-adotto ye awo ibak;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:17">ubiideikpe ye unenikpe umʌm fiin akama.<verse eid="JOB 36:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 36:18" />Kpeme idem mfo mbaak awo adidat inie utap fiin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:18">kuuyak ekamba ubọkedem udʌt fiin akpọñ usʌñ.<verse eid="JOB 36:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 36:19" />Nte imọ mfo ye afịd ukeme mfo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:19">ekeme edukama fiin mbaak afo uduba ke ufen?<verse eid="JOB 36:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 36:20" />Kuuyem akonayio,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:20">adidʌt mme awo nsioño ke ufọk idʌñ ammọ.<verse eid="JOB 36:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 36:21" />Kpeme mbaak afo udukappa udʌk idiọọkñkpọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:21">a-abaaha nte afo amemek akan ukuud.<verse eid="JOB 36:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 36:22" />“Edịppe Abasi ke adudu amọ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:22">Anie awo ido andikpeeb a-abaaha nte anye?<verse eid="JOB 36:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 36:23" />Anie awo ikeme adimek mme usʌñ amọ nnọọ anye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:23">me adibo anye, ‘Afo amenam adue’?<verse eid="JOB 36:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 36:24" />Toiyo aditooro utom amọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:24">a-mme awo etooroke ke ikwọ.<verse eid="JOB 36:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 36:25" />Afịd ubon awo ekịt anye;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:25">mme awo eda nsan-nsan ewuuk anyen ese anye.<verse eid="JOB 36:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 36:26" />Se naña Abasi akpon, akan ndiọọñọidem ñnyịn!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:26">Mme isua uwem amọ ewak ekan se ñnyịn ikpidiọọñọ.<verse eid="JOB 36:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 36:27" />“Anye akoot mme ntọi mmọọñ adọọk anyọñ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:27">anye adʌkkọke nte edịm akedọñọ ke idịm,<verse eid="JOB 36:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 36:28" />mme ntọñanyọñ eduọi mbara ammọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:28">ndin uwak mbara eduọiyọ ubon awo ke idem.<verse eid="JOB 36:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 36:29" />Akan anwaña anie naña anye atat mme ntọñanyọñ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:29">naña anye atop nte aduma ke ufọk idʌñ amọ?<verse eid="JOB 36:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 36:30" />Se naña anye asuan akebkeb amọ akanna idem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:30">akama ayet udem inyañ.<verse eid="JOB 36:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 36:31" />Usʌñ naña anye adat akara mme idịd ado ami</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:31">anyʌñ anọ ndidia barasuene.<verse eid="JOB 36:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 36:32" />Anye adọñ akebkeb ayọhọ ubọk amọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:32">anyʌñ anọ uyio ate yak aduma atop anịm idiọọñọ.<verse eid="JOB 36:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 36:33" />Aduma amọ anam ediọọñọ ke ayobio asʌk adi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:33">kpa mme enañ ñko enam nọ ediọọñọ ke asʌk adi.<verse eid="JOB 36:33" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter eid="JOB 36" />
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="JOB 37" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 37:1" />“Ke ami esịd mmi aduọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:1">anyʌñ atamma akpọñ itie amọ.<verse eid="JOB 37:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 37:2" />Kpañ utọñ! Kpañ utọñ nọ uyom uyio amọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:2">uyom a-atooho inua amọ.<verse eid="JOB 37:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 37:3" />Anye asaana akebkeb amọ ayaak ke idak afịd hefịn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:3">anyʌñ adọñ anye anọ mme utịd ederimbod.<verse eid="JOB 37:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 37:4" />Ke ado amaaboiyo, ayedo uyio ñkpo amọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:4">anye akpooro ye uyio akwa ubọọñ amọ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 37:4">Idaaha uyio amọ amaanake ayomo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:4">anye itegheke ube.<verse eid="JOB 37:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 37:5" />Uyio Abasi aduọ nte aduma ke mme ñyọọ-ñyọọ usʌñ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:5">anye anam ikpọ ñkpọ akan se ñnyịn idiọọñọ.<verse eid="JOB 37:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 37:6" />Anye abo sino ate, ‘Duọ ke ederimbod,’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:6">anyʌñ abo ñkeñe edịm, ‘Do ataa ekamba edịm.’<verse eid="JOB 37:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 37:7" />Nọ afịd awo se anye akebot ediọọñọ ubọkutom amọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:7">anye atre afịd awo adinam utom ammọ.<verse eid="JOB 37:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 37:8" />Mme unam efeeñe edịbe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:8">ammọ esʌhọ ke ndudu ammọ.<verse eid="JOB 37:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 37:9" />Ayobio ato ke ubeed amọ awuọ adi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:9">atueb ato ke afịm a-awatta adi.<verse eid="JOB 37:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 37:10" />Inweek Abasi asio ataa ndedeñ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:10">ndin mmọọñ a-atarake akpon akappa ais.<verse eid="JOB 37:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 37:11" />Anye afiik mme ntọñanyọñ ye mbara;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:11">anye asuan akebkeb ato do.<verse eid="JOB 37:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 37:12" />Ke ndadusʌñ amọ, ammọ eyʌt ekanna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:12">ke iso afịd ederimbod</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:12">adinam se anye awuuk ammọ.<verse eid="JOB 37:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 37:13" />Anye aben ntọñanyọñ adi adimia mme awo ufen,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:13">me adiduọk mmọọñ ke ederimbod amọ ñnyʌñ ñwọt ima amọ.<verse eid="JOB 37:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 37:14" />“Kpañ utọñ nọ ami, Yoob;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:14">tuak da diin, nyʌñ kere baña mme utịppeñkpọ Abasi.<verse eid="JOB 37:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 37:15" />Afo amediọọñọ naña Abasi akara mme ntọñanyọñ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:15">anyʌñ anam akebkeb amọ amịneñ?<verse eid="JOB 37:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 37:16" />Nte afo amediọọñọ naña mme ntọñanyọñ ekọñọ ke ikpaanyọñ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:16">mme utịppeñkpọ ami, anie awo anie ayọhọ-ayọhọ ifiọk?<verse eid="JOB 37:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 37:17" />Afo a-asịneke afọñ a-anamma yak idem ufiop</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:17">ke idaha isọñ anaaha sʌñ-sʌñ ke ini afịm usuuk,<verse eid="JOB 37:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 37:18" />nte afo amekeme adidiana ye anye ke aditat ikpaanyọñ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:18">a-asọọñọ nte ukịdiso e-enamma ke brọns?<verse eid="JOB 37:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 37:19" />“Temme ñnyịn se akpenaa ñnyịn itañ inọ anye;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:19">ñnyịn ikanna iben ikpe ñnyịn iwọt ke ntak ake ñnyịn ibaaha ke ekịm.<verse eid="JOB 37:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 37:20" />Me akpena ebo anye ke ami mmeyem aditañ ikọ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:20">Me aba awo se ikpibo yak eben imọ emen?<verse eid="JOB 37:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 37:21" />Awo ndomokeed ikemeke adisak anyen nse utịn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:21">ke naña anye ayamma ke ikpaanyọñ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:21">ke idaha afịm amaakekwọọk ammọ nọ asana.<verse eid="JOB 37:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 37:22" />Ke awuọhọ ato adoro-adoro ako anye adi ye mmọnyọ amọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:22">Abasi adi ke uteeñe ubọọñ amọ.<verse eid="JOB 37:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 37:23" />Andikoñ Ñkan idooho se ñnyịn ikeme adisịme ndin anye anyʌñ akpon ke adudu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:23">ke unenikpe ye ekamba adinenido amọ, anye ifiighe awo.<verse eid="JOB 37:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 37:24" />Ke ntoro, mme awo eteeñe anye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:24">ado nte anye inieghe ukpono inọ afịd mbon aniọñ ke esịd ammọ?”<verse eid="JOB 37:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 37" />
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="JOB 38" />
  <para style="s1">
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Atañ Ikọ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 38:1" />Akem <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaatañ ikọ anọ Yoob ke ayobio. Anye amaabo:<verse eid="JOB 38:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 38:2" />“Anie awo ado ami a-abiọọñọke uduak mmi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:2">ke mme ikọ ake ifiọk imiibaaha?”<verse eid="JOB 38:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 38:3" />Bọbọ mbọbọ ndin ke isịn mfo nte awodeen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:3">Ami ñyaubịp fiin mbuume,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:3">ndin afo ayambọọrọ miin.<verse eid="JOB 38:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 38:4" />“Afo akeba mọọ ini ami ñkesịnne itiad idakisọñ ederimbod?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:4">Tañ nnọ miin, adieke adooho unwaña fiin.<verse eid="JOB 38:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 38:5" />Anie ikinịm mme adaña amọ? Ke akpanikọ mmenịm ke afo amediọọñọ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:5">Anie akenyʌñ anyan udʌk udomoñkpọ akanna anye?<verse eid="JOB 38:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 38:6" />Ukod ndibene amọ akewʌhọ ke nsoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:6">me anie awo akewuuk mme itiad inuuk amọ,<verse eid="JOB 38:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 38:7" />ke idaha mme ntantaafiọñ ubakusen ekekwọọhọ uyio keed</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:7">ndin afịd mme enyere emaesio ñkpo idaara?<verse eid="JOB 38:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 38:8" />“Anie awo ikibet usʌñ ibaaha akpainyañ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:8">ke idaha anye akebịmmeke awuọ ke idịb,<verse eid="JOB 38:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 38:9" />ke ini ñkekịmme afọñ nsịn ntọñanyọñ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:9">ñnyʌñ ñwañ anye ke akpọsọñ ekịm,<verse eid="JOB 38:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 38:10" />ke idahami ñkewuuhọ mme adaña nnọ anye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:10">ñnyʌñ nsịn mme eto usịnusʌñ ye itịm nnọ anye,<verse eid="JOB 38:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 38:11" />ini ami ñkebooho nte, ‘Se itie ami ke afo anie aditre ndin inaaha abọhọ itie ami;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:11">itie ami ke ntañidem mbufịd mfo adiitre’?<verse eid="JOB 38:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 38:12" />“Tọọñọ akenam afo amenọ ubakusen iwuuk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:12">me adiwọt usiere itie amọ,<verse eid="JOB 38:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 38:13" />nọ anye amʌm ederimbod ke mme mben amọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:13">anyʌñ anyeghe mbon ibak asioño aduọọñọ?<verse eid="JOB 38:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 38:14" />Ederimbod aba nte aduañ emịññe ke idak umịññkpọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:14">mme ndidoidem amọ ewuọñọ eda nte ake afọñidem.<verse eid="JOB 38:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 38:15" />Enyịm mme idiọọk awo unwana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:15">ndin ebuuñ ubọk ake ammọ edịppeke.<verse eid="JOB 38:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 38:16" />“Nte afo amenam isañ akpa akaa mme ntịppe akpainyañ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:16">me amesaña ke udem akpa?<verse eid="JOB 38:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 38:17" />Nte uwọt fiin inuaatob abioekpo?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:17">Nte afo amekịt mme inuaatob ntotəño ekịm?<verse eid="JOB 38:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 38:18" />Nte mme ekamba ukpa ederimbod ado ñkpọ se unwaña fiin?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:18">Tañ nnọ miin, me afo amediọọñọ afịd ñkpọ ami.<verse eid="JOB 38:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 38:19" />“Uke ado usʌñ e-esañake eka itieidʌñ unwana?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:19">Ke mmọọ ke ekịm adʌñ?<verse eid="JOB 38:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 38:20" />Nte afo amekeme adiben ammọ ñkaa itie ammọ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:20">Afo amediọọñọ usʌñ a-akaaha mme itieidʌñ ammọ?<verse eid="JOB 38:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 38:21" />Ke akpanikọ afo amediọọñọ, sia afo amaamamana!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:21">Afo amedu uwem ke ataa uwak isua!<verse eid="JOB 38:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 38:22" />“Nte afo amedʌk mme itie unịm ñkpọ ake sino</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:22">me amekịt mme itie unịm ñkpọ ake edịmitiad,<verse eid="JOB 38:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 38:23" />ake ami nnịmme nnọ ini afanekọñ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:23">nnọ mme usen ekọñ ye anwan?<verse eid="JOB 38:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 38:24" />Usʌñ uke aka itie akebkeb asisuanake,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:24">me itie afịm usakkautịn asikisuanna ke afịd ederimbod?<verse eid="JOB 38:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 38:25" />Anie ikpịkke afañ inịm inọ edịm,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:25">anyʌñ asiak usʌñ ake aduma asañake,<verse eid="JOB 38:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 38:26" />adiduọk mmọọñ ke isọñ awo imiidʌññọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:26">akpautatan awo ndomokeed imiidʌññọ,<verse eid="JOB 38:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 38:27" />adinọ isọñ a-adooho ada inemesịd</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:27">anyʌñ anam mbid atịppe ke anye?<verse eid="JOB 38:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 38:28" />Nte edịm anie ete?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:28">Anie ado ete anọ ntọi mbara?<verse eid="JOB 38:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 38:29" />Idịb anie ke ntuhube aketo adi?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:29">Anie akeman ndedeñ aketooho anyọñ<verse eid="JOB 38:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 38:30" />idaha mmọọñ amaakesọọñ nte itiad,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:30">idaha anyọñ udem amaasọọñ?<verse eid="JOB 38:30" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 38:31" />“Nte afo amekeme adikọp mme ñkprọñ mbon Pleiades?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:31">Nte afo amekeme aditaat ñkpahaisịn ntantaafiọñ e-ekoodo Orion?<verse eid="JOB 38:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 38:32" />Nte afo amekeme adikoono mme udịm anyọñ ndi ke ayọhọ ini ammọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:32">me amekeme adiben Bee ye nditọ amọ ñwuọ ndi?<verse eid="JOB 38:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 38:33" />Afo amediọọñọ mme mbed mme hefịn?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:33">Nte afo amekeme adinam ukara Abasi atara ke ederimbod?<verse eid="JOB 38:33" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 38:34" />“Nte afo amekeme adidịppe uyio mfo nnọọ mme ntọñanyọñ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:34">anyʌñ afʌk idem mfo ye mfiọọrọ mmọọñ?<verse eid="JOB 38:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 38:35" />Ado nte afo adọñ mme akebkeb ke usʌñ ammọ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:35">Ado nte ammọ esiben etob usọk fiin, ‘Se ñnyịn mmi’?<verse eid="JOB 38:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOB 38:36" />Anie inọ mme inuen aniọñ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:36">me anie inọ akikọunen ndiọọñọidem?<verse eid="JOB 38:36" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOB 38:37" />Anie awo anie aniọñ adibat mme ntọñanyọñ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:37">Anie awo ikeme adikaaña mme abañ mmọọñ ake mme hefịn<verse eid="JOB 38:37" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JOB 38:38" />ke ini ntọñ amaasọọñ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:38">ndin mme akpʌk isọñ ediana keed?<verse eid="JOB 38:38" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JOB 38:39" />“Nte afo asiyem ñkpọ ndidia anọọ uman ekpe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:39">anyʌñ anam mme ekpe eyʌkkọ ndidia<verse eid="JOB 38:39" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JOB 38:40" />ke ini ammọ enaaha ke itie idʌñ ammọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:40">me edịbeke ebem ke ekamba akai ikọd?<verse eid="JOB 38:40" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JOB 38:41" />Anie inọ mme ekọọñebʌkayob ndidia</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:41">idaha ntək nditọ amọ etuaha enọ Abasi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:41">enyʌñ edutịn ke ntak unana ndidia?<verse eid="JOB 38:41" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter eid="JOB 38" />
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="JOB 39" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 39:1" />“Nte afo amediọọñọ idaha se mme ebod e-edʌñọke ke ikpọabod esiman uman?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:1">Nte afo amekeme adikpeme idaha edob amanna ñyịn amọ?<verse eid="JOB 39:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 39:2" />Nte afo amesibat mme afiọñ mbemiso ammọ eman?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:2">Nte afo amediọọñọ ini ammọ emanna uman?<verse eid="JOB 39:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 39:3" />Ammọ enʌhọ ke isọñ enyʌñ eman ñyịn;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:3">ubiak uman ammọ a-akweeñe.<verse eid="JOB 39:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 39:4" />Nditọ ammọ ekọt, ekpoon enyʌñ esọñ idem ke esịd ikọd;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:4">ammọ edakka ekaa inyʌññọ itịmme inyọñ idi aba.<verse eid="JOB 39:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 39:5" />“Anie awo isaana dọñki ikọd iyaak nnọ asaña naña ama?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:5">Anie awo ikitat udʌk amọ?<verse eid="JOB 39:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 39:6" />Ami mmaayaak anaan isọñ ado nnọ anye nte itieidʌñ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:6">mme inʌñ-inʌñ isọñ nte itie idʌñ amọ.<verse eid="JOB 39:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 39:7" />Anye asak ke ntịme a-abaaha ke isọñ abio;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:7">anye ikoppo naña awaduwad abọñ ñkpo.<verse eid="JOB 39:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 39:8" />Anye asaaña ke mme abod ayeem ndidia amọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:8">anye anyʌñ ayeem ñkpọ ndomokeed se ido awawa.<verse eid="JOB 39:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 39:9" />“Nte ayaaraenañ ikọd ayaanyịmme adinam ñkpọ unọọ fiin?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:9">Nte anye ayaanyịmme adiba ke itie usịnudia ufene mfo ke akonayio?<verse eid="JOB 39:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 39:10" />Nte afo amekeme adimʌm anye ke idʌk enañ ufʌñisọñ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:10">Nte anye ayaakeme adidọk abedeñ ke edem mfo?<verse eid="JOB 39:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 39:11" />Nte afo uduubuọt idem ke anye sia adudu amọ akpon?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:11">Nte afo ayaakpọñ akpọsọñ utom mfo anọ anye?<verse eid="JOB 39:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 39:12" />Nte afo amenịm ke anye ayaabiom ñkpasi mfo akaa ufọk</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:12">anyʌñ akoono ammọ abon ke afe ubeek abakpa mfo?<verse eid="JOB 39:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 39:13" />“Mme mba ọstrik emia ke inemesịd,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:13">akpesʌkado awo idiikanna iben ammọ idomo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:13">ye mme mba ikpañinyañ.<verse eid="JOB 39:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 39:14" />Anye adọñ ñkwa amọ ke isọñ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:14">anyʌñ ayaak anye afiop ke ntañ,<verse eid="JOB 39:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 39:15" />ikereke ibo ke ukod akeme adifiik ammọ mboom,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:15">ke mme unam ikọd enyʌñ ekeme edinuak ammọ mboom.<verse eid="JOB 39:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 39:16" />Anye akama nditọ amọ ke akpọsọñ ubọk, nte idooho nditọ amọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:16">anye ikereke me ufen amọ akedo ke ikpu-ikpu,<verse eid="JOB 39:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 39:17" />sia Abasi ikinọọhọ anye aniọñ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:17">inyʌññọ inọ anye eti iwuod.<verse eid="JOB 39:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 39:18" />Ado anye amaatat mme mba amọ adifeghe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:18">anye asasak enañmbakara ye andiwad anye.<verse eid="JOB 39:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 39:19" />“Nte afo anọọ enañmbakara adudu amọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:19">me afo asịn itọñ amọ ye anyan ided itọñ amọ?<verse eid="JOB 39:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 39:20" />Nte afo akenam anye atamma nte ñkukuñkpọyọriyọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:20">asịn ndịk ke akpọsọñ uyio amọ?<verse eid="JOB 39:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 39:21" />Anye adọk isọñ ke adudu, adaara ke adudu amọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:21">ke ini anyʌññọ awuọ aka ekọñ.<verse eid="JOB 39:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 39:22" />Anye asasak ndịk, inyʌññọ ibaak ñkpọ ndomokeed;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:22">inyʌññọ ibaak akañkañ.<verse eid="JOB 39:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 39:23" />Idañ anyeeñe anye ke ñkañ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:23">asaaña ye nsem-nsem eduad ye akañkañ.<verse eid="JOB 39:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 39:24" />Anye aben isọñ ata ato ke akpọsọñ nduduai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:24">anye ikanna isọọñọ ida ke adukpoñ amaasio uyio.<verse eid="JOB 39:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 39:25" />Ke anye akoppo uyio adukpoñ, anye ate, ‘Aha!’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:25">Anye akop ufịk ekọñ ke anyan usʌñ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:25">ñkpo mme adaiso ekọñ ye uyom mbon ekọñ.<verse eid="JOB 39:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 39:26" />“Nte aniọñ mfo anam nọ ndukpo afeghe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:26">anyʌñ atat mba amọ aka usuuk?<verse eid="JOB 39:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 39:27" />Nte ntrukpuum afuurọ ke uyio mfo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:27">anyʌñ abọp efọk amọ ke anyọñ?<verse eid="JOB 39:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 39:28" />Anye adʌñ ke abaitiad anyʌñ aba do ke akonayio;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:28">abaitiad ado itie se anye adịp idem.<verse eid="JOB 39:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 39:29" />Ndo ke anye atie ayem ndidia;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:29">anyen amọ akịt ndidia ado ke anyan usʌñ.<verse eid="JOB 39:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 39:30" />Ntək nditọ amọ enyʌñ edia usọrọ ke iyiib,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:30">ndin itie ake mme akpo ebaaha, kpasʌk do ke anye aba.”<verse eid="JOB 39:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 39" />
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="JOB 40" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 40:1" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Yoob ate:<verse eid="JOB 40:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 40:2" />“Nte anye a-atọhọke ye Andikponñkan ayaanekke anye?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:2">Yak awo a-akịtte ndudue anọ Abasi abọọrọ anye!”<verse eid="JOB 40:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 40:3" />Ndin Yoob amaabọọrọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>:<verse eid="JOB 40:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 40:4" />“Ami ndotto, nduubọọrọ fiin die?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:4">Ami ndat ubọk mmi mfʌk ke inua mmi.<verse eid="JOB 40:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 40:5" />Ami mmaatañ ikọ ini keed, ado ami nnieghe ibọọrọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:5">akañ iba, ndin ami ndiitañña ikọ aba.”<verse eid="JOB 40:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 40:6" />Akem <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaatañ ikọ anọ Yoob ke ayobio:<verse eid="JOB 40:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 40:7" />“Bọbọ mbọbọ ndin ke isịn nte awodeen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:7">Ami ñyaubịp fiin mbuume,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:7">ndin afo ayambọọrọ miin.”<verse eid="JOB 40:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 40:8" />“Nte afo ayaabo ke ikpe mmi inenne?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:8">Nte afo ayambiom miin ikpe nọ ato do afo anie unen?<verse eid="JOB 40:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 40:9" />Nte afo amenie ubọk a-atieghe nte ake Abasi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:9">nte uyio mfo akeme adisọñ nte uyio amọ?<verse eid="JOB 40:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 40:10" />Ndin dat ubọọñ ye mmọnyọ bana idem mfo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:10">nyʌñ dat ukpono ye uyai sịne ke idem mfo.<verse eid="JOB 40:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 40:11" />Nwañña afịd iyadesịd mfo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:11">se afịd mbon se ikokko idem nyʌñ suuhọ ammọ nịm ke isọñ,<verse eid="JOB 40:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 40:12" />se afịd mbon se iwọt idem nyʌñ suuhọ ammọ itie</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:12">nuak ndiọi awo ke itie a-ammọ edaaha.<verse eid="JOB 40:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 40:13" />Buuk afịd ammọ ke abu ini keed;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:13">nyʌñ fʌk iso ammọ ke udi.<verse eid="JOB 40:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 40:14" />Ndin ami ke idem mmi ñyaanyịmme ye afo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:14">ke ubọk nnasia mfo akeme adunyaaña fiin.<verse eid="JOB 40:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 40:15" />“Se Behemọd,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:15">a-ami ñkenamma ye afo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:15">a-anyʌññọ ata mbid nte ayaaraenañ.<verse eid="JOB 40:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 40:16" />Kap se adudu se anye anie ke isịn amọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:16">kap se inweek se iba ke asịb idịb amọ!<verse eid="JOB 40:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 40:17" />Isịm amọ anyeeñe nte eto sida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:17">mme asịb ifʌkkọ amọ adudiana-adudiana.<verse eid="JOB 40:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 40:18" />Mme akpọ amọ edo mme akpọ e-enamma ke brọns,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:18">Ukod ye ubọk amọ ebit esañ ukwak.<verse eid="JOB 40:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 40:19" />Anye ado akpa ke atu mme ubọkutom Abasi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:19">ado Andinam anye akeme adibịne anye ye akañkañ amọ.<verse eid="JOB 40:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 40:20" />Mme abod enyʌñ edat mme mfịd inwañ ammọ esọk anye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:20">ndin afịd mme unam ikọd ebre mbre ekpere anye.<verse eid="JOB 40:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 40:21" />Anye anaa ke idak mfañ lotus,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:21">ke idak ñnyanyaha ke adeb.<verse eid="JOB 40:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 40:22" />Mme lotus edịb anye ke ndukpọñ ammọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:22">Mme ikpọ eto ke mben idịm ekanna anye ekʌk;<verse eid="JOB 40:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 40:23" />Uyom mmọọñ inyañ idịkkeke anye;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:23">anye anie nsọọñọnda, akpesʌkado Yọdan abịmmeke asịm anye inua.<verse eid="JOB 40:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 40:24" />Nte aba awo a-akemeke adimʌm anye ke anyen,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:24">me adikọọk afia mmʌm anye ñnyʌñ ntịppe anye iwuo?<verse eid="JOB 40:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter eid="JOB 40" />
  <chapter number="41" style="c" sid="JOB 41" />
  <para style="q1">
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">41: </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Ke ikpañwed Hibru, Yoob 41:1-8 ewet nte Yoob 40:25-32, ñko Yoob 41:9-34 ewet Yoob 41:1-26.</char>
    </note> <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 41:1" />“Nte afo amekeme adidat uwaam iyak ndʌt idiọọk unam mmọọñ nsio</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:1">me amekeme adibọp edeme amọ nnịm ke udʌk?<verse eid="JOB 41:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 41:2" />Nte afo amekeme adidat udʌk nsịn ke iwuo amọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:2">me aditịppe mbañ amọ ke ekọb?<verse eid="JOB 41:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 41:3" />Nte anye ayaakaa iso ukpeiye fiin ayem mbọm?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:3">Nte anye ayaatañ ikọ unọ fiin usʌk-usʌk?<verse eid="JOB 41:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 41:4" />Nte anye ayaanam edioomo ye afo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:4">nọ afo adiidat anye nte afʌn mfo ke nsi-nsi?<verse eid="JOB 41:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 41:5" />Nte afo amekeme adinam anye ñkpọ mbre nte inuen</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:5">me anyʌñ atobo anye ke udʌk anọ mme ubọikpa ke atʌñ mfo?<verse eid="JOB 41:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 41:6" />Nte mme anyam udua eyaenyịmme udua amọ nte ñkpọ udua?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:6">Nte ammọ eyaebakka anye ke atu mme anyam udua?<verse eid="JOB 41:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 41:7" />Nte afo amekeme adiyọhọ ikpọkidem amọ ke mme usaam</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:7">me iwuod amọ ke eduad ukọ iyak?<verse eid="JOB 41:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 41:8" />Adieke afo adotto ubọk mfo ke idem amọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:8">afo ayaatoiyo nsiiñe ado ndin afo uduunamma ntoro aba!<verse eid="JOB 41:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 41:9" />Adinie idodanyen ke amekeme adikan anye udịd ado nsu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:9">ñkaña adisese anye ke anyen ado ñkpọ a-abọọhọ awo udịd.<verse eid="JOB 41:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 41:10" />Ibaaha awo ndomokeed a-anieghe uko a-akpekanna ademme anye.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:10">Anie ndin akeme adimbiọñọ miin ke iso?<verse eid="JOB 41:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 41:11" />Anie awo ke ami ñkama isọn a-anaaha nte ami ñkpe?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:11">Afịd ñkpọ ke idak hefịn annie miin.<verse eid="JOB 41:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 41:12" />“Ami ndiitreke aditañ ikọ mbaña ukod idiọọk unam mmọọñ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:12">adudu ye uyai a-anye anieghe.<verse eid="JOB 41:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 41:13" />Anie awo ikan iyaara ikpaidem amọ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:13">Anie awo ikan itịppe adudu ke adiana mba afọñ ekọñ amọ?<verse eid="JOB 41:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 41:14" />Anie akpedomo adibeere mme usʌñ inua amọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:14">akannake anye akʌk ayọhọ ye mme aniendịk eded?<verse eid="JOB 41:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 41:15" />Edem amọ anie mme udịm atuekọñ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:15">enekkeke ebọp ammọ edudian keed;<verse eid="JOB 41:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 41:16" />keed adiana ye emọ-emọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:16">afịm ikemeke adiboiyo ke ufọọd ammọ.<verse eid="JOB 41:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 41:17" />Ammọ ediana keed esọọñọ emʌm idem ammọ ekama;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:17">ammọ ediana keed tutu awo ikemeke adidiañña ammọ.<verse eid="JOB 41:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 41:18" />Inweek amọ asio amịneñmịneñ unwana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:18">anyen amọ abit nduwai usiere.<verse eid="JOB 41:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 41:19" />Mme edemeikañ etop ewuọñọ anye ke inua;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:19">mme nduwai ikañ etop ewuọñọ eto anye.<verse eid="JOB 41:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 41:20" />Nsʌñikañ awuọñọ anye ke iwuo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:20">nte awuọ ke ako etemme ke ñnyanyaha.<verse eid="JOB 41:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 41:21" />Inweek amọ anam eboho ikañ abịppe asak,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:21">edemeikañ anyʌñ awuọ ke inua amọ.<verse eid="JOB 41:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 41:22" />Adudu adʌñ ke itọñ amọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:22">ndịk anyʌñ abem anye iso.<verse eid="JOB 41:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 41:23" />Mme eboho ikpọkidem amọ ediana keed nsọọñ-nsọọñ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:23">ammọ esọọñ, awo ikanna idiañña.<verse eid="JOB 41:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 41:24" />Esịd amọ asaat nte akpọsọñ itiad,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:24">asọọñ nte eka itiad.<verse eid="JOB 41:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 41:25" />Anye amaadakka ida, mme ñkpisọñ ekop akpọsọñ ñnyeñidem;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:25">ammọ etịmme edem mbemiso anye abenne idem.<verse eid="JOB 41:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 41:26" />Akañkañ a-asịmeke anye ibaaha ufọn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:26">me eduad me usaam me yafeliin, ñko ibaññake ufọn.<verse eid="JOB 41:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 41:27" />Anye adat ukwak nte ñnyanyaha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:27">anyʌñ adat brọns nte ñkpaikpa eto.<verse eid="JOB 41:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 41:28" />Idañ inamma anye afeghe itọk;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:28">itiad e-etoppo eba anye nte mbio.<verse eid="JOB 41:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 41:29" />Ikpitịketo anyʌñ aba anye nte mbio;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:29">anye asasaak unyeeñe eduad.<verse eid="JOB 41:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 41:30" />Idakidem amọ ado ñkpasi usiọñ a-asọppọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:30">anyʌñ anịm idiọọñọ nte ñkpọ ukọkñkpọ.<verse eid="JOB 41:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 41:31" />Anye anam udem afuut nte ako e-etemme adan afịt</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:31">anyʌñ akaama inyañ nte awo akaama ako e-etemme adan.<verse eid="JOB 41:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 41:32" />Anye amaaboiyo anịm udịm a-asemmesem ke edem amọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:32">awo a-akeme adikere ke utʌñọ mmọọñ a-anie mfia ided.<verse eid="JOB 41:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 41:33" />Ibaaha ñkpọ ndomokeed ke ederimbod a-adooho ukem ye anye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:33">unam ake imiikoppo ndịk ndomokeed.<verse eid="JOB 41:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 41:34" />Anye ase mbon se ikokko idem ke ndek;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:34">anye ado adidem afịd ñkpọ se ikokko idem.”<verse eid="JOB 41:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 41" />
  <chapter number="42" style="c" sid="JOB 42" />
  <para style="s1">Yoob</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 42:1" />Ndin Yoob amaabọọrọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ate:<verse eid="JOB 42:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 42:2" />“Ami mmediọọñọ ke afo amekeme adinam afịd ñkpọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 42:2">ibaaha uduak mfo ndomokeed ekemeke edibiat.<verse eid="JOB 42:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 42:3" />Afo amaabịp, ‘Anie awo ido ami a-abiọọñọke mme uduak mmi ke unana ifiọk?’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 42:3">Ke akpanikọ ami mmaatañ ikọ mbaña mme ñkpọ se imiikiñnwañake miin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 42:3">mme ñkpọ e-edooho ataa utịppeñkpọ ekan se ami ndiọọñọ.<verse eid="JOB 42:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 42:4" />“Afo amaabo, ‘Kpañ utọñ idahami, ndin ke ami ñyaatañ ikọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 42:4">Ami ñyaubịp fiin mbuume,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 42:4">ndin afo ayambọọrọ miin.’<verse eid="JOB 42:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 42:5" />Utọñ mmi amaakop ubaña fiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 42:5">ado idahami anyen mmi ukịt fiin.<verse eid="JOB 42:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 42:6" />Ke ntoro ami mmesua idem mmi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 42:6">ndin mmenyʌñ ñkappa esịd ntie ke abu ye ke ntọñ.”<verse eid="JOB 42:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Akpatre ikọ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 42:7" />Ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaaketañ mme ñkpọ ami anọ Yoob ama, anye amaabo Elifas awo Teman, “Ami mmeyat esịd ye afo ye mme ufan mfo iba, ke ntak a-adooho afo utañña akpanikọ umbaña miin, nte awo mmi Yoob atañña. <verse eid="JOB 42:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 42:8" />Ndin idahami ndufo iben ñyaaraenañ itiaba mme akukịmedọñ itiaba inyʌñ ikaa ibịne awo mmi Yoob ikiwa ufọfọb uwa ibaña idem ndufo. Isʌñutom mmi Yoob ayaabọñ akam inọ ndufo, ndin ami ñyaakop akam amọ, ndin ami ndiinọọhọ ndufo ufen ñkeene ndisịme ido ndufo. Ndufo itañña akpanikọ imbaña miin, nte naña isʌñutom mmi Yoob atañ.” <verse eid="JOB 42:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 42:9" />Ndin Elifas awo Teman, Bildad awo Suu mme Sofa a-atooho Naama emaenam se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akebo ammọ enam; ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabọ akam Yoob.<verse eid="JOB 42:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 42:10" />Ke Yoob amaakebọñ akam anọ mme ufan amọ ama, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaamaana anọ anye mme inie amọ anyʌñ anọ anye utịme ñkemba mme inie se anye akenenie akpa. <verse eid="JOB 42:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 42:11" />Afịd nditọeka amọ ideen ye ibaan ye afịd awo se ikidiọọñọ anye emaedi edidia ñkpọ ye anye ke ufọk amọ. Ammọ emaeseeme mme anye enyʌñ edọñ anye esịd ebaña afịd mme ñkpọntịppe se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akenam nọ asịm anye, ammọ keedekeed emaenọ anye mbaak silfa keed ye ñkpannuun kold keed.<verse eid="JOB 42:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 42:12" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaadiọñ utịd ini uwem Yoob akan ntọọñọ uwem amọ. Anye amaanie edọñ tọsịn duob mme inaañ (14,000), kamel tọsịn itiokeed (6,000), ñyaaraenañ e-enamma utom tọsịn keed (1,000) ye dọñki tọsịn keed (1,000). <verse eid="JOB 42:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 42:13" />Ndin anye amaanyʌñ anie nditọ ideen itiaba ye nditọ ibaan ita. <verse eid="JOB 42:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 42:14" />Anye akesio adiaha amọ Yemaima, udiana anye asio Kesia anyʌñ asio ayọhọ ita Keren-Hapuk. <verse eid="JOB 42:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 42:15" />Ikibaaha ke afịd isọñ ado nte ekekịt ibaan se ikiyaiya nte nditọ ibaan Yoob, ndin ete ammọ amaanọ ammọ udeeme inie ammọ ye nditọeka ammọ ideen.<verse eid="JOB 42:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 42:16" />Ke mme ñkpọ ami amaakeboiyo, Yoob amaadu uwem isua ikie keed mme aba (140); anye amaakịt nditọ ye nditọnditọ amọ tutu awuọ ayọhọ ubon inaañ. <verse eid="JOB 42:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 42:17" />Ndin Yoob amaakpa, akaanadeen anyʌñ ayọhọ ye isua.<verse eid="JOB 42:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 42" />
</usx>